#. placeholders: {countdown}
msgid ""
"Keepsakes. None yet: Easter morning opens on Easter Sunday. {countdown}"
msgstr "記念品。まだありません。イースターの朝は、イースターの日曜日に開きます。{countdown}"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "None yet: Easter morning opens on Easter Sunday."
msgstr "まだありません。イースターの朝は、イースターの日曜日に開きます。"

#. placeholders: {lines}
msgid "Keepsakes. {lines}"
msgstr "記念品。{lines}"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Relaxed keepsakes."
msgstr "ゆったりの記念品。"

#. placeholders: {lines}
msgid "Relaxed keepsakes. {lines}"
msgstr "ゆったりの記念品。{lines}"

msgid "1 golden egg"
msgstr "金の卵1個"

#. placeholders: {n}
msgid "{n} golden eggs"
msgstr "金の卵{n}個"

#. placeholders: {year}, {best_word}, {best}, {golden}
msgid "Easter {year}: {best_word} {best}, {golden} in one hunt."
msgstr "{year}年のイースター：{best_word}{best}、一回の卵探しで{golden}。"

msgid ""
"Easter: run the meadow lanes catching falling eggs in your basket, and "
"dodge the mud."
msgstr "イースター：草原のレーンを走って落ちてくる卵をかごで受け止め、泥をよけましょう。"

msgid "meadow"
msgstr "草原"

#. placeholders: {best_line}
msgid "Endless meadow: {best_line}."
msgstr "エンドレスの草原：{best_line}。"

msgid "endless"
msgstr "エンドレス"

msgid "Endless meadow: locked until the meadow is cleared."
msgstr "エンドレスの草原：草原をクリアするまで未解放。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Records."
msgstr "記録。"

#. placeholders: {meadow}, {cleared}, {ROUNDS}, {endless}
msgid ""
"Records. The meadow: {meadow}, {cleared} of {ROUNDS} rounds cleared. "
"{endless}"
msgstr "記録。草原：{meadow}、{ROUNDS}ラウンド中{cleared}ラウンドクリア。{endless}"

#. placeholders: {meadow}, {cleared}, {ROUNDS}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "The meadow: {meadow}, {cleared} of {ROUNDS} rounds cleared."
msgstr "草原：{meadow}、{ROUNDS}ラウンド中{cleared}ラウンドクリア。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Challenges."
msgstr "チャレンジ。"

#. placeholders: {join}
msgid "Challenges. {join}"
msgstr "チャレンジ。{join}"

msgid "easter morning"
msgstr "イースターの朝"

#. placeholders: {best}
msgid "Endless meadow, {best}"
msgstr "エンドレスの草原、{best}"

msgid ""
"Rounds without end, faster each time, with no egg target: play until your "
"baskets are gone. Every fifth cracked egg breaks a basket."
msgstr "終わりがなく毎回速くなる、卵の目標数のないラウンドです。かごがなくなるまで遊びましょう。卵が五個割れるごとに、かごがひとつ壊れます。"

msgid "Endless meadow"
msgstr "エンドレスの草原"

#. placeholders: {ROUNDS}
msgid ""
"The endless meadow opens once you clear all {ROUNDS} rounds of the meadow."
msgstr "エンドレスの草原は、草原の{ROUNDS}ラウンドをすべてクリアすると開きます。"

#. placeholders: {ROUNDS}
msgid "Clear all {ROUNDS} rounds of the meadow to open rounds without end."
msgstr "草原の{ROUNDS}ラウンドをすべてクリアすると、終わりのないラウンドが開きます。"

#. placeholders: {PLAY}, {meadow_best}
msgid "{PLAY}, the meadow, {meadow_best}"
msgstr "{PLAY}、草原、{meadow_best}"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Each round needs a share of its eggs banked before the bell."
msgstr "各ラウンドで、鐘の前に決まった数の卵を納める必要があります。"

#. placeholders: {ROUNDS}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{ROUNDS} rounds, from three lanes to five, with 3 baskets."
msgstr "{ROUNDS}ラウンド、レーンは三つから五つ、かごは3個です。"

#. placeholders: {ROUNDS}, {cleared}
msgid ""
"{ROUNDS} rounds, from three lanes to five, with 3 baskets. Each round needs "
"a share of its eggs banked before the bell. {cleared} of {ROUNDS} cleared "
"so far."
msgstr ""
"{ROUNDS}ラウンド、レーンは三つから五つ、かごは3個です。各ラウンドで、鐘の前に決まった数の卵を納める必要があります。ここまで{ROUNDS}中{"
"cleared}クリア。"

#. placeholders: {cleared}, {ROUNDS}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{cleared} of {ROUNDS} cleared so far."
msgstr "ここまで{ROUNDS}中{cleared}クリア。"

msgid "Practice lanes"
msgstr "練習レーン"

msgid ""
"Three slow lanes with every kind of drop, each explained the first time it "
"falls. Nothing costs a basket and no score is saved."
msgstr ""
"ゆっくりの三つのレーンで、すべての種類のものが落ちてきて、初めて落ちるときに説明があります。かごを失うことはなく、スコアも保存されません。"

msgid ""
"Your best scores, the rounds you have cleared, your Easter keepsakes and "
"your challenge results. Enter turns the page."
msgstr "自己ベスト、クリアしたラウンド、イースターの記念品、チャレンジの結果です。Enterでページをめくります。"

msgid "Each sound you need in the meadow, with its name."
msgstr "草原で必要なサウンドを、名前つきで。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"The daily twist, the weekly marathon and the monthly Easter festival: the "
"same drops for every player."
msgstr "デイリーの変化、ウィークリーのマラソン、マンスリーのイースター祭り。落ちてくるものは全員共通です。"

#. placeholders: {resets}
msgid ""
"The daily twist, the weekly marathon and the monthly Easter festival: the "
"same drops for every player. {resets}"
msgstr "デイリーの変化、ウィークリーのマラソン、マンスリーのイースター祭り。落ちてくるものは全員共通です。{resets}"

msgid "Spoken call-outs: on. Each drop is called with its lane."
msgstr "音声の案内：オン。落ちてくるものをレーンといっしょに伝えます。"

msgid ""
"Spoken call-outs: off. From your next run, a tenth more points on "
"everything you bank."
msgstr "音声の案内：オフ。次のプレイから、納めたものがすべて一割増しになります。"

msgid ""
"When on, a voice names each drop and its lane as it starts to fall. Off for "
"a whole run, you earn a tenth more on everything you bank."
msgstr "オンにすると、落ち始めたものとそのレーンを声で伝えます。一回のプレイを通してオフなら、納めたものがすべて一割増しになります。"

msgid "Up and Down move, Enter chooses, Escape goes back to the parlor."
msgstr "UpとDownで移動、Enterで決定、Escapeで遊戯館に戻ります。"

msgid ""
"Up and Down choose a sound, Enter plays it from its place in play, Escape "
"goes back. Falling sounds fall from high to low and land."
msgstr ""
"UpとDownでサウンドを選び、Enterでプレイ中の位置から再生、Escapeで戻ります。落ちる音は高いところから低いところへ落ちて着地します。"

msgid ""
"A soft whistle that falls from high to low and grows louder as it nears the "
"ground, ending as it drops into your basket. Lower and louder means sooner."
msgstr "高いところから低く下がる柔らかい笛の音で、地面に近づくほど大きくなり、かごに入って終わります。低く大きいほど、もうすぐです。"

msgid "An egg falling"
msgstr "落ちてくる卵"

msgid "A golden egg falling"
msgstr "落ちてくる金の卵"

msgid "Sparkling little bells: a golden egg, worth five eggs."
msgstr "きらきらした小さな鈴の音は金の卵で、卵五個分です。"

msgid ""
"A low, gloopy wobble, ending in the splat of mud landing in your basket. "
"Dodge it: it spoils the eggs inside."
msgstr "低くどろっと揺れる音で、最後にかごに泥がべちゃっと落ちます。よけましょう。中の卵がだめになります。"

msgid "A mud clod falling"
msgstr "落ちてくる泥のかたまり"

msgid "A bee diving"
msgstr "急降下するハチ"

msgid "A buzz, ending in a sting. Dodge it: a sting breaks a basket."
msgstr "ブーンという音のあと、ちくり。よけましょう。刺されるとかごがひとつ壊れます。"

msgid "Lanes, left to right"
msgstr "レーン、左から右へ"

msgid ""
"A basket thump from each of five lanes in turn, from lane 1 on the far left "
"to lane 5 on the far right, heard from the middle lane."
msgstr "五つのレーンから順番にかごの音が鳴ります。左端の1番レーンから右端の5番レーンまで、真ん中のレーンから聞いた音です。"

msgid "A woody thump: an egg in your basket."
msgstr "木のようなポンという音は、かごに卵が入った音です。"

msgid "Egg caught"
msgstr "卵キャッチ"

msgid "A thump and rising bells: a golden egg in your basket."
msgstr "ポンという音と上がっていく鈴は、かごに金の卵が入った音です。"

msgid "Golden egg caught"
msgstr "金の卵キャッチ"

msgid "A crunchy crack: an egg missed your basket and broke on the grass."
msgstr "バリッと割れる音は、卵がかごに入らず草の上で割れた音です。"

msgid "Egg cracked"
msgstr "卵が割れた"

msgid "A crack and falling bells: a golden egg lost."
msgstr "割れる音と下がっていく鈴は、金の卵をなくした音です。"

msgid "Golden egg cracked"
msgstr "金の卵が割れた"

msgid "A wet splat: mud landed in your basket and spoiled the eggs."
msgstr "べちゃっという音は、かごに泥が入って卵がだめになった音です。"

msgid "Mud in your basket"
msgstr "かごに泥"

msgid "A dull thud: a mud clod missed you."
msgstr "鈍いドスンという音は、泥のかたまりが外れた音です。"

msgid "Mud in the grass"
msgstr "草の上に泥"

msgid "A zap and a yelp: a bee stung you, and a basket breaks."
msgstr "ビリッという音と悲鳴は、ハチに刺されてかごが壊れた音です。"

msgid "Bee sting"
msgstr "ハチに刺された"

msgid "A buzz fading away: a bee missed you."
msgstr "遠ざかるブーンという音は、ハチが外れた音です。"

msgid "Bee flying off"
msgstr "飛び去るハチ"

msgid "Basket full"
msgstr "かごがいっぱい"

msgid "Three wooden knocks: your basket is full. Take it to the cart."
msgstr "木を三回たたく音は、かごがいっぱいの合図です。荷車に持っていきましょう。"

msgid "Eggs banked"
msgstr "卵を納めた"

msgid "Eggs rolling into the cart and a bright chime: banked as points."
msgstr "卵が荷車に転がり込む音と明るいチャイムは、点数として納めた音です。"

msgid "Nothing to bank"
msgstr "納めるものがない"

msgid ""
"Two hollow knocks: the basket is empty, or the cart is not in your lane."
msgstr "うつろな音が二回鳴るのは、かごが空か、荷車が自分のレーンにないときです。"

msgid "A tumble: eggs lost from the basket, to mud or to the bell."
msgstr "ころころ転がる音は、泥か鐘で、かごの卵をなくした音です。"

msgid "Eggs spilled"
msgstr "卵がこぼれた"

msgid "A soft bell every few seconds from the cart's lane."
msgstr "荷車のレーンから数秒ごとに鳴る、柔らかい鐘の音です。"

msgid "The cart's bell"
msgstr "荷車の鐘"

msgid "A step"
msgstr "一歩"

msgid "Rustling grass: you moved one lane."
msgstr "草がこすれる音は、一レーン動いた音です。"

msgid "A wood block: you stepped into the cart's lane."
msgstr "ウッドブロックの音は、荷車のレーンに入った音です。"

msgid "Reaching the cart"
msgstr "荷車に着いた"

msgid "A bump: the edge of the meadow."
msgstr "ドンという音は、草原の端です。"

msgid "The fence"
msgstr "柵"

msgid "A rising thumb piano: the round begins."
msgstr "上がっていく親指ピアノの音で、ラウンドが始まります。"

msgid "Go"
msgstr "スタート"

msgid "A vibraphone call: ten seconds left in the round. Bank your eggs."
msgstr "ビブラフォンの合図は、ラウンドの残り十秒です。卵を納めましょう。"

msgid "Ten seconds left"
msgstr "残り十秒"

msgid "A tick for each of the last five seconds."
msgstr "最後の五秒に、一秒ごとにカチッと鳴ります。"

msgid "Last seconds"
msgstr "最後の数秒"

msgid "A deep bell: the round is over. Eggs still in the basket are lost."
msgstr "低い鐘はラウンド終了の合図です。かごに残った卵はなくなります。"

msgid "The bell"
msgstr "鐘"

msgid "A rising run: five eggs in a row, and every five more."
msgstr "上がっていく音階は、卵五個連続と、そのあと五個ごとの合図です。"

msgid "Streak"
msgstr "連続"

msgid "A basket breaks"
msgstr "かごが壊れた"

msgid "Falling plucks: you lost a basket."
msgstr "下がっていく弦の音は、かごをひとつ失った音です。"

msgid "Festival pattern begins"
msgstr "祭りのパターン開始"

msgid ""
"Pan pipes: in the Easter festival, a pattern of drops begins to fall. A "
"voice names it: an egg sweep, a bee fence or a nest."
msgstr "パンパイプの音は、イースター祭りで落ちてくるもののパターンが始まった合図です。声で名前を伝えます。卵の流れ、ハチの柵、巣のどれかです。"

msgid ""
"A cascade of bells: every egg of a festival pattern caught and every hazard "
"dodged, for a bonus."
msgstr "鈴が流れ落ちる音は、祭りのパターンの卵をすべて受け止め、危ないものをすべてよけてボーナスをもらった音です。"

msgid "Festival pattern caught"
msgstr "祭りのパターン成功"

msgid ""
"A low wooden flop: a festival pattern had a cracked egg, or one of its "
"hazards hit you."
msgstr "低い木のパタンという音は、祭りのパターンで卵が割れたか、危ないものに当たった音です。"

msgid "Festival pattern broken"
msgstr "祭りのパターン失敗"

msgid "Return to the Basket Run title."
msgstr "Basket Runのタイトルに戻ります。"

msgid "no score yet"
msgstr "まだスコアなし"

msgid "egg"
msgstr "卵"

msgid "golden egg"
msgstr "金の卵"

msgid "mud clod"
msgstr "泥のかたまり"

msgid "bee"
msgstr "ハチ"

msgid "an egg"
msgstr "卵"

msgid "a golden egg"
msgstr "金の卵"

msgid "a mud clod"
msgstr "泥のかたまり"

msgid "a bee"
msgstr "ハチ"

msgid "golden"
msgstr "金"

msgid "mud"
msgstr "泥"

msgid "The meadow"
msgstr "草原"

msgid "Weekly marathon"
msgstr "ウィークリーのマラソン"

msgid "Easter festival"
msgstr "イースター祭り"

msgid "golden rush"
msgstr "ゴールデンラッシュ"

msgid "bee swarm"
msgstr "ハチの大群"

msgid "fast fall"
msgstr "早落ち"

msgid "mud slide"
msgstr "泥すべり"

msgid "small basket"
msgstr "小さなかご"

msgid "golden eggs fall three times as often, among plenty of mud and bees."
msgstr "金の卵が三倍よく落ちてきて、泥とハチもたっぷりです。"

msgid ""
"no mud, twice as many bees, and more of them dive right behind an egg."
msgstr "泥はなく、ハチが二倍で、卵のすぐ後ろに急降下するハチも増えます。"

msgid ""
"everything falls as fast as the meadow ever allows, and the drops come "
"closer together."
msgstr "すべてが草原でいちばんの速さで落ち、間隔もせまくなります。"

msgid "no bees, but mud clods fall three times as often."
msgstr "ハチはいませんが、泥のかたまりが三倍よく落ちてきます。"

msgid "the basket holds only 3 eggs, so you run to the cart far more often."
msgstr "かごに卵が3個しか入らないので、ずっと頻繁に荷車へ走ります。"

msgid "egg sweep"
msgstr "卵の流れ"

msgid "bee fence"
msgstr "ハチの柵"

msgid "nest"
msgstr "巣"

msgid "sunrise in the garden"
msgstr "庭の日の出"

msgid "the orchard"
msgstr "果樹園"

msgid "the big hunt"
msgstr "大がかりな卵探し"

#. placeholders: {round}, {ROUNDS}
msgid "Round {round} of {ROUNDS}."
msgstr "ラウンド{round}、全{ROUNDS}ラウンド。"

#. placeholders: {round}
msgid "Endless, round {round}."
msgstr "エンドレス、ラウンド{round}。"

#. placeholders: {name}
msgid "Today's meadow, with the {name} twist."
msgstr "今日の草原、変化は{name}。"

msgid "Today's meadow."
msgstr "今日の草原。"

#. placeholders: {round}
msgid "Practice, round {round}."
msgstr "練習、ラウンド{round}。"

#. placeholders: {round}, {WEEKLY_ROUNDS}
msgid "Marathon, round {round} of {WEEKLY_ROUNDS}."
msgstr "マラソン、ラウンド{round}、全{WEEKLY_ROUNDS}ラウンド。"

#. placeholders: {round}, {FESTIVAL_ROUNDS}
msgid "Festival, round {round} of {FESTIVAL_ROUNDS}."
msgstr "祭り、ラウンド{round}、全{FESTIVAL_ROUNDS}ラウンド。"

#. placeholders: {round}, {EASTER_ROUNDS}, {easter_round_name}
msgid ""
"Easter morning, round {round} of {EASTER_ROUNDS}: {easter_round_name}."
msgstr "イースターの朝、ラウンド{round}、全{EASTER_ROUNDS}ラウンド：{easter_round_name}。"

#. placeholders: {seconds}
msgid "{seconds} seconds."
msgstr "{seconds}秒。"

#. placeholders: {n}, {planned}, {seconds}
msgid "Bank {n} of {planned} eggs in {seconds} seconds."
msgstr "{seconds}秒で、卵{planned}個のうち{n}個を納めましょう。"

#. placeholders: {lanes}, {lane}
msgid "{lanes} lanes, the cart in lane {lane} on the left."
msgstr "レーンは{lanes}本、荷車は左の{lane}番レーンです。"

#. placeholders: {lanes}, {lane}
msgid "{lanes} lanes, the cart in lane {lane} on the right."
msgstr "レーンは{lanes}本、荷車は右の{lane}番レーンです。"

#. placeholders: {capacity}
msgid "The basket holds {capacity}."
msgstr "かごには{capacity}個入ります。"

msgid "You are at the cart. Starting."
msgstr "荷車のところにいます。スタートです。"

msgid "your lane"
msgstr "自分のレーン"

msgid "1 lane right"
msgstr "1レーン右"

msgid "1 lane left"
msgstr "1レーン左"

#. placeholders: {d}
msgid "{d} lanes right"
msgstr "{d}レーン右"

#. placeholders: {d}
msgid "{d} lanes left"
msgstr "{d}レーン左"

#. placeholders: {lane}, {lanes}, {basket}, {capacity}
msgid "Lane {lane} of {lanes}, at the cart, basket {basket} of {capacity}."
msgstr "{lanes}レーン中{lane}番、荷車の前、かごは{capacity}個中{basket}個。"

#. placeholders: {lane}, {lanes}, {basket}, {capacity}
msgid "Lane {lane} of {lanes}, basket {basket} of {capacity}."
msgstr "{lanes}レーン中{lane}番、かごは{capacity}個中{basket}個。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}, {lane}, {relative}, {left}
msgid ""
"{sentence_start} in lane {lane}, {relative}, lands in {left} seconds."
msgstr "{sentence_start}、{lane}番レーン、{relative}、あと{left}秒で落ちます。"

msgid "Getting ready."
msgstr "準備中。"

#. placeholders: {time_left}
msgid "{time_left} seconds left."
msgstr "残り{time_left}秒。"

#. placeholders: {banked_round}
msgid "Banked {banked_round} this round."
msgstr "このラウンドで{banked_round}個納めました。"

#. placeholders: {banked_round}, {n}
msgid "Banked {banked_round} of {n} needed."
msgstr "必要な{n}個のうち{banked_round}個納めました。"

msgid "Practice: nothing costs a basket."
msgstr "練習：かごを失うことはありません。"

msgid "1 more cracked egg costs a basket."
msgstr "あと1個割れるとかごをひとつ失います。"

#. placeholders: {n}
msgid "{n} more cracked eggs cost a basket."
msgstr "あと{n}個割れるとかごをひとつ失います。"

#. placeholders: {score}
msgid "Score {score}."
msgstr "スコア{score}。"

#. placeholders: {streak}
msgid "Streak {streak}."
msgstr "連続{streak}。"

#. placeholders: {name}
msgid "Twist: {name}."
msgstr "変化：{name}。"

#. placeholders: {patterns_done}
msgid "Patterns caught cleanly: {patterns_done}."
msgstr "きれいに取りきったパターン：{patterns_done}。"

msgid "Nothing is falling right now."
msgstr "今は何も落ちてきていません。"

#. placeholders: {with_article}, {left}, {with_article2}
msgid ""
"Stay here: {with_article} lands in your lane in {left} seconds. Then step "
"aside: {with_article2} follows it."
msgstr ""
"そのままで。{with_article}が、あと{left}秒で自分のレーンに落ちます。そのあと横によけましょう。{with_article2}が続いて"
"来ます。"

#. placeholders: {with_article2}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Then step aside: {with_article2} follows it."
msgstr "そのあと横によけましょう。{with_article2}が続いて来ます。"

#. placeholders: {way}
msgid "Step {way}."
msgstr "{way}に動きましょう。"

#. placeholders: {n}, {way}, {to}
msgid "Step {n} lanes {way}, to lane {to}."
msgstr "{way}に{n}レーン動いて、{to}番レーンへ。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}, {left}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{sentence_start} is coming down in your lane in {left} seconds."
msgstr "{sentence_start}が、あと{left}秒で自分のレーンに落ちてきます。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}, {left}, {step}
msgid ""
"{sentence_start} is coming down in your lane in {left} seconds. {step}"
msgstr "{sentence_start}が、あと{left}秒で自分のレーンに落ちてきます。{step}"

msgid "Your basket is full and you are at the cart: bank it now."
msgstr "かごがいっぱいで、荷車のところにいます。今すぐ納めましょう。"

#. placeholders: {lanes_phrase}, {to_cart}, {cart}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "The cart is {lanes_phrase} {to_cart}, in lane {cart}."
msgstr "荷車は{to_cart}に{lanes_phrase}、{cart}番レーンです。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Your basket is full."
msgstr "かごがいっぱいです。"

#. placeholders: {lanes_phrase}, {to_cart}, {cart}
msgid ""
"Your basket is full. The cart is {lanes_phrase} {to_cart}, in lane {cart}."
msgstr "かごがいっぱいです。荷車は{to_cart}に{lanes_phrase}、{cart}番レーンです。"

#. placeholders: {with_article}, {left}
msgid "Stay here: {with_article} lands in your lane in {left} seconds."
msgstr "そのままで。{with_article}が、あと{left}秒で自分のレーンに落ちます。"

#. placeholders: {way}, {with_article}, {lane}, {relative}, {left}
msgid ""
"Move {way}: {with_article} lands in lane {lane}, {relative}, in {left} "
"seconds."
msgstr "{way}に動きましょう。{with_article}が{lane}番レーン、{relative}に、あと{left}秒で落ちます。"

#. placeholders: {lanes_phrase}, {to_cart}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "A good moment to bank: the cart is {lanes_phrase} {to_cart}."
msgstr "納めるならいまです。荷車は{to_cart}に{lanes_phrase}です。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Nothing to catch yet."
msgstr "まだ受け止めるものはありません。"

#. placeholders: {lanes_phrase}, {to_cart}
msgid ""
"Nothing to catch yet. A good moment to bank: the cart is {lanes_phrase} "
"{to_cart}."
msgstr "まだ受け止めるものはありません。納めるならいまです。荷車は{to_cart}に{lanes_phrase}です。"

msgid "You are at the cart: bank your basket."
msgstr "荷車のところにいます。かごの中身を納めましょう。"

msgid "Nothing falling yet. Wait in the middle of the meadow."
msgstr "まだ何も落ちてきません。草原の真ん中で待ちましょう。"

msgid "1 lane"
msgstr "1レーン"

#. placeholders: {n}
