#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"A bird answered first time is 3 points, after one miss 2, after more 1."
msgstr "一回目で答えれば3点、一回外して2点、それ以上で1点です。"

#. placeholders: {name}, {birds}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"Walk the {name} and answer its {birds} birds, each singing its signature "
"song."
msgstr "{name}を歩いて{birds}羽の鳥に答えます。どの鳥も代表的な歌を歌います。"

#. placeholders: {name}, {birds}
msgid ""
"Walk the {name} and answer its {birds} birds, each singing its signature "
"song. A bird answered first time is 3 points, after one miss 2, after more "
"1."
msgstr ""
"{name}を歩いて{birds}羽の鳥に答えます。どの鳥も代表的な歌を歌います。一回目で答えれば3点、一回外して2点、それ以上で1点です。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"Pick out each one as it is asked for: 2 points first time, 1 after a miss."
msgstr "言われた順に一羽ずつ聞き分けましょう。一回目で2点、外したあとは1点です。"

#. placeholders: {birds}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{birds} birds sing around you at once."
msgstr "まわりで{birds}羽の鳥がいっせいに歌います。"

#. placeholders: {birds}
msgid ""
"{birds} birds sing around you at once. Pick out each one as it is asked "
"for: 2 points first time, 1 after a miss."
msgstr "まわりで{birds}羽の鳥がいっせいに歌います。言われた順に一羽ずつ聞き分けましょう。一回目で2点、外したあとは1点です。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Count each one: 3 points for an exact count, 1 for one off."
msgstr "一つずつ数えましょう。ぴったりで3点、ひとつ違いで1点です。"

#. placeholders: {flocks}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{flocks} flocks fly over, the largest with up to 12 birds."
msgstr "{flocks}つの群れが頭上を飛びます。いちばん大きな群れは最大12羽です。"

#. placeholders: {flocks}
msgid ""
"{flocks} flocks fly over, the largest with up to 12 birds. Count each one: "
"3 points for an exact count, 1 for one off."
msgstr ""
"{flocks}つの群れが頭上を飛びます。いちばん大きな群れは最大12羽です。一つずつ数えましょう。ぴったりで3点、ひとつ違いで1点です。"

msgid ""
"Up and Down choose a challenge, Enter reads its briefing, Escape goes back. "
"Every player gets the same birds: a new walk each day, a new chorus each "
"Monday and a new count each month."
msgstr ""
"UpとDownでチャレンジを選び、Enterでブリーフィングを聞き、Escapeで戻ります。鳥は全員共通です。毎日新しい散歩、毎週月曜日に新しい合唱、毎"
"月新しい調査です。"

msgid "Opening the Birdsong Trail challenge."
msgstr "Birdsong Trailのチャレンジを開きます。"

