"two soft, low notes. Your answer did not match, and the bird sings again."
msgstr "柔らかく低い二音。答えが合わず、鳥がもう一度歌います。"

msgid "Found"
msgstr "見つけた"

msgid ""
"Found: a bright two-note chime. You picked out the right bird, or counted a "
"flock exactly."
msgstr "見つけた：明るい二音のチャイム。正しい鳥を聞き分けたか、群れをぴったり数えました。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
