"a bright two-note chime. You picked out the right bird, or counted a flock "
"exactly."
msgstr "明るい二音のチャイム。正しい鳥を聞き分けたか、群れをぴったり数えました。"

msgid "Trail's end"
msgstr "小道の終わり"

msgid ""
"Trail's end: a gentle rising chord. You reached the end of the trail, or "
"the last flock has gone."
msgstr "小道の終わり：穏やかに上がっていく和音。小道の終わりに着いたか、最後の群れが行ってしまいました。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid ""
"a gentle rising chord. You reached the end of the trail, or the last flock "
