msgstr "もう一度散歩します。"

msgid "Every bird you have met, with its song in words."
msgstr "会ったすべての鳥と、その歌の説明です。"

msgid "The same walk, straight away. Only your best result is kept."
msgstr "同じ散歩を、すぐにもう一度。自己ベストの結果だけが残ります。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
