msgid "Fireside Patience"
msgstr "Fireside Patience"

msgid ""
"Up and Down choose a challenge, Enter reads its briefing, Escape goes back. "
"Every player gets the same cards: a new deal each day, a draw three deal "
"each Monday and five deals each month."
msgstr ""
"UpとDownでチャレンジを選び、Enterでブリーフィングを聞き、Escapeで戻ります。全員に同じカードが配られます。毎日新しいディール、毎週月曜に"
"三枚めくりのディール、毎月五ディールです。"

msgid "Opening the Fireside Patience challenge."
msgstr "Fireside Patienceのチャレンジを開きます。"

#. placeholders: {deals}, {moves_words}
