"A motor helps you up to {per_hour}. Its hop cannot clear a curb, and "
"potholes flatten its tyres."
msgstr "{per_hour}までモーターが助けてくれます。ホップでは縁石を越えられず、穴でパンクします。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Its hop cannot clear a curb, and potholes flatten its tyres."
msgstr "ホップでは縁石を越えられず、穴でパンクします。"

#. placeholders: {per_hour}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "An engine, not pedals: up to {per_hour}."
msgstr "ペダルではなくエンジン。{per_hour}まで出ます。"

#. placeholders: {per_hour}
msgid "An engine, not pedals: up to {per_hour}. It cannot hop or sprint."
msgstr "ペダルではなくエンジン。{per_hour}まで出ます。ホップもスプリントもできません。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "It cannot hop or sprint."
msgstr "ホップもスプリントもできません。"

msgid "Morning run"
msgstr "朝のライド"

msgid "Rush hour"
msgstr "ラッシュアワー"

