msgid ""
"Up and Down choose a hall, Enter reads its briefing, Escape goes back. "
"Every player gets the same hall: a new one each day, each Monday and each "
"month."
msgstr ""
"UpとDownで廊下を選び、Enterでブリーフィングを聞き、Escapeで戻ります。廊下は全員同じで、毎日、毎週月曜、毎月新しくなります。"

msgid "Light them all on the first taper for a bonus."
msgstr "最初の火種ですべて灯すとボーナスです。"

msgid "Opening the Lamplighter challenge."
msgstr "Lamplighterのチャレンジを開きます。"

