msgid ""
"A hall of {length} steps with {lamps_words} out, and a taper that burns for "
"{time_words}."
msgstr "{length}歩の廊下に消えたランプが{lamps_words}、火種は{time_words}燃えます。"

msgid "Practice hall"
msgstr "練習の廊下"

msgid "A short hall with no taper and no score: learn the lamps."
msgstr "火種もスコアもない短い廊下。ランプに慣れましょう。"

msgid ""
"Your best score, fastest hall, lamps lit, and your challenge results."
msgstr "自己ベスト、最速の廊下、灯したランプ、チャレンジの結果。"

msgid "Play the sounds you need in the hall."
msgstr "廊下で必要な音を鳴らします。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
