#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid ""
"a low rumble that moves across with the ball and grows louder as it nears "
"the pins."
msgstr "ボールと一緒に動き、ピンに近づくほど大きくなる低いゴロゴロという音。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Gutter"
msgstr "ガター"

msgid ""
"Gutter: a hollow rattle. The ball left the lane and will hit no pins."
msgstr "ガター：うつろなガラガラという音。ボールがレーンから外れ、ピンには当たりません。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "a hollow rattle. The ball left the lane and will hit no pins."
msgstr "うつろなガラガラという音。ボールがレーンから外れ、ピンには当たりません。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Light clatter"
msgstr "軽いカラン"

msgid "Light clatter: a few pins falling."
msgstr "軽いカラン：ピンが数本倒れる音。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "a few pins falling."
msgstr "ピンが数本倒れる音。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Heavy clatter"
msgstr "重いガラガラ"

msgid "Heavy clatter: most of the rack falling at once."
msgstr "重いガラガラ：ほとんどのピンが一度に倒れる音。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "most of the rack falling at once."
msgstr "ほとんどのピンが一度に倒れる音。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Pinsetter"
msgstr "ピンセッター"

msgid ""
"Pinsetter: a mechanical sweep and clunk as the deck is cleared and pins are "
"set."
msgstr "ピンセッター：ピンを片づけて並べ直す、機械の掃く音とガチャン。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid ""
"a mechanical sweep and clunk as the deck is cleared and pins are set."
msgstr "ピンを片づけて並べ直す、機械の掃く音とガチャン。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Ball return"
msgstr "ボールリターン"

msgid ""
"Ball return: a rolling rumble and a knock. Your ball is back and you can "
"roll."
msgstr "ボールリターン：転がる音とコツン。ボールが戻り、投げられます。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "a rolling rumble and a knock. Your ball is back and you can roll."
msgstr "転がる音とコツン。ボールが戻り、投げられます。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Strike sting"
msgstr "ストライクの音"

msgid ""
"Strike sting: a short jukebox flourish. All ten pins with the first ball."
msgstr "ストライクの音：ジュークボックスの短い決めフレーズ。一投目で十本全部。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "a short jukebox flourish. All ten pins with the first ball."
msgstr "ジュークボックスの短い決めフレーズ。一投目で十本全部。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Spare bell"
msgstr "スペアのベル"

msgid "Spare bell: a bright bell. The second ball cleared the rest."
msgstr "スペアのベル：明るいベル。二投目で残りを全部倒しました。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "a bright bell. The second ball cleared the rest."
msgstr "明るいベル。二投目で残りを全部倒しました。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Pumpkins falling, light"
msgstr "カボチャが倒れる、軽い"

msgid ""
"Pumpkins falling, light: a hollow squash. On Pumpkin night, a few pumpkins "
"went down."
msgstr "カボチャが倒れる、軽い：うつろなグシャッ。カボチャの夜に、カボチャが数個倒れました。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "a hollow squash. On Pumpkin night, a few pumpkins went down."
msgstr "うつろなグシャッ。カボチャの夜に、カボチャが数個倒れました。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Pumpkins falling, heavy"
msgstr "カボチャが倒れる、重い"

msgid ""
"Pumpkins falling, heavy: a long hollow tumble. On Pumpkin night, five or "
"more went down."
msgstr "カボチャが倒れる、重い：長くうつろなゴロゴロ。カボチャの夜に、五個以上倒れました。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "a long hollow tumble. On Pumpkin night, five or more went down."
msgstr "長くうつろなゴロゴロ。カボチャの夜に、五個以上倒れました。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Grin carved"
msgstr "笑顔を彫る"

msgid ""
"Grin carved: a knife scrape and a low chord. A strike on Pumpkin night."
msgstr "笑顔を彫る：ナイフでこする音と低い和音。カボチャの夜のストライクです。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "a knife scrape and a low chord. A strike on Pumpkin night."
msgstr "ナイフでこする音と低い和音。カボチャの夜のストライクです。"

msgid "Return to the Midnight Lanes title."
msgstr "Midnight Lanesのタイトルに戻ります。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "A ball aimed straight at the head pin often leaves a split."
msgstr "ヘッドピンにまっすぐ狙うと、スプリットが残りがちです。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Aim from off centre for a better chance of a strike."
msgstr "中央から外れた位置から狙うと、ストライクになりやすくなります。"

