#. placeholders: {sentence_start}, {p}
msgid ""
"{sentence_start} starts the swing. The swing climbs to the top, then falls. "
"Press {p} again right at the top to let go."
msgstr ""
"{sentence_start}でスイングを始めます。スイングは頂点まで上がり、そのあと下がります。頂点ぴったりでもう一度{p}を押して離しましょう。"

msgid "Swing."
msgstr "スイング。"

#. placeholders: {control_name}
#. one sentence of a longer line
