#. placeholders: {STRIKES}, {hints}, {name}, {describe}
msgid ""
"Three safes, one relocker: {STRIKES} strikes across all three jam it. "
"{hints}. Twist, {name}: {describe}."
msgstr ""
"金庫三つ、リロッカー一つ：三つを通してストライク{STRIKES}つで動かなくなります。{hints}。変化、{name}：{describe}。"

