#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Twist, {name}: {describe}."
msgstr "変化、{name}：{describe}。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "It stops while the guard listens, and a hint costs five seconds."
msgstr "夜警が聞いている間は止まり、ヒントは五秒かかります。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Open both for 3 points a second left."
msgstr "両方開ければ、残り一秒ごとに3点。"

#. placeholders: {time_words}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Two safes on one clock of {time_words}."
msgstr "{time_words}の時計一つで金庫二つ。"

#. placeholders: {time_words}
msgid ""
"Two safes on one clock of {time_words}. It stops while the guard listens, "
"and a hint costs five seconds. Open both for 3 points a second left."
msgstr "{time_words}の時計一つで金庫二つ。夜警が聞いている間は止まり、ヒントは五秒かかります。両方開ければ、残り一秒ごとに3点。"

msgid ""
"The Crown heist. Once a month the Crown jewels leave the vault for cleaning "
"and come back at midnight. For five minutes, while the night shift changes, "
"the museum's east wing is yours."
msgstr "王冠強奪。月に一度、王冠の宝石は手入れのために金庫室を出て、真夜中に戻ってきます。夜勤が交代する五分間、博物館の東棟は思いのままです。"

msgid ""
"Your fence has the plan. Through the curator's office first: his safe holds "
"the key card to the vault corridor. Then the Crown vault itself, five "
"wheels deep. A single guard walks the corridor between the two. You must be "
"out before the new shift clocks in."
msgstr ""
"故買屋が計画を立ててある。まずは学芸員の部屋へ。その金庫に、金庫室の廊下へのキーカードが入っている。次は王冠の金庫室そのもの、ホイール五つの奥だ。二つの"
"間の廊下を夜警が一人で見回っている。次の勤務が始まる前に抜け出すこと。"

msgid ""
"The vault door swings wide. You lift the Crown from its velvet and slip out "
"of the east wing as the new shift's footsteps reach the stairs. By morning, "
"the city has the most famous empty case in its history."
msgstr ""
"金庫室の扉が大きく開きます。ビロードから王冠を持ち上げ、次の勤務の足音が階段に届くころ、東棟をそっと抜け出します。朝には、街の歴史でいちばん有名な空っぽ"
"のケースが残されていました。"

msgid ""
"You had the key card in your hand and the Crown vault in front of you. Next "
"month, the jewels come home again."
msgstr "キーカードを手にして、王冠の金庫室は目の前でした。来月、宝石はまた戻ってきます。"

msgid ""
"You never got past the curator's office. Next month, the jewels come home "
"again."
msgstr "学芸員の部屋より先へは進めませんでした。来月、宝石はまた戻ってきます。"

msgid "Turn the dial either way until the tumbler falls, then set it."
msgstr "どちらかへダイヤルを回し、タンブラーが落ちたら合わせます。"

#. placeholders: {word}
msgid "turn {word} until the tumbler falls"
msgstr "タンブラーが落ちるまで{word}回し"

msgid "turn either way until the tumbler falls"
msgstr "タンブラーが落ちるまでどちらかへ回す"

#. placeholders: {wheel}, {wheels}, {way}
msgid "Wheel {wheel} of {wheels}: {way}."
msgstr "{wheels}個中{wheel}個目のホイール：{way}。"

#. placeholders: {p}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "At the clunk, {p} sets the wheel and a new number is waiting."
msgstr "ゴトンと鳴ったら{p}でホイールを合わせ、新しい数字が待っています。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Escape pauses, and you leave from there."
msgstr "Escapeで一時停止し、そこから抜けられます。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "One wheel at a time, forever, and nothing to lose."
msgstr "ホイールを一つずつ、いつまでも。失うものはありません。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "The practice safe."
msgstr "練習用の金庫。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}, {r}, {p}
msgid ""
"The practice safe. One wheel at a time, forever, and nothing to lose. "
"{sentence_start} and {r} turn the dial. At the clunk, {p} sets the wheel "
"and a new number is waiting. Escape pauses, and you leave from there."
msgstr ""
"練習用の金庫。ホイールを一つずつ、いつまでも。失うものはありません。{sentence_start}と{r}でダイヤルを回します。ゴトンと鳴ったら{p}"
"でホイールを合わせ、新しい数字が待っています。Escapeで一時停止し、そこから抜けられます。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}, {r}
