msgstr ""

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Dial click"
msgstr "ダイヤルのクリック"

msgid "Dial click: the dial moved one number."
msgstr "ダイヤルのクリック：ダイヤルが一つ動きました。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "the dial moved one number."
msgstr "ダイヤルが一つ動きました。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Ten detent"
msgstr "十の刻み"

msgid ""
"Ten detent: a firmer double click at every tenth number, 10, 20 and so on, "
"to help you count."
msgstr "十の刻み：10、20と十ごとに鳴る、強めの二重クリック。数えるのに役立ちます。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid ""
"a firmer double click at every tenth number, 10, 20 and so on, to help you "
"count."
msgstr "10、20と十ごとに鳴る、強めの二重クリック。数えるのに役立ちます。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Zero notch"
msgstr "ゼロの切り欠き"

msgid ""
"Zero notch: a deep notch as the dial reaches zero, the top of the dial."
msgstr "ゼロの切り欠き：ダイヤルがいちばん上のゼロに来たときの深い切り欠きの音。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "a deep notch as the dial reaches zero, the top of the dial."
msgstr "ダイヤルがいちばん上のゼロに来たときの深い切り欠きの音。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Spin"
msgstr "回転"

msgid "Spin: a quick ratchet as the dial spins ten numbers at once."
msgstr "回転：ダイヤルが十を一度に回るときの素早いラチェット音。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "a quick ratchet as the dial spins ten numbers at once."
msgstr "ダイヤルが十を一度に回るときの素早いラチェット音。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Tumbler clunk"
msgstr "タンブラーのゴトン"

msgid ""
"Tumbler clunk: the dial passed or reached this wheel's number. Deep and "
"solid. Stop, step back to it, and set the wheel. On later safes it is "
"quieter."
msgstr ""
"タンブラーのゴトン：ダイヤルがこのホイールの数字を通ったか、届きました。低くて重い音です。止めて、そこまで戻し、ホイールを合わせましょう。後の金庫では小"
"さくなります。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid ""
"the dial passed or reached this wheel's number. Deep and solid. Stop, step "
"back to it, and set the wheel. On later safes it is quieter."
msgstr ""
"ダイヤルがこのホイールの数字を通ったか、届きました。低くて重い音です。止めて、そこまで戻し、ホイールを合わせましょう。後の金庫では小さくなります。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "False gate"
msgstr "偽のゲート"

msgid ""
"False gate: a hollow, rattling tick at a wrong number. Ignore it: it is not "
"the tumbler."
msgstr "偽のゲート：間違った数字で鳴る、うつろでカタカタした音。タンブラーではないので無視しましょう。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid ""
"a hollow, rattling tick at a wrong number. Ignore it: it is not the tumbler."
msgstr "間違った数字で鳴る、うつろでカタカタした音。タンブラーではないので無視しましょう。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Wheel set"
msgstr "ホイール合わせ"

msgid ""
"Wheel set: a latch and a rising chime. The wheel is set, on to the next."
msgstr "ホイール合わせ：掛け金の音と上がっていくチャイム。ホイールが合い、次へ進みます。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "a latch and a rising chime. The wheel is set, on to the next."
msgstr "掛け金の音と上がっていくチャイム。ホイールが合い、次へ進みます。"

msgid ""
"Spring: a wrong set. The wheel springs back and you take a strike. Three "
"strikes and the safe jams."
msgstr "バネ：合わせ間違い。ホイールが跳ね戻り、ストライクが一つ付きます。ストライク三つで金庫が動かなくなります。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid ""
"a wrong set. The wheel springs back and you take a strike. Three strikes "
"and the safe jams."
msgstr "合わせ間違い。ホイールが跳ね戻り、ストライクが一つ付きます。ストライク三つで金庫が動かなくなります。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Safe open"
msgstr "金庫が開く"

msgid "Safe open: the handle turns and the bolts slide back."
msgstr "金庫が開く：取っ手が回り、かんぬきが外れます。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "the handle turns and the bolts slide back."
msgstr "取っ手が回り、かんぬきが外れます。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Onward"
msgstr "次へ"

msgid ""
"Onward: a heavy door and a bell. In a challenge, this safe is open and the "
"next one is waiting."
msgstr "次へ：重い扉とベル。チャレンジでは、この金庫が開いて次が待っています。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid ""
"a heavy door and a bell. In a challenge, this safe is open and the next one "
"is waiting."
msgstr "重い扉とベル。チャレンジでは、この金庫が開いて次が待っています。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Relocker"
msgstr "リロッカー"

msgid "Relocker: the safe jams and the alarm rings. The safe is lost."
msgstr "リロッカー：金庫が動かなくなり、警報が鳴ります。この金庫は失敗です。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "the safe jams and the alarm rings. The safe is lost."
msgstr "金庫が動かなくなり、警報が鳴ります。この金庫は失敗です。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Footsteps"
msgstr "足音"

msgid ""
"Footsteps: the guard is coming down the corridor. When they stop, keep "
"still."
msgstr "足音：夜警が廊下をやって来ます。止まったら、じっとして。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "the guard is coming down the corridor. When they stop, keep still."
msgstr "夜警が廊下をやって来ます。止まったら、じっとして。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Guard at the door"
msgstr "扉の前の夜警"

msgid ""
"Guard at the door: the footsteps stop and his keys jingle. Keep still: do "
"not turn or set until he walks away."
msgstr "扉の前の夜警：足音が止まり、鍵がジャラジャラ鳴ります。じっとして、去るまで回したり合わせたりしないで。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid ""
"the footsteps stop and his keys jingle. Keep still: do not turn or set "
"until he walks away."
msgstr "足音が止まり、鍵がジャラジャラ鳴ります。じっとして、去るまで回したり合わせたりしないで。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Who's there"
msgstr "誰だ"

msgid ""
"Who's there: the guard heard you. One more noise while he listens and you "
"are caught."
msgstr "誰だ：夜警に聞かれました。聞いている間にもう一度音を立てると見つかります。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid ""
"the guard heard you. One more noise while he listens and you are caught."
msgstr "夜警に聞かれました。聞いている間にもう一度音を立てると見つかります。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Whistle"
msgstr "笛"

msgid "Whistle: the guard caught you. The safe is lost."
msgstr "笛：夜警に見つかりました。この金庫は失敗です。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "the guard caught you. The safe is lost."
msgstr "夜警に見つかりました。この金庫は失敗です。"

msgid "Clock tick: time attack is running low."
msgstr "時計の音：タイムアタックの残りが少なくなっています。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "time attack is running low."
msgstr "タイムアタックの残りが少なくなっています。"

msgid "Dull tap: nothing to do, or no hints left."
msgstr "鈍いトン：することがないか、ヒントが残っていません。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "nothing to do, or no hints left."
msgstr "することがないか、ヒントが残っていません。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Knocking pipe"
msgstr "配管の音"

msgid "Knocking pipe: a building noise, off to one side. Not the safe."
msgstr "配管の音：横から聞こえる建物の音。金庫ではありません。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "a building noise, off to one side. Not the safe."
msgstr "横から聞こえる建物の音。金庫ではありません。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Creaking floor"
msgstr "床のきしみ"

msgid "Creaking floor: a building noise, off to one side. Not the safe."
msgstr "床のきしみ：横から聞こえる建物の音。金庫ではありません。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Distant clock"
msgstr "遠くの時計"

msgid "Distant clock: a building noise, off to one side. Not the safe."
msgstr "遠くの時計：横から聞こえる建物の音。金庫ではありません。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Cat yowl"
msgstr "猫の鳴き声"

msgid ""
"Cat yowl: a soft, short yowl just after a clunk. On Friday the 13th, the "
"unlucky safe's cat: this wheel's number is 13."
msgstr "猫の鳴き声：ゴトンのすぐ後の、小さく短い鳴き声。13日の金曜日の不吉な金庫の猫です。このホイールの数字は13です。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid ""
"a soft, short yowl just after a clunk. On Friday the 13th, the unlucky "
"safe's cat: this wheel's number is 13."
msgstr "ゴトンのすぐ後の、小さく短い鳴き声。13日の金曜日の不吉な金庫の猫です。このホイールの数字は13です。"

msgid "Click and clunk"
msgstr "クリックとゴトン"

msgid "Quiet clunk"
msgstr "小さなゴトン"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "The dial runs from 0 to 99."
msgstr "ダイヤルは0から99まであります。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}, {r}
msgid ""
"The dial runs from 0 to 99. {sentence_start} turns it one number down and "
"{r} one number up. Turn up to 5."
msgstr "ダイヤルは0から99まであります。{sentence_start}で一つ下、{r}で一つ上に回ります。5まで回しましょう。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Turn up to 5."
msgstr "5まで回しましょう。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}, {r}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{sentence_start} turns it one number down and {r} one number up."
msgstr "{sentence_start}で一つ下、{r}で一つ上に回ります。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{sentence_start} speaks the number under the mark, without turning."
msgstr "{sentence_start}で、回さずに目盛りの数字を伝えます。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}
msgid ""
"{sentence_start} speaks the number under the mark, without turning. Press "
"it now."
msgstr "{sentence_start}で、回さずに目盛りの数字を伝えます。今押してみましょう。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "At a wheel's number, the tumbler falls into place."
msgstr "ホイールの数字で、タンブラーが落ちてはまります。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Spin up until it does."
msgstr "そうなるまで十ずつ上に回しましょう。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}, {d}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{sentence_start} spins the dial ten numbers up and {d} ten down."
msgstr "{sentence_start}でダイヤルを十上に、{d}で十下に回します。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}, {d}
msgid ""
"{sentence_start} spins the dial ten numbers up and {d} ten down. At a "
"wheel's number, the tumbler falls into place. Spin up until it does."
msgstr ""
"{sentence_start}でダイヤルを十上に、{d}で十下に回します。ホイールの数字で、タンブラーが落ちてはまります。そうなるまで十ずつ上に回しま"
"しょう。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "That was the tumbler: the number is in the ten you just spun past."
msgstr "今のがタンブラーです。数字は今回り過ぎた十の中にあります。"

#. placeholders: {get}
msgid ""
"{get}. That was the tumbler: the number is in the ten you just spun past."
msgstr "{get}。今のがタンブラーです。数字は今回り過ぎた十の中にあります。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Not there yet."
msgstr "まだです。"

#. placeholders: {get}
msgid "{get}. Not there yet."
msgstr "{get}。まだです。"

#. placeholders: {l}
msgid ""
"Now step back one number at a time with {l} until the tumbler falls again."
msgstr "では{l}で一つずつ戻し、もう一度タンブラーが落ちるまで続けましょう。"

#. placeholders: {n}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "The number is {n}."
msgstr "数字は{n}です。"

#. placeholders: {n}
msgid "{n}. There it is. The number is {n}."
msgstr "{n}。ありました。数字は{n}です。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Set it now."
msgstr "さあ合わせましょう。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{sentence_start} sets the wheel on the number under the mark."
msgstr "{sentence_start}で、目盛りの数字にホイールを合わせます。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}
msgid ""
"{sentence_start} sets the wheel on the number under the mark. Set it now."
msgstr "{sentence_start}で、目盛りの数字にホイールを合わせます。さあ合わせましょう。"

msgid "Wheel set, and the safe swings open"
msgstr "ホイールが合い、金庫が開きます"

#. placeholders: {SECRET}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Find the tumbler at {SECRET} first."
msgstr "まず{SECRET}でタンブラーを見つけましょう。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "In a real safe that is a strike, and three strikes jam it."
msgstr "本物の金庫ならストライクで、ストライク三つで動かなくなります。"

#. placeholders: {get}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "The wheel sprang back: {get} is not the number."
msgstr "ホイールが跳ね戻りました。{get}は違う数字です。"

#. placeholders: {get}, {SECRET}
msgid ""
"The wheel sprang back: {get} is not the number. In a real safe that is a "
"strike, and three strikes jam it. Find the tumbler at {SECRET} first."
msgstr ""
"ホイールが跳ね戻りました。{get}は違う数字です。本物の金庫ならストライクで、ストライク三つで動かなくなります。まず{SECRET}でタンブラーを見つ"
"けましょう。"

msgid ""
"Turn the dial and listen for the tumbler to find each wheel's number. Learn "
"on a practice dial with one wheel and no time limit"
msgstr "ダイヤルを回してタンブラーの音を聞き、ホイールの数字を見つけましょう。ホイール一つ、時間制限なしの練習ダイヤルで覚えます"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "In a real safe, turning the dial does not speak each number."
msgstr "本物の金庫では、ダイヤルを回しても数字は読み上げられません。"

#. placeholders: {t}
msgid ""
"In a real safe, turning the dial does not speak each number. Press {t} to "
"hear the current number. Real safes have two to five wheels, and later ones "
"add false gates and a night guard. Play starts with the office lockbox, and "
"Practice dial gives endless single wheels."
msgstr ""
"本物の金庫では、ダイヤルを回しても数字は読み上げられません。{t}を押すと今の数字を聞けます。本物の金庫のホイールは二つから五つで、後の金庫には偽のゲー"
"トや夜警が加わります。プレイはオフィスの手提げ金庫から始まり、練習ダイヤルではホイールを一つずつ際限なく練習できます。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"Play starts with the office lockbox, and Practice dial gives endless single "
"wheels."
msgstr "プレイはオフィスの手提げ金庫から始まり、練習ダイヤルではホイールを一つずつ際限なく練習できます。"

#. placeholders: {t}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Press {t} to hear the current number."
msgstr "{t}を押すと今の数字を聞けます。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"Real safes have two to five wheels, and later ones add false gates and a "
"night guard."
msgstr "本物の金庫のホイールは二つから五つで、後の金庫には偽のゲートや夜警が加わります。"

msgid ""
"Work a night shift at the junction. Answer each dispatcher call before the "
"train reaches the points. Correct answers score. A late or wrong answer "
"derails the train and ends your shift. Calls speed up through the night."
msgstr ""
"分岐点で夜勤をしましょう。列車がポイントに着く前に、指令員の呼び出しに応えます。正しく応えれば得点。遅れたり間違えたりすると列車が脱線し、勤務は終わりで"
"す。夜が更けるほど呼び出しは速くなります。"

msgid "Work a night shift at the junction."
msgstr "分岐点で夜勤をしましょう。"

msgid "Answer each dispatcher call before the train reaches the points."
msgstr "列車がポイントに着く前に、指令員の呼び出しに応えます。"

msgid "Correct answers score."
msgstr "正しく応えれば得点です。"

msgid "A late or wrong answer derails the train and ends your shift."
msgstr "遅れたり間違えたりすると列車が脱線し、勤務は終わりです。"

msgid "Calls speed up through the night."
msgstr "夜が更けるほど呼び出しは速くなります。"

msgid "The five calls"
msgstr "五つの呼び出し"

msgid "Points left: answer with the Left arrow."
msgstr "ポイント左：Leftで応えます。"

msgid "Points right: answer with the Right arrow."
msgstr "ポイント右：Rightで応えます。"

msgid "Signal up: answer with the Up arrow."
msgstr "信号上げ：Upで応えます。"

msgid "Signal down: answer with the Down arrow."
msgstr "信号下げ：Downで応えます。"

msgid "Ring back: answer with Space."
msgstr "ベル返し：Spaceで応えます。"

msgid ""
"The dispatcher always says the call. Before the line opens, H plays every "
"call with its key. Each answer key plays its own call, so you can learn "
"them with nothing at stake."
msgstr ""
"指令員はいつも呼び出しを言います。路線を開く前に、Hですべての呼び出しをキーと一緒に再生します。応答キーを押すとそれぞれの呼び出しが鳴るので、何も失わず"
"に覚えられます。"

msgid "The dispatcher always says the call."
msgstr "指令員はいつも呼び出しを言います。"

msgid "Before the line opens, H plays every call with its key."
msgstr "路線を開く前に、Hですべての呼び出しをキーと一緒に再生します。"

msgid ""
"Each answer key plays its own call, so you can learn them with nothing at "
"stake."
msgstr "応答キーを押すとそれぞれの呼び出しが鳴るので、何も失わずに覚えられます。"

msgid "The answer window"
msgstr "応答時間"

msgid ""
"The answer window is the time you have to respond to a call. It shrinks "
"every 5 trains. The timing cue marks four beats per window and speeds up as "
"the window shrinks. S says how long the answer window lasts."
msgstr ""
"応答時間とは、呼び出しに応えるまでの時間です。列車5本ごとに短くなります。タイミングの音は応答時間ごとに四拍を刻み、短くなるほど速くなります。Sで応答時"
"間の長さを伝えます。"

msgid "The answer window is the time you have to respond to a call."
msgstr "応答時間とは、呼び出しに応えるまでの時間です。"

msgid "It shrinks every 5 trains."
msgstr "列車5本ごとに短くなります。"

msgid ""
"The timing cue marks four beats per window and speeds up as the window "
"shrinks."
msgstr "タイミングの音は応答時間ごとに四拍を刻み、短くなるほど速くなります。"

msgid "S says how long the answer window lasts."
msgstr "Sで応答時間の長さを伝えます。"

msgid ""
"The answer window holds while a call or another line is still being spoken. "
"A line you ask for again and again stops holding after a while. This holds "
"at every pace and in every mode."
msgstr ""
"呼び出しやほかの読み上げの途中は、応答時間は止まっています。何度も聞き直すと、しばらくして止まらなくなります。これはどのペースでもどのモードでも同じです"
"。"

msgid ""
"The answer window holds while a call or another line is still being spoken."
msgstr "呼び出しやほかの読み上げの途中は、応答時間は止まっています。"

msgid ""
"Pace in Settings sets how fast the shift runs: relaxed, normal or quick. "
"Normal is the default and a little slower than quick. Quick is the fastest, "
"and relaxed runs at half speed. The window, the gaps between trains and the "
"timing cue all follow the pace."
msgstr ""
"設定のペースで勤務の速さを決めます。ゆったり、ふつう、速い。ふつうが初期設定で、速いより少しゆっくりです。速いがいちばん速く、ゆったりは半分の速さです。"
"応答時間、列車の間隔、タイミングの音がすべてペースに従います。"

msgid ""
"Pace in Settings sets how fast the shift runs: relaxed, normal or quick."
msgstr "設定のペースで勤務の速さを決めます。ゆったり、ふつう、速い。"

msgid ""
"The window, the gaps between trains and the timing cue all follow the pace."
msgstr "応答時間、列車の間隔、タイミングの音がすべてペースに従います。"

msgid ""
"A change applies from your next run. A shift or a timetable keeps the pace "
"it started at until it ends."
msgstr "変更は次のプレイから有効です。勤務や時刻表は、終わるまで始めたときのペースのままです。"

msgid "A shift or a timetable keeps the pace it started at until it ends."
msgstr "勤務や時刻表は、終わるまで始めたときのペースのままです。"

msgid ""
"Relaxed scores and records are saved separately, including challenges and "
"events. Normal and quick share their scores."
msgstr "ゆったりのスコアと記録は、チャレンジやイベントも含めて別に保存されます。ふつうと速いはスコアを共有します。"

msgid ""
"Relaxed scores and records are saved separately, including challenges and "
"events."
msgstr "ゆったりのスコアと記録は、チャレンジやイベントも含めて別に保存されます。"

msgid ""
"Each train that passes is 1 point. Every 10 trains in a row add a bonus of "
"5 points. The train-passing cue confirms a correct answer. The derailment "
"cue means the shift is over."
msgstr "列車が一本通るごとに1点。10本連続ごとにボーナス5点。列車の通過音が正しい応答の合図です。脱線の音は勤務の終わりです。"

msgid "Each train that passes is 1 point."
msgstr "列車が一本通るごとに1点です。"

msgid "Every 10 trains in a row add a bonus of 5 points."
msgstr "10本連続ごとにボーナス5点。"

msgid "The train-passing cue confirms a correct answer."
msgstr "列車の通過音が正しい応答の合図です。"

msgid "The derailment cue means the shift is over."
msgstr "脱線の音は勤務の終わりです。"

msgid ""
"Records keeps your best score, your longest run of trains, the shortest "
"window you reached, and your challenge results."
msgstr "記録には、ベストスコア、最長の連続通過、たどり着いた最短の応答時間、チャレンジの結果が残ります。"

msgid ""
"The steam gala is on the last weekend of every month, Saturday and Sunday. "
"The title then has a Steam gala row: a night shift of its own, with the "
"same calls, window and tick. Every fifth train is the steam special. It "
"scores 3 points instead of 1. On other days the row stays in its place, "
"locked, and says when it opens. The steam gala keeps its own best score, "
"and it never changes your night shift records."
msgstr ""
"蒸気機関車まつりは、毎月最後の週末の土曜と日曜です。その日はタイトルに蒸気機関車まつりの項目が出ます。呼び出し、応答時間、刻みは同じの、特別な夜勤です。"
"五本目ごとの列車は蒸気の特別列車。1点ではなく3点です。ほかの日は項目がロック中のまま残り、開く日を伝えます。蒸気機関車まつりのベストスコアは別に残り、"
"夜勤の記録は変わりません。"

msgid ""
"The steam gala is on the last weekend of every month, Saturday and Sunday."
msgstr "蒸気機関車まつりは、毎月最後の週末の土曜と日曜です。"

msgid ""
"The title then has a Steam gala row: a night shift of its own, with the "
"same calls, window and tick."
msgstr "その日はタイトルに蒸気機関車まつりの項目が出ます。呼び出し、応答時間、刻みは同じの、特別な夜勤です。"

msgid "Every fifth train is the steam special."
msgstr "五本目ごとの列車は蒸気の特別列車です。"

msgid "It scores 3 points instead of 1."
msgstr "1点ではなく3点です。"

msgid ""
"The steam gala keeps its own best score, and it never changes your night "
"shift records."
msgstr "蒸気機関車まつりのベストスコアは別に残り、夜勤の記録は変わりません。"

msgid ""
"The thirteenth train appears in ordinary night shifts on Friday the 13th. "
"Answer its call as usual. Scoring is unchanged. The results say the "
"thirteenth train went by, and Records keeps count of how many you have "
"seen. The game announces the event before the line opens. S, H and F1 say "
"when either event is on."
msgstr ""
"13日の金曜日には、ふつうの夜勤に十三番目の列車が現れます。いつも通り呼び出しに応えましょう。得点は変わりません。結果で十三番目の列車が通ったと伝え、記"
"録に見た回数が残ります。イベントは路線を開く前に知らせます。S、H、F1で、どちらかのイベントがあるときに伝えます。"

msgid ""
"The thirteenth train appears in ordinary night shifts on Friday the 13th."
msgstr "13日の金曜日には、ふつうの夜勤に十三番目の列車が現れます。"

msgid "Answer its call as usual."
msgstr "いつも通り呼び出しに応えましょう。"

msgid "Scoring is unchanged."
msgstr "得点は変わりません。"

msgid ""
"The results say the thirteenth train went by, and Records keeps count of "
"how many you have seen."
msgstr "結果で十三番目の列車が通ったと伝え、記録に見た回数が残ります。"

msgid "The game announces the event before the line opens."
msgstr "イベントは路線を開く前に知らせます。"

msgid "S, H and F1 say when either event is on."
msgstr "S、H、F1で、どちらかのイベントがあるときに伝えます。"

msgid ""
"The practice room sends calls with no clock and nothing to lose. A wrong "
"answer names the correct key. The call stays active until you answer it. H "
"names the key for the call that is out."
msgstr ""
"練習室では、時計も失うものもなしに呼び出しが来ます。間違えると正しいキーを教えます。応えるまで呼び出しは続きます。Hで今の呼び出しのキーを教えます。"

msgid "The practice room sends calls with no clock and nothing to lose."
msgstr "練習室では、時計も失うものもなしに呼び出しが来ます。"

msgid "A wrong answer names the correct key."
msgstr "間違えると正しいキーを教えます。"

msgid "The call stays active until you answer it."
msgstr "応えるまで呼び出しは続きます。"

msgid "H names the key for the call that is out."
msgstr "Hで今の呼び出しのキーを教えます。"

msgid ""
"Every player gets the same timetable, a fixed list of calls, for each "
"period. One wrong or late answer ends a timetable. The trains you passed "
"still count."
msgstr ""
"期間ごとに、全員が同じ時刻表、決まった呼び出しの並びに挑みます。一度でも間違えたり遅れたりすると時刻表は終わりです。通した列車は数えられます。"

msgid ""
"Every player gets the same timetable, a fixed list of calls, for each "
"period."
msgstr "期間ごとに、全員が同じ時刻表、決まった呼び出しの並びに挑みます。"

msgid "One wrong or late answer ends a timetable."
msgstr "一度でも間違えたり遅れたりすると時刻表は終わりです。"

msgid "The trains you passed still count."
msgstr "通した列車は数えられます。"

msgid ""
"Today's timetable, the daily: 40 trains. The window starts at about 2.5 "
"seconds and shrinks every 4 trains, down to about 1.2 seconds. A new one "
"comes every day."
msgstr "今日の時刻表、デイリー：列車40本。応答時間は約2.5秒から始まり、4本ごとに短くなって約1.2秒まで縮みます。毎日新しくなります。"

msgid "Today's timetable, the daily: 40 trains."
msgstr "今日の時刻表、デイリー：列車40本。"

msgid ""
"The window starts at about 2.5 seconds and shrinks every 4 trains, down to "
"about 1.2 seconds."
msgstr "応答時間は約2.5秒から始まり、4本ごとに短くなって約1.2秒まで縮みます。"

msgid ""
"The express week, the weekly: 60 trains. The window starts at about 2.2 "
"seconds and shrinks every 5 trains, down to about 0.9 seconds. A new one "
"comes every Monday."
msgstr ""
"急行の週、ウィークリー：列車60本。応答時間は約2.2秒から始まり、5本ごとに短くなって約0.9秒まで縮みます。毎週月曜に新しくなります。"

msgid "The express week, the weekly: 60 trains."
msgstr "急行の週、ウィークリー：列車60本。"

msgid ""
"The window starts at about 2.2 seconds and shrinks every 5 trains, down to "
"about 0.9 seconds."
