msgstr "{pressed}で信号を下げます。"

#. placeholders: {pressed}
msgid "{pressed} rings the bell back."
msgstr "{pressed}でベルを返します。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Tick"
msgstr "刻み"

msgid ""
"Tick: a dry, quiet tap that keeps the tempo. It quickens as the window "
"shrinks."
msgstr "刻み：テンポを刻む、乾いた小さなトン。応答時間が短くなるほど速くなります。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid ""
"a dry, quiet tap that keeps the tempo. It quickens as the window shrinks."
msgstr "テンポを刻む、乾いた小さなトン。応答時間が短くなるほど速くなります。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Train passing"
msgstr "列車の通過"

msgid ""
"Train passing: a rush from left to right. Your answer was right and the "
"train is through."
msgstr "列車の通過：左から右へ駆け抜ける音。応答が正しく、列車が通りました。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid ""
"a rush from left to right. Your answer was right and the train is through."
msgstr "左から右へ駆け抜ける音。応答が正しく、列車が通りました。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Steam special"
msgstr "蒸気の特別列車"

msgid ""
"Steam special: steam chuffs and a two-note whistle as the train rushes by. "
"At the steam gala, every fifth train is the special, worth 3 points."
msgstr ""
"蒸気の特別列車：蒸気のシュッシュッという音と二音の汽笛とともに列車が駆け抜けます。蒸気機関車まつりでは、五本目ごとの列車が3点の特別列車です。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid ""
"steam chuffs and a two-note whistle as the train rushes by. At the steam "
"gala, every fifth train is the special, worth 3 points."
msgstr "蒸気のシュッシュッという音と二音の汽笛とともに列車が駆け抜けます。蒸気機関車まつりでは、五本目ごとの列車が3点の特別列車です。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Ghost train"
msgstr "幽霊列車"

msgid ""
"Ghost train: the rush with a long, falling, ghostly whistle. On Friday the "
"13th, the thirteenth train of the night shift went through."
msgstr "幽霊列車：駆け抜ける音に、長く下がっていく不気味な汽笛。13日の金曜日、夜勤の十三番目の列車が通りました。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid ""
"the rush with a long, falling, ghostly whistle. On Friday the 13th, the "
"thirteenth train of the night shift went through."
msgstr "駆け抜ける音に、長く下がっていく不気味な汽笛。13日の金曜日、夜勤の十三番目の列車が通りました。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Streak chime"
msgstr "連続のチャイム"

msgid ""
"Streak chime: a bright rising run. Another 10 trains in a row, for a bonus "
"of 5 points."
msgstr "連続のチャイム：明るく上がっていく音。また10本連続、ボーナス5点です。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid ""
"a bright rising run. Another 10 trains in a row, for a bonus of 5 points."
msgstr "明るく上がっていく音。また10本連続、ボーナス5点です。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Brake screech"
msgstr "ブレーキのきしみ"

msgid ""
"Brake screech: a long squeal and a crash. A wrong or late answer derailed "
"the train, and the shift is over."
msgstr "ブレーキのきしみ：長い悲鳴と衝突音。間違いか遅れで列車が脱線し、勤務は終わりです。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid ""
"a long squeal and a crash. A wrong or late answer derailed the train, and "
"the shift is over."
msgstr "長い悲鳴と衝突音。間違いか遅れで列車が脱線し、勤務は終わりです。"

#. placeholders: {word}, {sound_words}
msgid "The {word} call: {sound_words}."
msgstr "{word}の呼び出し：{sound_words}。"

msgid "Return to the Signal Box title."
msgstr "Signal Boxのタイトルに戻ります。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Five calls, five keys."
msgstr "五つの呼び出し、五つのキー。"

#. placeholders: {join}
msgid "Five calls, five keys. {join}. Press each to play its call."
msgstr "五つの呼び出し、五つのキー。{join}。それぞれ押して呼び出しを聞きましょう。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Press each to play its call."
msgstr "それぞれ押して呼び出しを聞きましょう。"

msgid "Those are all five."
msgstr "これで五つ全部です。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Listen for each call and answer with its matching key."
msgstr "呼び出しをよく聞き、対応するキーで応えましょう。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Now the practice room, with no clock."
msgstr "次は時計のない練習室です。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}, {sentence_start2}, {TRAINS}
msgid ""
"Now the practice room, with no clock. {sentence_start} opens the line. "
"Listen for each call and answer with its matching key. Take as long as you "
"need in practice. {sentence_start2} says the call again. Send {TRAINS} "
"trains through."
msgstr ""
"次は時計のない練習室です。{sentence_start}で路線を開きます。呼び出しをよく聞き、対応するキーで応えましょう。練習なので、ゆっくりで大丈夫"
"です。{sentence_start2}で呼び出しをもう一度言います。列車を{TRAINS}本通しましょう。"

#. placeholders: {TRAINS}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Send {TRAINS} trains through."
msgstr "列車を{TRAINS}本通しましょう。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Take as long as you need in practice."
msgstr "練習なので、ゆっくりで大丈夫です。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start2}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{sentence_start2} says the call again."
msgstr "{sentence_start2}で呼び出しをもう一度言います。"

#. placeholders: {TRAINS}
msgid "{TRAINS} trains through."
msgstr "列車{TRAINS}本が通過。"

msgid ""
"You work the signal box on a country junction at night, answering the "
"dispatcher's calls before each train arrives"
msgstr "夜の田舎の分岐点で信号所を受け持ち、列車が来る前に指令員の呼び出しに応えます"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "A wrong or late answer derails the train and ends the shift."
msgstr "間違えたり遅れたりすると列車が脱線し、勤務は終わりです。"

#. placeholders: {window_words}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"On a shift each call has a time window, {window_words} at first and "
"shrinking as you go."
msgstr "勤務では呼び出しごとに応答時間があります。最初は{window_words}で、進むほど短くなります。"

#. placeholders: {window_words}, {sentence_start}
msgid ""
"On a shift each call has a time window, {window_words} at first and "
"shrinking as you go. A wrong or late answer derails the train and ends the "
"shift. {sentence_start} speaks the shift and your score."
msgstr ""
"勤務では呼び出しごとに応答時間があります。最初は{window_words}で、進むほど短くなります。間違えたり遅れたりすると列車が脱線し、勤務は終わり"
"です。{sentence_start}で勤務とスコアを伝えます。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{sentence_start} speaks the shift and your score."
msgstr "{sentence_start}で勤務とスコアを伝えます。"

msgid ""
"Keep a small tea house at your own pace. Guests name a taste. You choose "
"tea and a cup, heat the water, pour, and time the steep. Every cup pleases "
"someone. A perfect cup earns a note and a tip."
msgstr ""
"小さな茶屋を、自分のペースで切り盛りしましょう。お客さんが好みの味を伝えます。お茶と器を選び、お湯を沸かし、注いで、蒸らす時間を計ります。どの一杯も誰か"
"を喜ばせます。完璧な一杯には、メモとチップがつきます。"

msgid "Keep a small tea house at your own pace."
msgstr "小さな茶屋を、自分のペースで切り盛りしましょう。"

msgid "Guests name a taste."
msgstr "お客さんが好みの味を伝えます。"

msgid "You choose tea and a cup, heat the water, pour, and time the steep."
msgstr "お茶と器を選び、お湯を沸かし、注いで、蒸らす時間を計ります。"

msgid "Every cup pleases someone."
msgstr "どの一杯も誰かを喜ばせます。"

msgid "A perfect cup earns a note and a tip."
msgstr "完璧な一杯には、メモとチップがつきます。"

msgid "A guest comes in"
msgstr "お客さんが来る"

msgid ""
"A guest comes to the counter and asks for a taste, such as \"something smoky "
"and strong\" or \"a calm cup before bed\". Guests may want something calm, "
"bright, strong, smoky, floral, warming, sweet or fresh. Any key hurries "
"their walk to the counter. R repeats their request."
msgstr ""
"お客さんがカウンターに来て、「スモーキーで濃いのを」や「寝る前に落ち着く一杯を」のように好みの味を頼みます。好みは、落ち着く、すっきり、濃い、スモーキー"
"、花の香り、温まる、甘い、さわやか、のどれかです。どのキーでも、カウンターまで急いで来てもらえます。Rで注文をくり返します。"

msgid ""
"A guest comes to the counter and asks for a taste, such as \"something smoky "
"and strong\" or \"a calm cup before bed\"."
msgstr "お客さんがカウンターに来て、「スモーキーで濃いのを」や「寝る前に落ち着く一杯を」のように好みの味を頼みます。"

msgid ""
"Guests may want something calm, bright, strong, smoky, floral, warming, "
"sweet or fresh."
msgstr "好みは、落ち着く、すっきり、濃い、スモーキー、花の香り、温まる、甘い、さわやか、のどれかです。"

msgid "Any key hurries their walk to the counter."
msgstr "どのキーでも、カウンターまで急いで来てもらえます。"

msgid "R repeats their request."
msgstr "Rで注文をくり返します。"

msgid "The shelf and your cups"
msgstr "棚と器"

msgid ""
"Up and Down move along your shelf. Each tea is named, with a short "
"description. Left and Right choose a cup from your cupboard. Tab says more "
"about the tea: the tastes it suits, the heat it needs and its steeping "
"time. Space puts the tea in the pot. Up or Down before the kettle is on "
"takes you back to the shelf."
msgstr ""
"UpとDownで棚を移動します。お茶ごとに名前と短い説明があります。LeftとRightで食器棚から器を選びます。Tabでお茶の詳しい説明、合う味、必要"
"な温度、蒸らし時間を伝えます。Spaceでお茶をポットに入れます。やかんを火にかける前なら、UpかDownで棚に戻れます。"

msgid "Up and Down move along your shelf."
msgstr "UpとDownで棚を移動します。"

msgid "Each tea is named, with a short description."
msgstr "お茶ごとに名前と短い説明があります。"

msgid "Left and Right choose a cup from your cupboard."
msgstr "LeftとRightで食器棚から器を選びます。"

msgid ""
"Tab says more about the tea: the tastes it suits, the heat it needs and its "
"steeping time."
msgstr "Tabでお茶の詳しい説明、合う味、必要な温度、蒸らし時間を伝えます。"

msgid "Space puts the tea in the pot."
msgstr "Spaceでお茶をポットに入れます。"

msgid "Up or Down before the kettle is on takes you back to the shelf."
msgstr "やかんを火にかける前なら、UpかDownで棚に戻れます。"

msgid ""
"Each cup suits some tastes: the big mug for strong and warming cups, the "
"clay cup for calm and smoky ones, the glass for fresh and bright ones, the "
"thin porcelain for floral and sweet ones. A cup that suits the taste makes "
"the guest a little happier. The plain white cup is good for anything."
msgstr ""
"器ごとに合う味があります。大きなマグは濃いものと温まるもの、土の器は落ち着くものとスモーキーなもの、ガラスはさわやかなものとすっきりしたもの、薄い磁器は"
"花の香りと甘いもの。味に合う器だと、お客さんが少し喜びます。白い無地のカップは何にでも合います。"

msgid ""
"Each cup suits some tastes: the big mug for strong and warming cups, the "
"clay cup for calm and smoky ones, the glass for fresh and bright ones, the "
"thin porcelain for floral and sweet ones."
msgstr ""
"器ごとに合う味があります。大きなマグは濃いものと温まるもの、土の器は落ち着くものとスモーキーなもの、ガラスはさわやかなものとすっきりしたもの、薄い磁器は"
"花の香りと甘いもの。"

msgid "A cup that suits the taste makes the guest a little happier."
msgstr "味に合う器だと、お客さんが少し喜びます。"

msgid "The plain white cup is good for anything."
msgstr "白い無地のカップは何にでも合います。"

msgid "The kettle"
msgstr "やかん"

msgid ""
"Space puts the kettle on. From cold to boiling takes about 13 seconds. "
"Space again takes the kettle off and pours onto the leaves."
msgstr "Spaceでやかんを火にかけます。水から沸騰まで約13秒です。もう一度Spaceでやかんを下ろし、茶葉に注ぎます。"

msgid "Space puts the kettle on."
msgstr "Spaceでやかんを火にかけます。"

msgid "From cold to boiling takes about 13 seconds."
msgstr "水から沸騰まで約13秒です。"

msgid "Space again takes the kettle off and pours onto the leaves."
msgstr "もう一度Spaceでやかんを下ろし、茶葉に注ぎます。"

msgid ""
"Each tea needs a different water temperature. Green and white teas want "
"around 75 or 80 degrees, oolongs and roasted teas about 90, and black teas "
"and herbs 100 degrees. S gives the current temperature and the temperature "
"the tea wants. Tab lets you listen closely to the kettle."
msgstr ""
"お茶ごとに合うお湯の温度が違います。緑茶と白茶は75度か80度くらい、烏龍茶と焙じたお茶は90度くらい、紅茶とハーブは100度です。Sで今の温度とお茶に"
"合う温度を伝えます。Tabでやかんの音をよく聞けます。"

msgid "Each tea needs a different water temperature."
msgstr "お茶ごとに合うお湯の温度が違います。"

msgid ""
"Green and white teas want around 75 or 80 degrees, oolongs and roasted teas "
"about 90, and black teas and herbs 100 degrees."
msgstr "緑茶と白茶は75度か80度くらい、烏龍茶と焙じたお茶は90度くらい、紅茶とハーブは100度です。"

msgid "S gives the current temperature and the temperature the tea wants."
msgstr "Sで今の温度とお茶に合う温度を伝えます。"

msgid "Tab lets you listen closely to the kettle."
msgstr "Tabでやかんの音をよく聞けます。"

msgid "Steeping"
msgstr "蒸らし"

msgid ""
"Once the water is poured, the leaves begin to steep. Space lifts them out. "
"Each tea needs 5 to 15 seconds: green teas less, herbs more. Tab says "
"whether the tea is still pale, taking colour, rich and ready, getting "
"strong or very strong. S gives the seconds so far. After 40 seconds the "
"leaves come out on their own."
msgstr ""
"お湯を注ぐと、茶葉が蒸れ始めます。Spaceで茶葉を引き上げます。お茶ごとに5秒から15秒、緑茶は短め、ハーブは長めです。Tabで、まだ薄い、色づいてき"
"た、濃くてちょうどいい、濃くなってきた、とても濃い、のどれかを伝えます。Sでここまでの秒数を伝えます。40秒たつと茶葉は自然に引き上げられます。"

msgid "Once the water is poured, the leaves begin to steep."
msgstr "お湯を注ぐと、茶葉が蒸れ始めます。"

msgid "Space lifts them out."
msgstr "Spaceで茶葉を引き上げます。"

msgid "Each tea needs 5 to 15 seconds: green teas less, herbs more."
msgstr "お茶ごとに5秒から15秒、緑茶は短め、ハーブは長めです。"

msgid ""
"Tab says whether the tea is still pale, taking colour, rich and ready, "
"getting strong or very strong."
msgstr "Tabで、まだ薄い、色づいてきた、濃くてちょうどいい、濃くなってきた、とても濃い、のどれかを伝えます。"

msgid "S gives the seconds so far."
msgstr "Sでここまでの秒数を伝えます。"

msgid "After 40 seconds the leaves come out on their own."
msgstr "40秒たつと茶葉は自然に引き上げられます。"

msgid "How the cup went"
msgstr "一杯の出来"

msgid ""
"The guest drinks and says how it was: perfect, lovely, pleasant or kind. "
"Every cup scores up to 100. A tea that suits the guest's taste is worth the "
"most, then water at the right heat, within 3 degrees, and the right steep, "
"within 1 second. A cup that suits the taste adds a little. A perfect cup "
"needs 90. When a cup is not perfect, the guest says the one thing that "
"would help most, such as \"A little strong\" or \"It wanted hotter water.\""
msgstr ""
"お客さんが飲んで、感想を言います。完璧、とてもおいしい、おいしい、やさしい味。どの一杯も最高100点です。いちばん大事なのは好みに合うお茶、次に3度以内"
"の正しい温度と、1秒以内の正しい蒸らし時間。味に合う器で少し加点。完璧な一杯には90点が必要です。完璧でないときは、お客さんがいちばん役立つ一言を言いま"
"す。「少し濃いね」や「もっと熱いお湯がよかった」などです。"

msgid ""
"The guest drinks and says how it was: perfect, lovely, pleasant or kind."
msgstr "お客さんが飲んで、感想を言います。完璧、とてもおいしい、おいしい、やさしい味。"

msgid "Every cup scores up to 100."
msgstr "どの一杯も最高100点です。"

msgid ""
"A tea that suits the guest's taste is worth the most, then water at the "
"right heat, within 3 degrees, and the right steep, within 1 second."
msgstr "いちばん大事なのは好みに合うお茶、次に3度以内の正しい温度と、1秒以内の正しい蒸らし時間です。"

msgid "A cup that suits the taste adds a little."
msgstr "味に合う器で少し加点されます。"

msgid "A perfect cup needs 90."
msgstr "完璧な一杯には90点が必要です。"

msgid ""
"When a cup is not perfect, the guest says the one thing that would help "
"most, such as \"A little strong\" or \"It wanted hotter water.\""
msgstr "完璧でないときは、お客さんがいちばん役立つ一言を言います。「少し濃いね」や「もっと熱いお湯がよかった」などです。"

msgid "Coins and tips"
msgstr "お代とチップ"

msgid ""
"Every cup pays 2 coins. A lovely cup pays 3. A perfect cup pays 2 and "
"leaves a tip of 3, with a kind note on the saucer. A pot poured for two "
"pays twice. Coins are kept between visits. S says the coins earned so far."
msgstr ""
"どの一杯も2枚のお代。とてもおいしい一杯は3枚。完璧な一杯は2枚に、受け皿にやさしいメモを添えてチップ3枚。二人分のポットは二倍です。お代は来館をまたい"
"で残ります。Sでここまでのお代を伝えます。"

msgid "Every cup pays 2 coins."
msgstr "どの一杯も2枚のお代がもらえます。"

msgid "A lovely cup pays 3."
msgstr "とてもおいしい一杯は3枚です。"

msgid ""
"A perfect cup pays 2 and leaves a tip of 3, with a kind note on the saucer."
msgstr "完璧な一杯は2枚に、受け皿にやさしいメモを添えてチップ3枚です。"

msgid "A pot poured for two pays twice."
msgstr "二人分のポットは二倍です。"

msgid "Coins are kept between visits."
msgstr "お代は来館をまたいで残ります。"

msgid "S says the coins earned so far."
msgstr "Sでここまでのお代を伝えます。"

msgid ""
"The shop is on the title, and on the results after each afternoon as Visit "
"the shop. It sells 11 more teas, 4 more cups, a music box with three tunes, "
"and a sand timer. A new tea goes on your shelf, a new cup in your cupboard. "
"The music box plays its tune quietly in the tea house. The Music box row in "
"Settings changes the tune or turns it off, from the title or the pause "
"menu. The sand timer alerts you when the tea has steeped for its target "
"time."
msgstr ""
"お店はタイトルにあり、毎日の午後の後の結果にも、お店に寄るとして出ます。お茶がさらに11種類、器が4つ、三つの曲が入ったオルゴール、砂時計を売っています"
"。新しいお茶は棚に、新しい器は食器棚に入ります。オルゴールは茶屋で静かに曲を流します。設定のオルゴールの項目で、タイトルか一時停止メニューから曲を変えた"
"り止めたりできます。砂時計は、お茶が目標の時間だけ蒸れたら知らせてくれます。"

msgid ""
"The shop is on the title, and on the results after each afternoon as Visit "
"the shop."
msgstr "お店はタイトルにあり、毎日の午後の後の結果にも、お店に寄るとして出ます。"

msgid ""
"It sells 11 more teas, 4 more cups, a music box with three tunes, and a "
"sand timer."
msgstr "お茶がさらに11種類、器が4つ、三つの曲が入ったオルゴール、砂時計を売っています。"

msgid "A new tea goes on your shelf, a new cup in your cupboard."
msgstr "新しいお茶は棚に、新しい器は食器棚に入ります。"

msgid "The music box plays its tune quietly in the tea house."
msgstr "オルゴールは茶屋で静かに曲を流します。"

msgid ""
"The Music box row in Settings changes the tune or turns it off, from the "
"title or the pause menu."
msgstr "設定のオルゴールの項目で、タイトルか一時停止メニューから曲を変えたり止めたりできます。"

msgid ""
"The sand timer alerts you when the tea has steeped for its target time."
msgstr "砂時計は、お茶が目標の時間だけ蒸れたら知らせてくれます。"

msgid "Regulars and their stories"
msgstr "常連さんとその物語"

msgid ""
"Some guests are regulars. Each visit they tell you the next part of their "
"story: a retired postman walking his old round, a nurse and her balcony "
"tomato plant, a cello student and her dog, a clockmaker mending the town "
"clock, and more who come in later. The guest book on the title keeps every "
"part you have heard. A regular never comes in two afternoons running if "
"another is waiting their turn."
msgstr ""
"常連さんもいます。来るたびに、物語の続きを話してくれます。昔の配達ルートを歩く引退した郵便屋さん、ベランダのトマトを育てる看護師さん、チェロを学ぶ学生さ"
"んとその犬、町の時計を直す時計職人さん、そして後から来る人たち。タイトルの芳名帳に、聞いた話がすべて残ります。ほかの常連さんが順番を待っているときは、同"
"じ常連さんが二日続けて来ることはありません。"

msgid "Some guests are regulars."
msgstr "常連さんもいます。"

msgid ""
"Each visit they tell you the next part of their story: a retired postman "
"walking his old round, a nurse and her balcony tomato plant, a cello "
"student and her dog, a clockmaker mending the town clock, and more who come "
"in later."
msgstr ""
"来るたびに、物語の続きを話してくれます。昔の配達ルートを歩く引退した郵便屋さん、ベランダのトマトを育てる看護師さん、チェロを学ぶ学生さんとその犬、町の時"
"計を直す時計職人さん、そして後から来る人たち。"

msgid "The guest book on the title keeps every part you have heard."
msgstr "タイトルの芳名帳に、聞いた話がすべて残ります。"

msgid ""
"A regular never comes in two afternoons running if another is waiting their "
"turn."
msgstr "ほかの常連さんが順番を待っているときは、同じ常連さんが二日続けて来ることはありません。"

msgid "Seasons and holidays"
msgstr "季節と祝日"

msgid ""
"Your shelf has a blend for each season, free all season: Spring meadow from "
"March to May, Summer berry from June to August and Autumn hearth from "
"September to November."
msgstr ""
"棚には季節ごとのブレンドがあり、その季節のあいだは無料です。三月から五月は春の草原、六月から八月は夏のベリー、九月から十一月は秋の暖炉。"

msgid ""
"On certain holidays a special guest comes in at the end of the afternoon, "
"with a special brew on your shelf for that day only. Lunar New Year brings "
"Mei with tangerine oolong. Valentine's Day brings an old couple for rose "
"tea for two, one pot poured into two cups. The spring equinox brings cherry "
"blossom tea, midsummer an iced mint tea, steeped short and poured over ice, "
"and the autumn equinox roasted barley. On Halloween a cloaked stranger asks "
"for a smoky lapsang, and pays the way Lantern Jack always pays. "
"Thanksgiving brings spiced apple."
msgstr ""
"祝日によっては、午後の終わりに特別なお客さんが来て、その日だけ棚に特別なお茶が並びます。旧正月にはMeiがみかんの烏龍茶を求めて来ます。バレンタインデー"
"には老夫婦が来て、二人分のバラのお茶を一つのポットから二つのカップに。春分には桜のお茶、夏至には短く蒸らして氷に注ぐアイスミントティー、秋分には麦茶。ハ"
"ロウィンにはマントの見知らぬ人がスモーキーなラプサンを頼み、Lantern Jackのいつものやり方で支払います。感謝祭にはスパイスアップル。"

msgid ""
"On certain holidays a special guest comes in at the end of the afternoon, "
"with a special brew on your shelf for that day only."
msgstr "祝日によっては、午後の終わりに特別なお客さんが来て、その日だけ棚に特別なお茶が並びます。"

msgid "Lunar New Year brings Mei with tangerine oolong."
msgstr "旧正月にはMeiがみかんの烏龍茶を求めて来ます。"

msgid ""
"Valentine's Day brings an old couple for rose tea for two, one pot poured "
"into two cups."
msgstr "バレンタインデーには老夫婦が来て、二人分のバラのお茶を一つのポットから二つのカップに。"

msgid ""
"The spring equinox brings cherry blossom tea, midsummer an iced mint tea, "
"steeped short and poured over ice, and the autumn equinox roasted barley."
msgstr "春分には桜のお茶、夏至には短く蒸らして氷に注ぐアイスミントティー、秋分には麦茶。"

msgid ""
"On Halloween a cloaked stranger asks for a smoky lapsang, and pays the way "
"Lantern Jack always pays."
msgstr "ハロウィンにはマントの見知らぬ人がスモーキーなラプサンを頼み、Lantern Jackのいつものやり方で支払います。"

msgid "Thanksgiving brings spiced apple."
msgstr "感謝祭にはスパイスアップル。"

msgid ""
"Each holiday guest leaves a keepsake, which the Keepsakes row on the title "
"keeps, with its year. The day counts from the day before to the day after, "
"so it falls right in every time zone. In the days before a holiday, a "
"regular may mention it."
msgstr ""
"祝日のお客さんはそれぞれ記念品を残していき、タイトルの記念品の項目に年と一緒に残ります。祝日は前の日から次の日まで数えるので、どのタイムゾーンでもちゃん"
"と当たります。祝日の数日前には、常連さんが話題にすることもあります。"

msgid ""
"Each holiday guest leaves a keepsake, which the Keepsakes row on the title "
"keeps, with its year."
msgstr "祝日のお客さんはそれぞれ記念品を残していき、タイトルの記念品の項目に年と一緒に残ります。"

msgid ""
"The day counts from the day before to the day after, so it falls right in "
"every time zone."
msgstr "祝日は前の日から次の日まで数えるので、どのタイムゾーンでもちゃんと当たります。"

msgid "In the days before a holiday, a regular may mention it."
msgstr "祝日の数日前には、常連さんが話題にすることもあります。"

msgid ""
"After 3 afternoons the long evening opens on the title: seven guests on a "
"rainy evening, three of them regulars. It keeps its own best."
msgstr "午後を3回過ごすと、タイトルに長い夜が解放されます。雨の夜に七人のお客さん、そのうち三人は常連さんです。ベストは別に残ります。"

msgid ""
"After 3 afternoons the long evening opens on the title: seven guests on a "
"rainy evening, three of them regulars."
msgstr "午後を3回過ごすと、タイトルに長い夜が解放されます。雨の夜に七人のお客さん、そのうち三人は常連さんです。"

msgid "It keeps its own best."
msgstr "ベストは別に残ります。"

msgid ""
"Practice brewing is a quiet place to learn the kettle. Brew any tea on your "
"shelf for yourself, as often as you like. After each cup the game reads the "
"exact heat you poured at and the seconds you steeped, beside what the tea "
"wants. There are no guests and no coins."
msgstr ""
"お茶の練習は、やかんに慣れるための静かな場所です。棚のどのお茶でも、自分のために何度でも淹れられます。一杯ごとに、注いだときの正確な温度と蒸らした秒数を"
"、お茶に合う値と並べて伝えます。お客さんもお代もありません。"

msgid "Practice brewing is a quiet place to learn the kettle."
msgstr "お茶の練習は、やかんに慣れるための静かな場所です。"

msgid "Brew any tea on your shelf for yourself, as often as you like."
msgstr "棚のどのお茶でも、自分のために何度でも淹れられます。"

msgid ""
"After each cup the game reads the exact heat you poured at and the seconds "
"you steeped, beside what the tea wants."
msgstr "一杯ごとに、注いだときの正確な温度と蒸らした秒数を、お茶に合う値と並べて伝えます。"

msgid "There are no guests and no coins."
msgstr "お客さんもお代もありません。"

msgid ""
"H gives a hint for what you are doing: teas on your shelf that suit the "
"guest's taste and a cup that suits it, when to pour by the kettle's song, "
"or how many seconds the tea likes. Hints are free. You can use as many as "
"you like."
msgstr ""
"Hで、今していることのヒントを伝えます。お客さんの好みに合う棚のお茶と器、やかんの歌で注ぐタイミング、お茶に合う秒数などです。ヒントは無料です。何度でも"
"使えます。"

msgid ""
"H gives a hint for what you are doing: teas on your shelf that suit the "
"guest's taste and a cup that suits it, when to pour by the kettle's song, "
"or how many seconds the tea likes."
msgstr "Hで、今していることのヒントを伝えます。お客さんの好みに合う棚のお茶と器、やかんの歌で注ぐタイミング、お茶に合う秒数などです。"

msgid "Hints are free."
msgstr "ヒントは無料です。"

msgid "You can use as many as you like."
msgstr "何度でも使えます。"

msgid ""
"With spoken call-outs on, the game also names the kettle's heat as it "
"changes, such as \"Soft hiss, about 80 degrees\", and the steep's seconds "
"every 5 seconds. Turn them off in Settings, from the title or the pause "
"menu, to brew without them. Nothing changes in how a cup is judged."
msgstr ""
"音声の案内がオンなら、やかんの温度が変わるたびに「静かなシューッ、約80度」のように伝え、蒸らしの秒数を5秒ごとに伝えます。タイトルか一時停止メニューの"
"設定でオフにすると、案内なしで淹れられます。一杯の評価は変わりません。"

msgid ""
"With spoken call-outs on, the game also names the kettle's heat as it "
"changes, such as \"Soft hiss, about 80 degrees\", and the steep's seconds "
"every 5 seconds."
msgstr "音声の案内がオンなら、やかんの温度が変わるたびに「静かなシューッ、約80度」のように伝え、蒸らしの秒数を5秒ごとに伝えます。"

msgid ""
"Turn them off in Settings, from the title or the pause menu, to brew "
"without them."
msgstr "タイトルか一時停止メニューの設定でオフにすると、案内なしで淹れられます。"

msgid "Nothing changes in how a cup is judged."
msgstr "一杯の評価は変わりません。"

msgid ""
"Every player gets the same guests. The daily is 3 guests, the weekly 6, and "
"the monthly is the tasting society: 5 members who each ask for a tea by "
"name. In a challenge every year-round tea and every cup is yours, the sand "
"timer stays at home, and no coins are earned. Each cup scores up to 100, "
"and the scores are added. Your result counts once the last guest has their "
"cup. Leave the challenge, on the pause menu, does not count, so you can "
"come back later."
msgstr ""
"全員に同じお客さんが来ます。デイリーは3人、ウィークリーは6人、マンスリーは利き茶の会で、5人の会員がそれぞれお茶を名前で頼みます。チャレンジでは一年中"
"あるお茶と器がすべて使え、砂時計はお留守番、お代はもらえません。一杯ごとに最高100点で、合計されます。結果は最後のお客さんがお茶を受け取ったときに数え"
"られます。一時停止メニューのチャレンジをやめるは数えられないので、後でまた挑めます。"

msgid "Every player gets the same guests."
msgstr "全員に同じお客さんが来ます。"

msgid ""
"The daily is 3 guests, the weekly 6, and the monthly is the tasting "
"society: 5 members who each ask for a tea by name."
msgstr "デイリーは3人、ウィークリーは6人、マンスリーは利き茶の会で、5人の会員がそれぞれお茶を名前で頼みます。"

msgid ""
"In a challenge every year-round tea and every cup is yours, the sand timer "
"stays at home, and no coins are earned."
msgstr "チャレンジでは一年中あるお茶と器がすべて使え、砂時計はお留守番、お代はもらえません。"

msgid "Each cup scores up to 100, and the scores are added."
msgstr "一杯ごとに最高100点で、合計されます。"

msgid "Your result counts once the last guest has their cup."
msgstr "結果は最後のお客さんがお茶を受け取ったときに数えられます。"

msgid ""
"Leave the challenge, on the pause menu, does not count, so you can come "
"back later."
msgstr "一時停止メニューのチャレンジをやめるは数えられないので、後でまた挑めます。"

msgid ""
"Records keep the afternoons and evenings you have played, cups served, "
"perfect cups, coins earned, your best afternoon and best evening in coins, "
"teas discovered out of every tea there is, keepsakes, and your challenge "
"results."
msgstr ""
"記録には、過ごした午後と夜、出した杯数、完璧な一杯、稼いだお代、お代でのベストの午後とベストの夜、全種類のうち見つけたお茶、記念品、チャレンジの結果が残"
"ります。"

msgid "Sound check, on the title, plays the gameplay cues."
msgstr "タイトルのサウンドテストで、プレイ中の音を再生します。"

msgid "Up and Down: move along the shelf."
msgstr "UpとDown：棚を移動する。"

msgid "Left and Right: choose a cup."
msgstr "LeftとRight：器を選ぶ。"

msgid ""
"Space: choose the tea, put the kettle on, pour, lift the leaves, pour each "
"cup of a pot, then welcome the next guest."
msgstr "Space：お茶を選ぶ、やかんを火にかける、注ぐ、茶葉を引き上げる、ポットから一杯ずつ注ぐ、次のお客さんを迎える。"

msgid ""
"Tab: more about the tea, the kettle up close, or breathe in the steam."
msgstr "Tab：お茶の詳しい説明、やかんの音をよく聞く、湯気を吸い込む。"

msgid ""
"S: status: the kettle, the steep or the cups, and while you choose, what "
"the guest would like. Press S again straight away for which guest this is, "
"what they would like and your coins."
msgstr ""
"S：状況。やかん、蒸らし、カップのこと、選んでいる間はお客さんの好みを伝えます。すぐにもう一度Sを押すと、どのお客さんか、何が欲しいか、お代を伝えます。"

msgid ""
"S: status: the kettle, the steep or the cups, and while you choose, what "
"the guest would like."
msgstr "S：状況。やかん、蒸らし、カップのこと、選んでいる間はお客さんの好みを伝えます。"

msgid ""
"Press S again straight away for which guest this is, what they would like "
"and your coins."
msgstr "すぐにもう一度Sを押すと、どのお客さんか、何が欲しいか、お代を伝えます。"

msgid "R: repeat the guest's words."
msgstr "R：お客さんの言葉をくり返す。"

msgid "Today's tasting"
msgstr "今日の利き茶"

msgid "The busy week"
msgstr "忙しい一週間"

msgid "The tasting society"
msgstr "利き茶の会"

msgid "3 guests, the whole shelf"
msgstr "お客さん3人、棚のお茶すべて"

msgid "6 guests, scores added"
msgstr "お客さん6人、スコア合計"

msgid "5 tasters, each names a tea"
msgstr "利き手5人、それぞれお茶を名指し"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Each cup scores up to 100 for the right tea, water and steep."
msgstr "一杯ごとに、正しいお茶、お湯、蒸らしで最高100点。"

#. placeholders: {n}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{n} members of the tasting society each ask for a tea by name."
msgstr "利き茶の会の会員{n}人が、それぞれお茶を名前で頼みます。"

#. placeholders: {n}
msgid ""
"{n} members of the tasting society each ask for a tea by name. Each cup "
"scores up to 100 for the right tea, water and steep."
msgstr "利き茶の会の会員{n}人が、それぞれお茶を名前で頼みます。一杯ごとに、正しいお茶、お湯、蒸らしで最高100点。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Each cup scores up to 100."
msgstr "一杯ごとに最高100点。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Every year-round tea and cup is yours for the day."
msgstr "今日は一年中あるお茶と器がすべて使えます。"

#. placeholders: {n}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{n} guests each ask for a taste."
msgstr "お客さん{n}人が、それぞれ好みの味を頼みます。"

#. placeholders: {n}
msgid ""
"{n} guests each ask for a taste. Every year-round tea and cup is yours for "
"the day. Each cup scores up to 100."
msgstr "お客さん{n}人が、それぞれ好みの味を頼みます。今日は一年中あるお茶と器がすべて使えます。一杯ごとに最高100点。"

msgid "Slow Kettle"
msgstr "Slow Kettle"

msgid ""
"Up and Down choose a challenge, Enter reads its briefing, Escape goes back. "
"Every player gets the same guests: new ones each day, each Monday and each "
"month."
msgstr ""
"UpとDownでチャレンジを選び、Enterでブリーフィングを読み、Escapeで戻ります。全員に同じお客さんが来ます。毎日、毎週月曜、毎月新しいお客さ"
"んです。"

msgid "Challenge cups earn no coins, and your sand timer stays at home."
msgstr "チャレンジの一杯ではお代はもらえず、砂時計はお留守番です。"

msgid "Opening the Slow Kettle challenge."
msgstr "Slow Kettleのチャレンジを開きます。"

#. placeholders: {title}, {score}, {cups_words}, {perfect}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{title} result: {score} points from {cups_words}, {perfect} perfect."
msgstr "{title}の結果：{cups_words}で{score}点、完璧{perfect}。"

#. placeholders: {title}, {score}, {cups_words}, {perfect}, {score_line}
msgid ""
"{title} result: {score} points from {cups_words}, {perfect} perfect. "
"{score_line}"
msgstr "{title}の結果：{cups_words}で{score}点、完璧{perfect}。{score_line}"

msgid "valentines"
msgstr ""

msgid "halloween"
msgstr ""

msgid "thanksgiving"
msgstr ""

msgid "Lunar New Year tea"
msgstr "旧正月のお茶"

msgid "Valentine's tea for two"
msgstr "バレンタインの二人のお茶"

msgid "Cherry blossom day"
msgstr "桜の日"

msgid "Midsummer iced mint"
msgstr "夏至のアイスミント"

msgid "Equinox barley"
msgstr "彼岸の麦茶"

msgid "Halloween night"
msgstr "ハロウィンの夜"

msgid "Thanksgiving apple tea"
msgstr "感謝祭のアップルティー"

#. placeholders: {zodiac}
msgid ""
"Mei from the bakery brings oolong and tangerines for the year of the "
"{zodiac}."
msgstr "パン屋のMeiが、{zodiac}年のために烏龍茶とみかんを持ってきます。"

msgid "An old couple shares a pot of rose tea, poured into two cups."
msgstr "老夫婦がバラのお茶をポットで分け合い、二つのカップに注ぎます。"

msgid ""
"A gardener comes in for cherry blossom tea on the first day of spring."
msgstr "春の最初の日に、庭師さんが桜のお茶を飲みに来ます。"

msgid "On the longest day, a boy with a kite asks for iced mint tea."
msgstr "一年でいちばん長い日に、凧を持った男の子がアイスミントティーを頼みます。"

msgid "A farmer from the valley brings roasted barley for the equinox."
msgstr "谷の農家さんが、彼岸に焙じた麦を持ってきます。"

msgid "A cloaked stranger visits the tea house for a smoky cup."
msgstr "マントの見知らぬ人が、スモーキーな一杯を求めて茶屋を訪れます。"

msgid "A grandmother with a pie stops in for spiced apple tea."
msgstr "パイを持ったおばあさんが、スパイスアップルティーを飲みに立ち寄ります。"

#. placeholders: {zodiac}
msgid "a {zodiac} cut from red paper"
msgstr "赤い紙で切った{zodiac}"

msgid "a pressed rose in wax paper"
msgstr "薄紙に挟んだ押しバラ"

msgid "a cherry blossom bookmark"
msgstr "桜のしおり"

msgid "a blue ribbon from a kite's tail"
msgstr "凧のしっぽの青いリボン"

msgid "a sheaf of barley tied with string"
msgstr "ひもで束ねた麦の束"

msgid "an old brass key, cold to the touch"
msgstr "古い真鍮の鍵、触るとひんやり"

msgid "a hand-written apple pie recipe"
msgstr "手書きのアップルパイのレシピ"

msgid ""
"The bakery has red lanterns in the window already. Mei says she will bring "
"you something for the new year."
msgstr "パン屋の窓にはもう赤いランタンが下がってるの。Meiが新年に何か持ってきてくれるって。"

msgid ""
"There is an old couple on my street, fifty years married. They say they "
"will come here for Valentine's Day."
msgstr "うちの通りに、結婚五十年の老夫婦がいてね。バレンタインデーにここに来るって言ってたよ。"

msgid "The cherry trees by the river are in bud. Spring is nearly here."
msgstr "川沿いの桜がつぼみをつけてる。もうすぐ春だね。"

msgid ""
"The evenings are so long now. On midsummer the light hardly leaves at all."
msgstr "最近は夕方がずいぶん長いね。夏至には、ほとんど日が沈まないくらい。"

msgid "The valley farms are bringing the barley in. The equinox is close."
msgstr "谷の農家が麦を取り入れてるよ。彼岸も近いね。"

msgid ""
"The lanes are full of carved pumpkins. They say a cloaked stranger takes "
"tea somewhere in town on Halloween."
msgstr "路地は彫ったカボチャでいっぱい。ハロウィンには、マントの見知らぬ人が町のどこかでお茶を飲むんだって。"

msgid ""
"My neighbour is baking pies already, for Thanksgiving. The whole stairwell "
"smells of apples."
msgstr "隣の人がもう感謝祭のパイを焼いてるの。階段じゅうがりんごの香りよ。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}, {days_phrase}
msgid "{sentence_start} is {days_phrase}."
msgstr "{sentence_start}は{days_phrase}です。"

msgid "hale"
msgstr ""

msgid "Mister Hale"
msgstr ""

msgid "a retired postman with a walking stick"
msgstr "杖をついた引退した郵便屋さん"

msgid ""
"I walked my old round today, just for the walk. Number 9 still has the dog "
"that used to chase me. He has gone grey, and so have I."
msgstr "今日は昔の配達ルートを歩いてきたよ、ただ散歩にね。9番地には、昔わしを追いかけた犬がまだいた。あいつも白髪になってたが、わしもだ。"

msgid ""
"The lady at number 14 kept every postcard her son ever sent. She read me "
"three of them. He writes from the sea."
msgstr "14番地のご婦人は、息子さんからの絵はがきを全部取ってあってね。三枚読んでくれたよ。息子さんは海から書いてくるんだ。"

msgid ""
"A woman at the end of Elm Row asked me to carry a letter one more time, by "
"hand, to her sister two streets over. They have not spoken in years."
msgstr ""
"Elm Rowの端の女性に、もう一度だけ手紙を運んでくれと頼まれてね。手渡しで、二本向こうの通りの妹さんへ。もう何年も口をきいていないそうだ。"

msgid ""
"The sisters had tea together on Sunday. I was invited. I took biscuits, and "
"nobody mentioned the years at all."
msgstr "日曜日、姉妹がいっしょにお茶をしたよ。わしも呼ばれてね。ビスケットを持っていったが、誰も昔のことは口にしなかった。"

msgid ""
"The post office asked me to show the new carrier the round. She is quick. "
"She already knows every dog by name."
msgstr "郵便局に頼まれて、新しい配達員にルートを案内したよ。手際のいい子でね。もう犬の名前を全部覚えている。"

msgid ""
"I have finished the whole round. Every door said hello. I think I will "
"start again in spring, just for the walk."
msgstr "ルートを全部歩き終えたよ。どの扉もあいさつしてくれた。春になったら、また散歩がてら始めようかな。"

msgid "Number 9's dog walked half the round with me today."
msgstr "今日は9番地の犬が、ルートの半分までついてきたよ。"

msgid "The sisters send their regards. They are knitting matching scarves."
msgstr "姉妹がよろしくと言っていたよ。おそろいのマフラーを編んでいるそうだ。"

msgid "My knees and I are getting along better these days."
msgstr "近ごろは、膝ともうまくやっているよ。"

msgid "To old rounds and new ones."
msgstr "昔のルートと、新しいルートに。"

msgid "june"
msgstr ""

msgid "a night-shift nurse, still in her coat"
msgstr "コートを着たままの夜勤の看護師さん"

msgid ""
"Long shift. On the way home I bought a tomato plant, for no reason at all."
msgstr "長い勤務だった。帰りに、なんとなくトマトの苗を買っちゃった。"

msgid ""
"The tomato plant has flowers. I talk to it when I get home at dawn. It is a "
"very good listener."
msgstr "トマトに花が咲いたの。明け方に帰ると話しかけてるんだ。すごく聞き上手なのよ。"

msgid ""
"A pigeon has been eyeing my tomato plant. I have named him Gerald. We have "
"come to an agreement."
msgstr "鳩がトマトを狙ってるの。Geraldって名前をつけた。話はついてるわ。"

msgid ""
"First tomato. Just one. I ate it on the balcony in my coat at six in the "
"morning, and it was perfect."
msgstr "初めてのトマト。たった一個。朝六時にコートのままベランダで食べたの。完璧だった。"

msgid ""
"My neighbour saw the plant and asked for seeds. Now there are tomatoes on "
"three balconies."
msgstr "お隣さんが苗を見て、種をちょうだいって。今じゃ三つのベランダにトマトがあるの。"

msgid ""
"The neighbours from all three balconies had a tomato party on the stairs. "
"Gerald came too. I am on day shifts next month, but I will still come here."
msgstr "三つのベランダのご近所みんなで、階段でトマトパーティーをしたの。Geraldも来たよ。来月から日勤だけど、ここにはまた来るね。"

msgid "Day shifts suit me. I see the sun now, and so does the tomato."
msgstr "日勤が合ってるみたい。お日さまが見えるし、トマトもね。"

msgid "Gerald brought a friend. The agreement is under review."
msgstr "Geraldが友だちを連れてきた。話し合いは見直し中よ。"

msgid "I slept a whole night through. I had forgotten how good that is."
msgstr "ひと晩ぐっすり眠れたの。あれがどんなにいいか、忘れてた。"

msgid "To quiet nights, and full ones."
msgstr "静かな夜と、満ち足りた夜に。"

msgid "ada"
msgstr ""

msgid "a cello student, with her dog Biscuit at her heels"
msgstr "犬のBiscuitを連れたチェロの学生さん"

msgid ""
"Biscuit and I practised scales for an hour. He howled on every high note. I "
"think he was being supportive."
msgstr "Biscuitと一時間、音階の練習をしたの。高い音のたびに遠吠えするんだ。応援してくれてるんだと思う。"

msgid ""
"My teacher says I play too carefully. She says to play it like I am telling "
"a friend a secret."
msgstr "先生に、慎重に弾きすぎって言われるの。友だちに秘密を打ち明けるみたいに弾きなさいって。"

msgid ""
"I played in the park for the first time. Four people stopped. One of them "
"was a toddler, who danced."
msgstr "初めて公園で弾いたの。四人が足を止めてくれた。一人はよちよち歩きの子で、踊ってたよ。"

msgid ""
"I have a recital in the spring hall next month. I am terrified. Biscuit is "
"not allowed in."
msgstr "来月、春のホールで発表会があるの。怖くてたまらない。Biscuitは入れないんだ。"

msgid ""
"The recital went well. I missed one note and nobody noticed but me. My "
"teacher cried a little, the good kind."
msgstr "発表会、うまくいったよ。一音だけ外したけど、気づいたのは私だけ。先生がちょっと泣いてた、うれし泣きのほうね。"

msgid ""
"Biscuit has a bow tie for the next recital. They say he can sit at the back "
"if he is quiet. He will not be quiet."
msgstr "次の発表会のために、Biscuitに蝶ネクタイを買ったの。静かにしてれば後ろの席にいていいって。静かにはしないだろうけど。"

msgid ""
"I am learning a piece that sounds like rain. Biscuit hides under the bed "
"for it."
msgstr "雨みたいな曲を練習してるの。Biscuitはその曲になるとベッドの下に隠れちゃう。"

msgid "The toddler from the park came back with her whole family."
msgstr "公園のよちよち歩きの子が、家族みんなで来てくれたよ。"

msgid "Biscuit sat through a whole rehearsal. One small howl. Progress."
msgstr "Biscuitがリハーサルの間ずっと座ってたの。小さな遠吠え一回だけ。進歩だね。"

msgid "To the next recital, and Biscuit's bow tie."
msgstr "次の発表会と、Biscuitの蝶ネクタイに。"

msgid "Old Wren"
msgstr ""

msgid "the town's clockmaker, with brass dust on his cuffs"
msgstr "袖口に真鍮の粉をつけた町の時計職人さん"

msgid ""
"The town hall clock has stood at ten past four for eleven years. The "
"council has asked me to look at it."
msgstr "役場の時計は、十一年も四時十分で止まったままでね。議会に見てくれと頼まれたんだ。"

msgid ""
"Up the tower today. Pigeons, dust, and one beautiful brass wheel with a "
"cracked tooth."
msgstr "今日は塔に登ったよ。鳩とほこり、それに歯の欠けた美しい真鍮の歯車が一つ。"

msgid ""
"I am cutting a new tooth for the wheel by hand. Slow work, like your tea. "
"You cannot hurry either."
msgstr "歯車の新しい歯を手で削っているところだ。ゆっくりした仕事さ、あんたのお茶と同じで。どちらも急げない。"

msgid ""
"The clock ticks again. It loses two minutes a day, but it ticks. People "
"keep stopping in the square to look up."
msgstr "時計がまた動き出したよ。一日二分遅れるが、動いている。広場で足を止めて見上げる人が絶えないんだ。"

msgid ""
"Two minutes a day is now two seconds a week. I am very proud of those two "
"seconds."
msgstr "一日二分が、今は一週間に二秒だ。この二秒が誇らしくてね。"

msgid ""
"It struck noon today, for the first time in eleven years. The whole square "
"went quiet to listen. Then everyone clapped for a clock."
msgstr "今日、十一年ぶりに正午を打ったよ。広場じゅうが静まり返って聞いていた。それから皆が、時計に拍手したんだ。"

msgid "The clock is right to the second today. I checked it four times."
msgstr "今日は時計が一秒の狂いもない。四回も確かめたよ。"

msgid ""
"A child asked me how the clock knows what time it is. I am still thinking "
"about the answer."
msgstr "子どもに、時計はどうして今が何時かわかるのかと聞かれてね。まだ答えを考えているところだ。"

msgid ""
"I have an apprentice now. She has better eyes than me, and steadier hands."
msgstr "弟子ができたんだ。わしより目がよくて、手もしっかりしている。"

msgid "To the clock in the square, and every second of the year."
msgstr "広場の時計と、一年のすべての一秒に。"

msgid "tomas"
msgstr ""

msgid "a bookbinder with glue on his thumbs"
msgstr "親指に糊をつけた製本職人さん"

msgid ""
"A woman brought me a recipe book that is falling apart. It was her "
"grandmother's. Every page smells of cinnamon."
msgstr "ある女性が、ばらばらになりかけたレシピ本を持ってきてね。おばあさんのものだったそうだ。どのページもシナモンの香りがする。"

msgid ""
"Inside the spine I found a folded note. A recipe for plum cake, with a "
"little heart drawn beside it."
msgstr "背の中に、折りたたんだメモを見つけたんだ。プラムケーキのレシピで、横に小さなハートが描いてあった。"

msgid ""
"The handwriting on the note is not the grandmother's. Her granddaughter has "
"no idea whose it is."
msgstr "メモの字は、おばあさんの字じゃない。お孫さんにも誰のものか見当がつかないんだ。"

msgid ""
"We found out. The note was from her grandfather, before they married. He "
"could not cook at all. The plum cake was a proposal."
msgstr ""
"わかったよ。メモはおじいさんからで、二人が結婚する前のものだった。おじいさんは料理がまるでだめでね。プラムケーキはプロポーズだったんだ。"

msgid ""
"The book is bound again, in green cloth. I sewed the note back inside the "
"spine, right where it was."
msgstr "本はまた綴じ直したよ、緑の布でね。メモは背の中の、元の場所に縫い戻した。"

msgid ""
"She baked the plum cake for her family and brought me a slice. It was a "
"little burnt. She says that is the tradition now."
msgstr "彼女が家族にプラムケーキを焼いて、一切れ持ってきてくれた。少し焦げていたよ。今ではそれが伝統なんだそうだ。"

msgid ""
"Someone brought me a diary from a lighthouse. I am taking my time with it."
msgstr "灯台の日記を持ってきた人がいてね。じっくり取りかかっているところだ。"

msgid ""
"I bound a book of pressed flowers today. The whole shop smells of summer."
msgstr "今日は押し花の本を綴じたよ。店じゅうが夏の香りだ。"

msgid ""
"The plum cake family sent me a card. They say it is still burnt, and still "
"perfect."
msgstr "プラムケーキの家族からカードが届いたよ。今も焦げていて、今も完璧だそうだ。"

msgid "To old books, and the notes hidden in them."
msgstr "古い本と、その中に隠れたメモに。"

msgid "priya"
msgstr ""

msgid "Priya"
msgstr ""

msgid "a student with a bag full of index cards"
msgstr "単語カードでいっぱいの鞄を持った学生さん"

msgid ""
"My exams are in six weeks. I am learning animal bones from little cards. "
"There are a great many bones."
msgstr "試験まであと六週間。小さなカードで動物の骨を覚えてるの。骨って、ものすごくたくさんあるんだよ。"

msgid ""
"I tested myself on the bus. The man next to me knew every bone of a horse. "
"He used to shoe horses for a living."
msgstr "バスで自分にテストしてたら、隣のおじさんが馬の骨を全部知ってたの。昔、蹄鉄打ちをしてたんだって。"

msgid ""
"He invited me to his yard to meet his old pony, Pepper. Pepper ate my cards."
msgstr "おじさんの家に招かれて、年寄りのポニーのPepperに会ったの。Pepperにカードを食べられちゃった。"

msgid ""
"Exams are over. I do not want to talk about it. I just want to sit here and "
"drink this."
msgstr "試験が終わった。その話はしたくない。ここに座って、これを飲みたいだけ。"

msgid "I passed. I really passed. I told Pepper first."
msgstr "合格した。本当に合格したの。最初にPepperに報告したよ。"

msgid ""
"I start at the animal clinic on the hill next month. You will still see me, "
"but I will smell of dogs."
msgstr "来月から丘の上の動物病院で働くの。これからも来るけど、犬のにおいがすると思う。"

msgid ""
"A cat at the clinic sits on my notes the way Pepper ate them. I think it is "
"a family of critics."
msgstr "病院の猫が、Pepperがカードを食べたみたいに私のノートの上に座るの。批評家の一族なんだと思う。"

msgid "Pepper had a check-up today. I did it myself. He was very patient."
msgstr "今日はPepperの健康診断。私がやったの。とってもおとなしくしてくれた。"

msgid "I have new cards now, for medicines. Fewer bones, more spelling."
msgstr "今度は薬のカードを作ったの。骨は減って、つづりが増えた。"

msgid "To Pepper, and to every patient animal."
msgstr "Pepperと、辛抱強いすべての動物たちに。"

msgid "A walker with muddy boots comes in."
msgstr "泥だらけのブーツのハイカーが入ってきます。"

msgid "The walker"
msgstr "ハイカー"

msgid "Something to warm my hands, please."
msgstr "手が温まるものをお願い。"

msgid "A man in a rain-soaked coat comes in."
msgstr "雨でずぶ濡れのコートの男の人が入ってきます。"

msgid "The man"
msgstr "男の人"

msgid "Something strong. It has been a long day."
msgstr "何か濃いのを。長い一日だったよ。"

msgid "A woman with a sketchbook comes in."
msgstr "スケッチブックを持った女の人が入ってきます。"

msgid "The artist"
msgstr "絵描きさん"

msgid "Something that smells like a garden, if you have it."
msgstr "庭みたいな香りのもの、あればお願い。"

msgid "A night-bus driver at the end of her shift comes in."
msgstr "勤務明けの夜行バスの運転手さんが入ってきます。"

msgid "The driver"
msgstr "運転手さん"

msgid "A calm cup before bed, please."
msgstr "寝る前に落ち着く一杯をお願いします。"

msgid "A teenager with headphones round her neck comes in."
msgstr "首にヘッドホンをかけた女の子が入ってきます。"

msgid "The teenager"
msgstr "女の子"

msgid "Something bright to wake me up?"
msgstr "目が覚めるような、すっきりしたのある？"

msgid "A fisherman smelling of the harbour comes in."
msgstr "港のにおいのする漁師さんが入ってきます。"

msgid "The fisherman"
msgstr "漁師さん"

msgid "Something smoky and strong."
msgstr "スモーキーで濃いのを。"

msgid "A grandfather and a small boy come in, hand in hand."
msgstr "おじいさんと小さな男の子が、手をつないで入ってきます。"

msgid "The grandfather"
msgstr "おじいさん"

msgid "Something a little sweet, without sugar, for the boy to try."
msgstr "砂糖なしで少し甘いものを。この子に飲ませてみたくてね。"

msgid "A cyclist comes in, out of breath."
msgstr "自転車の人が、息を切らして入ってきます。"

msgid "The cyclist"
msgstr "自転車の人"

msgid "Something fresh and green, please."
msgstr "さわやかな緑のものをお願い。"

msgid "A librarian on her lunch break comes in."
msgstr "昼休みの図書館員さんが入ってきます。"

msgid "The librarian"
msgstr "図書館員さん"

msgid "Something gentle. The library was loud today, even for a library."
msgstr "何かやさしいのを。今日の図書館はうるさかったの、図書館にしてはね。"

msgid "A builder with plaster on his hands comes in."
msgstr "手に漆喰のついた大工さんが入ってきます。"

msgid "The builder"
msgstr "大工さん"

msgid "Something strong, please. As strong as you make it."
msgstr "濃いのを頼むよ。できるだけ濃いのを。"

msgid "A painter with blue on her fingers comes in."
msgstr "指に青い絵の具のついた画家さんが入ってきます。"

msgid "The painter"
msgstr "画家さん"

msgid "Something clean and fresh, to clear my head."
msgstr "すっきりさわやかなのを。頭をすっきりさせたくて。"

msgid "A traveller with a heavy rucksack comes in."
msgstr "重いリュックの旅人が入ってきます。"

msgid "The traveller"
msgstr "旅人"

msgid "Something cosy, please. I have walked since dawn."
msgstr "何かほっとするのをお願い。夜明けから歩きどおしなんだ。"

msgid "A florist with petals in her hair comes in."
msgstr "髪に花びらをつけた花屋さんが入ってきます。"

msgid "The florist"
msgstr "花屋さん"

msgid ""
"Something flowery, please. I spend all day smelling roses and I never tire "
"of it."
msgstr "花の香りのものをお願い。一日じゅうバラの香りをかいでるのに、ちっとも飽きないの。"

msgid "A chimney sweep with soot on his cheek comes in."
msgstr "頬にすすをつけた煙突掃除屋さんが入ってきます。"

msgid "The sweep"
msgstr "煙突掃除屋さん"

msgid "Something smoky. I know, I know. I like what I like."
msgstr "スモーキーなのを。わかってる、わかってるって。好きなものは好きなんだ。"

msgid "A young dad with a sleeping baby in a sling comes in."
msgstr "抱っこひもで赤ちゃんを寝かせた若いお父さんが入ってきます。"

msgid "The dad"
msgstr "お父さん"

msgid "Something lively, please, quietly. She has only just gone off."
msgstr "元気の出るのをお願い、静かにね。やっと寝たところなんだ。"

msgid "A beekeeper in a wide straw hat comes in."
msgstr "つばの広い麦わら帽子の養蜂家さんが入ってきます。"

msgid "The beekeeper"
msgstr "養蜂家さん"

msgid "Something soft and sweet, please. I have honey enough at home."
msgstr "やわらかくて甘いのをお願い。はちみつなら家に十分あるから。"

msgid ""
"The society's president, in a velvet waistcoat, takes the first seat."
msgstr "ビロードのベストを着た会長が、最初の席に着きます。"

msgid "The president"
msgstr "会長"

msgid "A taster with a silver spoon on a chain sits down."
msgstr "銀のスプーンを鎖で下げた利き手が座ります。"

msgid "The taster"
msgstr "利き手"

msgid "A quiet man with a notebook sits down."
msgstr "手帳を持った物静かな男の人が座ります。"

msgid "The quiet man"
msgstr "物静かな男の人"

msgid "A lady with very good posture sits down."
msgstr "姿勢のとてもいいご婦人が座ります。"

msgid "The lady"
msgstr "ご婦人"

msgid "The society's youngest member, nervous and smiling, sits down."
msgstr "会でいちばん若い会員が、緊張しながら笑顔で座ります。"

msgid "The youngest member"
msgstr "いちばん若い会員"

msgid "lovely"
msgstr "とてもおいしい"

msgid "pleasant"
msgstr "おいしい"

msgid "kind"
msgstr "やさしい味の"

msgid "Oh. That is exactly right."
msgstr "ああ、まさにこれです。"

msgid "That is the best cup I have had in a long time."
msgstr "こんなにおいしい一杯は久しぶりです。"

msgid "Perfect. I did not know I needed this so much."
msgstr "完璧。こんなにこれが欲しかったなんて。"

msgid "Just right. You took your time, and it shows."
msgstr "ちょうどいい。ていねいに淹れてくれたのがわかります。"

msgid "That is lovely, thank you."
msgstr "とてもおいしい、ありがとう。"

msgid "Mm. Lovely. Just what I wanted."
msgstr "うん、おいしい。ちょうど飲みたかったもの。"

msgid "Lovely and warm. Thank you."
msgstr "おいしくて温かい。ありがとう。"

msgid "That is nice. Warm and kind."
msgstr "いいですね。温かくて、やさしい味。"

msgid "A good cup. Thank you."
msgstr "いい一杯でした。ありがとう。"

msgid "That is pleasant. I feel better already."
msgstr "おいしい。もう元気が出てきました。"

msgid "Not quite what I pictured, but it was kind of you to make it."
msgstr "思っていたのとは少し違うけど、淹れてくれてうれしいです。"

msgid "It is warm, and that is what matters today."
msgstr "温かい、今日はそれがいちばん大事。"

msgid ""
"A cup of something is always better than a cup of nothing. Thank you."
msgstr "何もないより、何か一杯あるほうがいつだっていい。ありがとう。"

msgid "Thank you for taking your time."
msgstr "ゆっくり淹れてくれてありがとう。"

msgid "This place feels like a deep breath."
msgstr "ここにいると、深呼吸したような気分になります。"

msgid "Same again next week, please."
msgstr "来週もまた同じのをお願い。"

msgid "You made my whole day better."
msgstr "おかげで一日がまるごといい日になりました。"

msgid "My grandmother made tea like this."
msgstr "祖母もこんなふうにお茶を淹れてくれました。"

msgid "I came in tired and I am leaving happy."
msgstr "疲れて来たけど、幸せな気分で帰れます。"

msgid "The kettle sang just for me, I think."
msgstr "やかんが私のためだけに歌ってくれた気がします。"

msgid "Here is to slow afternoons."
msgstr "ゆっくりした午後に乾杯。"

msgid "A small thank you, for a big cup."
msgstr "大きな一杯に、小さなお礼を。"

msgid "I will tell my friends about this place."
msgstr "友だちにこのお店のことを話しますね。"

msgid "song"
msgstr ""

msgid "tick"
msgstr ""

msgid "timer"
msgstr ""

msgid "next"
msgstr ""

