#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"{sentence_start} and {d} move along the shelf, {l} and {r} choose a cup."
msgstr "{sentence_start}と{d}で棚を移動し、{l}と{r}で器を選びます。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}, {d}, {l}, {r}, {p}, {t}, {s}, {rep}, {h}
msgid ""
"{sentence_start} and {d} move along the shelf, {l} and {r} choose a cup. "
"{p} chooses, heats, pours and lifts the leaves. {t} says more about what is "
"in front of you. {s} gives the status, twice for more, {rep} repeats, {h} "
"gives a hint. F1 helps, Escape pauses."
