msgid "Every pond with its stars and best. A star on one opens the next."
msgstr "すべての池を星とベストと一緒に。一つの池で星を取ると次が解放されます。"

#. placeholders: {LANTERN_ROW}, {n}, {LANTERN_PAIRS}
