msgid "climbing"
msgstr "上昇中"

msgid "slow and steady"
msgstr "ゆっくり安定"

msgid "a little fast"
msgstr "少し速い"

msgid "falling fast"
msgstr "速く落下中"

msgid ""
"Engine: a low roar while you hold the engine key. It slows your fall and "
"burns fuel."
msgstr "エンジン：エンジンキーを押している間の低いうなり。落下を遅くし、燃料を使います。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid ""
"a low roar while you hold the engine key. It slows your fall and burns fuel."
msgstr "エンジンキーを押している間の低いうなり。落下を遅くし、燃料を使います。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Pad beacon"
msgstr "パッドのビーコン"

msgid ""
"Pad beacon: a soft ping from the pad below you. It quickens as you get "
"closer."
msgstr "パッドのビーコン：下のパッドからのやわらかなピン。近づくほど速くなります。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "a soft ping from the pad below you. It quickens as you get closer."
msgstr "下のパッドからのやわらかなピン。近づくほど速くなります。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Radio click"
msgstr "無線のクリック"

msgid "Radio click: mission control is about to give a call-out."
msgstr "無線のクリック：管制センターがこれから案内します。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "mission control is about to give a call-out."
msgstr "管制センターがこれから案内します。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Quindar tone"
msgstr "クインダー音"

msgid ""
"Quindar tone: a short high beep on the Tranquility pad. It stands for the "
"radio click, and a call-out follows."
msgstr "クインダー音：静かの海パッドでの短く高いビープ。無線のクリック音の代わりで、このあと案内が続きます。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid ""
"a short high beep on the Tranquility pad. It stands for the radio click, "
"and a call-out follows."
msgstr "静かの海パッドでの短く高いビープ。無線のクリック音の代わりで、このあと案内が続きます。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Fuel alarm"
msgstr "燃料警報"

msgid ""
"Fuel alarm: two soft beeps. Fuel is down to 25 percent, then again at 10 "
"percent."
msgstr "燃料警報：やわらかなビープ二回。燃料が25パーセントになると鳴り、10パーセントでもう一度鳴ります。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid ""
"two soft beeps. Fuel is down to 25 percent, then again at 10 percent."
msgstr "やわらかなビープ二回。燃料が25パーセントになると鳴り、10パーセントでもう一度鳴ります。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Touchdown"
msgstr "着地"

msgid "Touchdown: a thud and a creak of the legs. You landed safely."
msgstr "着地：ドスンという音と脚のきしみ。無事に着陸しました。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "a thud and a creak of the legs. You landed safely."
msgstr "ドスンという音と脚のきしみ。無事に着陸しました。"

msgid "Crash: a heavy crunch. You touched down faster than the safe speed."
msgstr "墜落：重いグシャッという音。安全速度より速く着地しました。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "a heavy crunch. You touched down faster than the safe speed."
msgstr "重いグシャッという音。安全速度より速く着地しました。"

msgid "Descent tone, safe"
msgstr "降下音、安全"

msgid ""
"Descent tone, safe: a low, steady tone. You are falling slower than the "
"safe speed."
msgstr "降下音、安全：低く安定した音。安全速度より遅く落ちています。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "a low, steady tone. You are falling slower than the safe speed."
msgstr "低く安定した音。安全速度より遅く落ちています。"

msgid "Descent tone, too fast"
msgstr "降下音、速すぎ"

msgid ""
"Descent tone, too fast: the same tone, higher. The faster you fall, the "
"higher it goes. You hear Too fast as it crosses the safe speed, and Safe "
"speed as it comes back."
msgstr "降下音、速すぎ：同じ音が高くなったもの。速く落ちるほど高くなります。安全速度を超えると「速すぎ」、戻ると「安全速度」と聞こえます。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid ""
"the same tone, higher. The faster you fall, the higher it goes. You hear "
"Too fast as it crosses the safe speed, and Safe speed as it comes back."
msgstr "同じ音が高くなったもの。速く落ちるほど高くなります。安全速度を超えると「速すぎ」、戻ると「安全速度」と聞こえます。"

msgid "prompts"
msgstr ""

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Lesson 1 of 4, the fall."
msgstr "レッスン1、全4回中、落下。"

#. placeholders: {length}, {sentence_start}
msgid ""
"Lesson 1 of 4, the fall. You wait {length} above the pad. {sentence_start} "
"starts the descent. Let go and fall freely."
msgstr ""
"レッスン1、全4回中、落下。パッドの{length}上で待機しています。{sentence_start}で降下を始めます。離して自由落下しましょう。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Let go and fall freely."
msgstr "離して自由落下しましょう。"

#. placeholders: {length}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "You wait {length} above the pad."
msgstr "パッドの{length}上で待機しています。"

#. placeholders: {speed_words}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Falling {speed_words}."
msgstr "落下中{speed_words}。"

#. placeholders: {speed_words}
msgid "Falling {speed_words}. Too fast to land."
msgstr "落下中{speed_words}。着陸するには速すぎます。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Too fast to land."
msgstr "着陸するには速すぎます。"

#. placeholders: {p}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Hold {p} to slow down."
msgstr "{p}を押し続けて減速しましょう。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Lesson 2 of 4, the engine."
msgstr "レッスン2、全4回中、エンジン。"

#. placeholders: {p}
msgid ""
"Lesson 2 of 4, the engine. Hold {p} to slow down. Let go at Safe speed."
msgstr "レッスン2、全4回中、エンジン。{p}を押し続けて減速しましょう。「安全速度」で離します。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Let go at Safe speed."
msgstr "「安全速度」で離します。"

msgid "Once you let go, gravity speeds you up again."
msgstr "離すと、重力でまた速くなります。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Lesson 3 of 4, the hint."
msgstr "レッスン3、全4回中、ヒント。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}
msgid ""
"Lesson 3 of 4, the hint. {sentence_start} says when to burn. Press it now."
msgstr "レッスン3、全4回中、ヒント。{sentence_start}でいつ噴射するかを伝えます。今押してみましょう。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{sentence_start} says when to burn."
msgstr "{sentence_start}でいつ噴射するかを伝えます。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Burn now."
msgstr "今噴射。"

#. placeholders: {p}
msgid "Burn now. Hold {p} until Safe speed."
msgstr "今噴射。「安全速度」まで{p}を押し続けて。"

#. placeholders: {p}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Hold {p} until Safe speed."
msgstr "「安全速度」まで{p}を押し続けて。"

#. placeholders: {p}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "If the game says Too fast, hold {p} until Safe speed."
msgstr "「速すぎ」と言われたら、「安全速度」まで{p}を押し続けましょう。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Let go."
msgstr "離して。"

#. placeholders: {p}
msgid "Let go. If the game says Too fast, hold {p} until Safe speed."
msgstr "離して。「速すぎ」と言われたら、「安全速度」まで{p}を押し続けましょう。"

#. placeholders: {p}
msgid "Hold {p} as soon as the game says Burn now."
msgstr "「今噴射」と言われたら、すぐに{p}を押し続けましょう。"

#. placeholders: {p}
msgid "Each time the game says Too fast, hold {p} until Safe speed."
msgstr "「速すぎ」と言われるたびに、「安全速度」まで{p}を押し続けましょう。"

msgid ""
"Lesson 4 of 4, the landing. Fall freely until the game says Burn now."
msgstr "レッスン4、全4回中、着陸。「今噴射」と言われるまで自由落下しましょう。"

#. placeholders: {speed_words}
msgid "Down safely at {speed_words}."
msgstr "{speed_words}で無事着陸。"

msgid "landed"
msgstr ""

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Four short lessons on the practice pad, with endless fuel"
msgstr "燃料無限の練習パッドで行う、四つの短いレッスン"

#. placeholders: {safe}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Touch the pad slower than {safe} to land."
msgstr "{safe}より遅くパッドに触れれば着陸です。"

#. placeholders: {safe}
msgid ""
"Touch the pad slower than {safe} to land. Four short lessons on the "
"practice pad, with endless fuel"
msgstr "{safe}より遅くパッドに触れれば着陸です。燃料無限の練習パッドで行う、四つの短いレッスン"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "On a moon the tank is small: fall freely, then burn once."
msgstr "本番の月ではタンクが小さいので、自由落下してから一度だけ噴射しましょう。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}, {sentence_start2}
msgid ""
"On a moon the tank is small: fall freely, then burn once. {sentence_start} "
"reads height, speed and fuel. {sentence_start2} asks for a call-out."
msgstr ""
"本番の月ではタンクが小さいので、自由落下してから一度だけ噴射しましょう。{sentence_start}で高さ、速さ、燃料を読み上げます。{senten"
"ce_start2}で案内を聞きます。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start2}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{sentence_start2} asks for a call-out."
msgstr "{sentence_start2}で案内を聞きます。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{sentence_start} reads height, speed and fuel."
msgstr "{sentence_start}で高さ、速さ、燃料を読み上げます。"

msgid ""
"You pilot a salvage sub from a boat. Ping for treasure, collect it, and "
"return to the boat's bell to bank it before air runs out. Each dive after "
"the first goes deeper: the water is darker, the mines thicker, the currents "
"stronger and the air shorter, but the treasure is worth more."
msgstr ""
"船からサルベージ潜水艇を操縦します。ソナーで宝を探して回収し、空気がなくなる前に船の鐘まで戻って預けましょう。二回目からの潜水はより深くなります。水は暗"
"く、機雷は多く、潮流は強く、空気は短くなりますが、宝の価値は上がります。"

msgid "You pilot a salvage sub from a boat."
msgstr "船からサルベージ潜水艇を操縦します。"

msgid ""
"Ping for treasure, collect it, and return to the boat's bell to bank it "
"before air runs out."
msgstr "ソナーで宝を探して回収し、空気がなくなる前に船の鐘まで戻って預けましょう。"

msgid ""
"Each dive after the first goes deeper: the water is darker, the mines "
"thicker, the currents stronger and the air shorter, but the treasure is "
"worth more."
msgstr "二回目からの潜水はより深くなります。水は暗く、機雷は多く、潮流は強く、空気は短くなりますが、宝の価値は上がります。"

msgid ""
"This help gives distances and depths in metres. Set Units to US in Settings "
"and the game says feet instead."
msgstr "このヘルプでは、距離と深さをメートルで伝えます。設定の単位を米国式にすると、フィートで伝えます。"

msgid "This help gives distances and depths in metres."
msgstr "このヘルプでは、距離と深さをメートルで伝えます。"

msgid "Set Units to US in Settings and the game says feet instead."
msgstr "設定の単位を米国式にすると、フィートで伝えます。"

msgid ""
"Your score is the treasure you bank. An expedition ends when you choose to "
"stop at the boat, when your air runs out, or when mines breach your hull. "
"If you are lost at sea, the treasure aboard is lost with you, but "
"everything you banked is kept."
msgstr ""
"スコアは預けた宝です。探検は、船で終えることにしたとき、空気が尽きたとき、機雷で船体が破れたときに終わります。海で遭難すると、積んでいた宝は失われますが"
"、預けた宝はすべて残ります。"

msgid "Your score is the treasure you bank."
msgstr "スコアは預けた宝です。"

msgid ""
"An expedition ends when you choose to stop at the boat, when your air runs "
"out, or when mines breach your hull."
msgstr "探検は、船で終えることにしたとき、空気が尽きたとき、機雷で船体が破れたときに終わります。"

msgid ""
"If you are lost at sea, the treasure aboard is lost with you, but "
"everything you banked is kept."
msgstr "海で遭難すると、積んでいた宝は失われますが、預けた宝はすべて残ります。"

msgid "Directions"
msgstr "方向"

msgid ""
"Everything is placed around the sub, facing where the sub faces. When you "
"turn, the world turns around you."
msgstr "すべては潜水艇の向きを基準に、周りに配置されます。向きを変えると、世界が周りで回ります。"

msgid "Everything is placed around the sub, facing where the sub faces."
msgstr "すべては潜水艇の向きを基準に、周りに配置されます。"

msgid "When you turn, the world turns around you."
msgstr "向きを変えると、世界が周りで回ります。"

msgid ""
"Ping: everything in range echoes from where it is. The later the echo, the "
"farther away it is."
msgstr "ソナー：範囲内のすべてが、その場所から反響します。反響が遅いほど遠くにあります。"

msgid "Ping: everything in range echoes from where it is."
msgstr "ソナー：範囲内のすべてが、その場所から反響します。"

msgid "The later the echo, the farther away it is."
msgstr "反響が遅いほど遠くにあります。"

msgid ""
"Directions in speech use a clock face: 12 o'clock is straight ahead, 3 "
"o'clock to your right, 6 o'clock behind you and 9 o'clock to your left."
msgstr "方向は時計の文字盤で伝えます。12時が正面、3時が右、6時が後ろ、9時が左です。"

msgid ""
"Turn on Spoken call-outs in Settings, from the title or the pause menu, to "
"have each ping's four nearest echoes named, with distance and clock "
"direction. The hint key always names the nearest treasure."
msgstr ""
"タイトルか一時停止メニューの設定で音声の案内をオンにすると、ソナーのたびに近い四つの反響を距離と時計の方向で伝えます。ヒントキーはいつも一番近い宝を伝え"
"ます。"

msgid ""
"Turn on Spoken call-outs in Settings, from the title or the pause menu, to "
"have each ping's four nearest echoes named, with distance and clock "
"direction."
msgstr "タイトルか一時停止メニューの設定で音声の案内をオンにすると、ソナーのたびに近い四つの反響を距離と時計の方向で伝えます。"

msgid "The hint key always names the nearest treasure."
msgstr "ヒントキーはいつも一番近い宝を伝えます。"

msgid "What sonar finds"
msgstr "ソナーで見つかるもの"

msgid ""
"A wreck is a sunken ship with treasure in its hold. An empty wreck has "
"already been salvaged."
msgstr "沈没船は、船倉に宝を積んだまま沈んだ船です。空の沈没船は、もう引き揚げ済みです。"

msgid "A wreck is a sunken ship with treasure in its hold."
msgstr "沈没船は、船倉に宝を積んだまま沈んだ船です。"

msgid "An empty wreck has already been salvaged."
msgstr "空の沈没船は、もう引き揚げ済みです。"

msgid "You can collect treasure chests without stopping."
msgstr "宝箱は止まらずに回収できます。"

msgid "Mines damage your hull on contact."
msgstr "機雷に触れると船体が傷つきます。"

msgid "Rocks and the wall at the edge of the dive site block your path."
msgstr "岩と潜水地点の端の壁は、行く手をふさぎます。"

msgid "Whales offer extra air. Currents push the sub."
msgstr "クジラは空気を分けてくれます。潮流は潜水艇を押し流します。"

msgid "Whales offer extra air."
msgstr "クジラは空気を分けてくれます。"

msgid "Currents push the sub."
msgstr "潮流は潜水艇を押し流します。"

msgid ""
"The galleon appears in the monthly challenge. Glow pearls appear in the "
"glow dive."
msgstr "ガレオン船はマンスリーのチャレンジに現れます。光る真珠は光の潜水に現れます。"

msgid "The galleon appears in the monthly challenge."
msgstr "ガレオン船はマンスリーのチャレンジに現れます。"

msgid "Glow pearls appear in the glow dive."
msgstr "光る真珠は光の潜水に現れます。"

msgid ""
"Sound check, on the title, plays each of these with its name, and a "
"demonstration of the same echo from five places around you."
msgstr "タイトルのサウンドテストで、これらを名前と一緒に再生し、同じ反響を周りの五か所から鳴らす実演もあります。"

msgid "Treasure"
msgstr "宝"

msgid "Swim into a treasure chest to take it. Its coins are aboard at once."
msgstr "宝箱に突っ込むと手に入ります。中の金貨はすぐに積み込まれます。"

msgid "Swim into a treasure chest to take it."
msgstr "宝箱に突っ込むと手に入ります。"

msgid "Its coins are aboard at once."
msgstr "中の金貨はすぐに積み込まれます。"

msgid ""
"A wreck holds more, but takes work. Stop within a few metres of it, at all "
"stop, and hold still while the grab arm salvages it. Salvage takes 3 "
"seconds. Moving off or being pushed by a current interrupts salvage, and "
"you start again."
msgstr ""
"沈没船にはもっと多くの宝がありますが、手間がかかります。数メートル以内で停止し、アームが引き揚げる間じっとしていましょう。引き揚げには3秒かかります。動"
"いたり潮流に押されたりすると中断し、やり直しです。"

msgid "A wreck holds more, but takes work."
msgstr "沈没船にはもっと多くの宝がありますが、手間がかかります。"

msgid ""
"Stop within a few metres of it, at all stop, and hold still while the grab "
"arm salvages it."
msgstr "数メートル以内で停止し、アームが引き揚げる間じっとしていましょう。"

msgid "Salvage takes 3 seconds."
msgstr "引き揚げには3秒かかります。"

msgid ""
"Moving off or being pushed by a current interrupts salvage, and you start "
"again."
msgstr "動いたり潮流に押されたりすると中断し、やり直しです。"

msgid ""
"Treasure is worth more the deeper you go: a quarter more for every dive "
"past the first."
msgstr "宝は深く潜るほど価値が上がります。最初より後の潜水ごとに、四分の一ずつ増えます。"

msgid ""
"Mines warn you when you come within about 16 metres. Touching one costs a "
"hull point. You start with 3, and losing them all ends the expedition. "
"Surfacing repairs one."
msgstr ""
"機雷は約16メートル以内に近づくと警告します。触れると船体ポイントが一つ減ります。最初は3つで、すべて失うと探検は終わりです。浮上すると一つ修理されます"
"。"

msgid "Mines warn you when you come within about 16 metres."
msgstr "機雷は約16メートル以内に近づくと警告します。"

msgid "Touching one costs a hull point."
msgstr "触れると船体ポイントが一つ減ります。"

msgid "You start with 3, and losing them all ends the expedition."
msgstr "最初は3つで、すべて失うと探検は終わりです。"

msgid "Surfacing repairs one."
msgstr "浮上すると一つ修理されます。"

msgid ""
"Rocks and the wall around the site scrape you and cost 3 seconds of air. "
"Driving into them stops your engine. Turn away and throttle up again. If a "
"current pins you against rock, point away from it and throttle up. The "
"engine keeps running while you pull clear."
msgstr ""
"岩と潜水地点を囲む壁にこすると、空気が3秒減ります。突っ込むとエンジンが止まります。向きを変えて、またスロットルを上げましょう。潮流で岩に押しつけられた"
"ら、岩から離れる向きに向いてスロットルを上げます。抜け出す間もエンジンは動き続けます。"

msgid ""
"Rocks and the wall around the site scrape you and cost 3 seconds of air."
msgstr "岩と潜水地点を囲む壁にこすると、空気が3秒減ります。"

msgid "Driving into them stops your engine."
msgstr "突っ込むとエンジンが止まります。"

msgid "Turn away and throttle up again."
msgstr "向きを変えて、またスロットルを上げましょう。"

msgid ""
"If a current pins you against rock, point away from it and throttle up."
msgstr "潮流で岩に押しつけられたら、岩から離れる向きに向いてスロットルを上げます。"

msgid "The engine keeps running while you pull clear."
msgstr "抜け出す間もエンジンは動き続けます。"

msgid ""
"Currents push you while you are inside them. Fight them at full ahead, or "
"let them carry you. You cannot salvage inside a current."
msgstr "潮流の中にいる間は押し流されます。全速前進で逆らうか、流れに任せましょう。潮流の中では引き揚げられません。"

msgid "Currents push you while you are inside them."
msgstr "潮流の中にいる間は押し流されます。"

msgid "Fight them at full ahead, or let them carry you."
msgstr "全速前進で逆らうか、流れに任せましょう。"

msgid "You cannot salvage inside a current."
msgstr "潮流の中では引き揚げられません。"

msgid "Air"
msgstr "空気"

msgid ""
"Your tank holds 150 seconds on the first dive and less on each deeper dive. "
"Full ahead uses air faster than slow ahead, and all stop uses the least. "
"You are warned at half, at a quarter, and at 15 seconds. H works at any "
"time. When your air is short of what the trip home needs, H says so."
msgstr ""
"タンクは最初の潜水で150秒分、深くなるごとに少なくなります。全速前進は微速前進より空気を早く使い、停止がいちばん少なくて済みます。半分、四分の一、15"
"秒で警告します。Hはいつでも使えます。帰りに必要な空気が足りないときは、Hがそう伝えます。"

msgid ""
"Your tank holds 150 seconds on the first dive and less on each deeper dive."
msgstr "タンクは最初の潜水で150秒分、深くなるごとに少なくなります。"

msgid ""
"Full ahead uses air faster than slow ahead, and all stop uses the least."
msgstr "全速前進は微速前進より空気を早く使い、停止がいちばん少なくて済みます。"

msgid "You are warned at half, at a quarter, and at 15 seconds."
msgstr "半分、四分の一、15秒で警告します。"

msgid "H works at any time."
msgstr "Hはいつでも使えます。"

msgid "When your air is short of what the trip home needs, H says so."
msgstr "帰りに必要な空気が足りないときは、Hがそう伝えます。"

msgid ""
"A friendly whale circles somewhere on most sites. Pass within a few metres "
"of it and it shares a breath of air: 25 seconds more, once a dive. It keeps "
"its gift while your tank is still nearly full, so you can come back to it "
"later."
msgstr ""
"たいていの潜水地点には、人なつこいクジラがどこかで泳ぎ回っています。数メートル以内を通ると、空気をひと息分けてくれます。潜水一回につき一度、25秒追加で"
"す。タンクがまだほぼ満タンのうちは贈り物を取っておくので、後で戻ってきても大丈夫です。"

msgid "A friendly whale circles somewhere on most sites."
msgstr "たいていの潜水地点には、人なつこいクジラがどこかで泳ぎ回っています。"

msgid ""
"Pass within a few metres of it and it shares a breath of air: 25 seconds "
"more, once a dive."
msgstr "数メートル以内を通ると、空気をひと息分けてくれます。潜水一回につき一度、25秒追加です。"

msgid ""
"It keeps its gift while your tank is still nearly full, so you can come "
"back to it later."
msgstr "タンクがまだほぼ満タンのうちは贈り物を取っておくので、後で戻ってきても大丈夫です。"

msgid "Buoys and the bell"
msgstr "ブイと鐘"

msgid ""
"The boat's bell is where you began. Come back within a few metres of it to "
"surface."
msgstr "船の鐘は出発した場所です。数メートル以内に戻ると浮上します。"

msgid "The boat's bell is where you began."
msgstr "船の鐘は出発した場所です。"

msgid "Come back within a few metres of it to surface."
msgstr "数メートル以内に戻ると浮上します。"

msgid ""
"Tab drops a marker buoy where you are. Up to 3 can be out at once, and a "
"fourth takes the place of the oldest. Use them to mark a wreck you mean to "
"come back to, or a safe path home past the mines."
msgstr ""
"Tabで今いる場所に目印のブイを落とします。一度に3つまで置け、四つ目はいちばん古いものと入れ替わります。後で戻る沈没船や、機雷を避けて帰る安全な道の目"
"印に使いましょう。"

msgid "Tab drops a marker buoy where you are."
msgstr "Tabで今いる場所に目印のブイを落とします。"

msgid ""
"Up to 3 can be out at once, and a fourth takes the place of the oldest."
msgstr "一度に3つまで置け、四つ目はいちばん古いものと入れ替わります。"

msgid ""
"Use them to mark a wreck you mean to come back to, or a safe path home past "
"the mines."
msgstr "後で戻る沈没船や、機雷を避けて帰る安全な道の目印に使いましょう。"

msgid "At the boat"
msgstr "船で"

msgid ""
"When you surface, what you carry is banked and your air is refilled. You "
"choose to dive again, deeper, or end the expedition and keep your haul. "
"Escape there opens the pause menu."
msgstr ""
"浮上すると、積んでいた宝が預けられ、空気が補充されます。もう一度より深く潜るか、探検を終えて稼ぎを持ち帰るかを選びます。そこでEscapeを押すと一時停"
"止メニューが開きます。"

msgid "When you surface, what you carry is banked and your air is refilled."
msgstr "浮上すると、積んでいた宝が預けられ、空気が補充されます。"

msgid ""
"You choose to dive again, deeper, or end the expedition and keep your haul."
msgstr "もう一度より深く潜るか、探検を終えて稼ぎを持ち帰るかを選びます。"

msgid "Escape there opens the pause menu."
msgstr "そこでEscapeを押すと一時停止メニューが開きます。"

msgid "After an expedition"
msgstr "探検の後"

msgid ""
"When an expedition ends, the game reads how it went, your haul and your "
"best. Then the results menu offers Play again, or Try again after a loss, "
"Hear the results again, and Back to the title. After a challenge, the last "
"row is Back to the challenges. Escape does the same as the last row."
msgstr ""
"探検が終わると、その内容、稼ぎ、ベストを読み上げます。その後の結果メニューには、もう一度プレイ、失敗したときはもう一度挑戦、結果をもう一度聞く、タイトル"
"に戻る、があります。チャレンジの後は、最後の項目がチャレンジに戻るになります。Escapeは最後の項目と同じです。"

msgid ""
"When an expedition ends, the game reads how it went, your haul and your "
"best."
msgstr "探検が終わると、その内容、稼ぎ、ベストを読み上げます。"

msgid ""
"Then the results menu offers Play again, or Try again after a loss, Hear "
"the results again, and Back to the title."
msgstr "その後の結果メニューには、もう一度プレイ、失敗したときはもう一度挑戦、結果をもう一度聞く、タイトルに戻る、があります。"

msgid ""
"The sea holds while a line is still being spoken. Your air, the sub, the "
"mines, the currents, the bell, the buoys and the grab arm stand still until "
"it ends. While you hold a turn key, and while a ping's echoes are coming "
"back, the sea runs on through speech. A line you ask for again and again "
"stops holding after a while. This holds at every pace and in every mode."
msgstr ""
"読み上げの途中は、海は止まっています。空気、潜水艇、機雷、潮流、鐘、ブイ、アームは、終わるまで止まったままです。回転キーを押している間と、ソナーの反響が"
"返ってくる間は、読み上げ中も海は動き続けます。何度も聞き直すと、しばらくして止まらなくなります。これはどのペースでもどのモードでも同じです。"

msgid "The sea holds while a line is still being spoken."
msgstr "読み上げの途中は、海は止まっています。"

msgid ""
"Your air, the sub, the mines, the currents, the bell, the buoys and the "
"grab arm stand still until it ends."
msgstr "空気、潜水艇、機雷、潮流、鐘、ブイ、アームは、終わるまで止まったままです。"

msgid ""
"While you hold a turn key, and while a ping's echoes are coming back, the "
"sea runs on through speech."
msgstr "回転キーを押している間と、ソナーの反響が返ってくる間は、読み上げ中も海は動き続けます。"

msgid ""
"Pace in Settings sets how fast the sea runs: relaxed, normal or quick. "
"Normal is the default and a little slower than quick. Quick is the fastest, "
"and relaxed runs at half speed. Your air, the sub's speed and turns, the "
"echoes, the mine ticks, the bell, the buoys and salvage all follow the "
"pace, so a later echo still means a farther one."
msgstr ""
"設定のペースで海の速さを決めます。ゆったり、ふつう、速い。ふつうが初期設定で、速いより少しゆっくりです。速いがいちばん速く、ゆったりは半分の速さです。空"
"気、潜水艇の速さと回転、反響、機雷の音、鐘、ブイ、引き揚げがすべてペースに従うので、遅い反響はやはり遠くを意味します。"

msgid ""
"Pace in Settings sets how fast the sea runs: relaxed, normal or quick."
msgstr "設定のペースで海の速さを決めます。ゆったり、ふつう、速い。"

msgid ""
"Your air, the sub's speed and turns, the echoes, the mine ticks, the bell, "
"the buoys and salvage all follow the pace, so a later echo still means a "
"farther one."
msgstr "空気、潜水艇の速さと回転、反響、機雷の音、鐘、ブイ、引き揚げがすべてペースに従うので、遅い反響はやはり遠くを意味します。"

msgid ""
"A change applies from your next expedition. An expedition keeps the pace it "
"started at until it ends."
msgstr "変更は次の探検から有効です。探検は、終わるまで始めたときのペースのままです。"

msgid "A change applies from your next expedition."
msgstr "変更は次の探検から有効です。"

msgid "An expedition keeps the pace it started at until it ends."
msgstr "探検は、終わるまで始めたときのペースのままです。"

msgid ""
"Relaxed hauls are saved separately, including challenges and special dives. "
"Normal and quick share their hauls. Your deepest dive, your expeditions and "
"Deep start count at every pace."
msgstr ""
"ゆったりの稼ぎは、チャレンジや特別な潜水も含めて別に保存されます。ふつうと速いは稼ぎを共有します。最深の潜水、探検の回数、深い出発はどのペースでも数えら"
"れます。"

msgid ""
"Relaxed hauls are saved separately, including challenges and special dives."
msgstr "ゆったりの稼ぎは、チャレンジや特別な潜水も含めて別に保存されます。"

msgid "Normal and quick share their hauls."
msgstr "ふつうと速いは稼ぎを共有します。"

msgid ""
"Your deepest dive, your expeditions and Deep start count at every pace."
msgstr "最深の潜水、探検の回数、深い出発はどのペースでも数えられます。"

msgid ""
"Play, expedition: from dive 1, as deep as you dare. Your best haul is on "
"the row and in Records."
msgstr "プレイ、探検：潜水1から、思い切れるところまで深く。ベストの稼ぎは項目と記録にあります。"

msgid "Play, expedition: from dive 1, as deep as you dare."
msgstr "プレイ、探検：潜水1から、思い切れるところまで深く。"

msgid "Your best haul is on the row and in Records."
msgstr "ベストの稼ぎは項目と記録にあります。"

msgid ""
"Deep start: locked until an expedition reaches dive 4. Then it begins at "
"dive 4, with its own best haul."
msgstr "深い出発：探検で潜水4に届くまでロック中。その後は潜水4から始まり、ベストの稼ぎは別に残ります。"

msgid "Deep start: locked until an expedition reaches dive 4."
msgstr "深い出発：探検で潜水4に届くまでロック中です。"

msgid "Then it begins at dive 4, with its own best haul."
msgstr "その後は潜水4から始まり、ベストの稼ぎは別に残ります。"

msgid ""
"Practice dive: endless air and harmless mines, to learn the sonar. Not "
"scored."
msgstr "練習潜水：空気は無限、機雷は無害。ソナーを覚えるためのものです。スコアはつきません。"

msgid "Practice dive: endless air and harmless mines, to learn the sonar."
msgstr "練習潜水：空気は無限、機雷は無害。ソナーを覚えるためのものです。"

msgid "Not scored."
msgstr "スコアはつきません。"

msgid ""
"Records, on the title, reads both best hauls, your deepest dive and your "
"challenge results."
msgstr "タイトルの記録で、二つのベストの稼ぎ、最深の潜水、チャレンジの結果を読み上げます。"

msgid ""
"The challenges are the same sea for every player, and a new one comes each "
"day, week and month. The Challenges menu shows each one's best result and "
"your streak. Before each run the briefing reads its rule and when the next "
"one arrives. Afterwards the game reads your result, your best and your "
"streak. A run counts when it ends at the boat or at sea. Leave the "
"challenge, on the pause menu, does not count. Neither does Escape on the "
"briefing, which goes back without starting."
msgstr ""
"チャレンジは全員が同じ海に潜り、毎日、毎週、毎月新しくなります。チャレンジメニューには、それぞれのベストの結果と連続記録が出ます。プレイの前に、ブリーフ"
"ィングでルールと次が来る時期を読み上げます。終わると、結果、ベスト、連続記録を読み上げます。船で終えても海で終わっても、プレイは数えられます。一時停止メ"
"ニューのチャレンジをやめるは数えられません。ブリーフィングでEscapeを押して始めずに戻った場合も数えられません。"

msgid ""
"The challenges are the same sea for every player, and a new one comes each "
"day, week and month."
msgstr "チャレンジは全員が同じ海に潜り、毎日、毎週、毎月新しくなります。"

msgid "The Challenges menu shows each one's best result and your streak."
msgstr "チャレンジメニューには、それぞれのベストの結果と連続記録が出ます。"

msgid ""
"Before each run the briefing reads its rule and when the next one arrives."
msgstr "プレイの前に、ブリーフィングでルールと次が来る時期を読み上げます。"

msgid "Afterwards the game reads your result, your best and your streak."
msgstr "終わると、結果、ベスト、連続記録を読み上げます。"

msgid "A run counts when it ends at the boat or at sea."
msgstr "船で終えても海で終わっても、プレイは数えられます。"

msgid ""
"Neither does Escape on the briefing, which goes back without starting."
msgstr "ブリーフィングでEscapeを押して始めずに戻った場合も数えられません。"

msgid ""
"Daily, Sprint dive: one dive, from dive 1 to 3, with a twist announced up "
"front: murky water that halves your sonar, rich wrecks with more mines, rip "
"currents, or thin air."
msgstr ""
"デイリー、スプリント潜水：潜水1から3のどれかで一回潜り、最初に変化が知らされます。ソナーが半分になる濁った水、機雷の多い宝の多い沈没船、離岸流、薄い空"
"気のどれかです。"

msgid ""
"Weekly, Long haul: up to 3 dives from dive 3, with no hull repairs between "
"them, and a twist of its own."
msgstr "ウィークリー、長丁場：潜水3から最大3回。間に船体の修理はなく、独自の変化があります。"

msgid ""
"Monthly, The sunken galleon: on each dive, a galleon holding 1000 coins "
"lies near the edge of the site, ringed by 6 mines. 2 dives from dive 4, and "
"a single hull point. Salvaging the galleon takes 6 seconds of stillness."
msgstr ""
"マンスリー、沈んだガレオン船：潜水ごとに、金貨1000枚を積んだガレオン船が潜水地点の端近くに沈み、6つの機雷に囲まれています。潜水4から2回、船体ポイ"
"ントは一つだけ。ガレオン船の引き揚げには、6秒じっとしている必要があります。"

msgid ""
"Monthly, The sunken galleon: on each dive, a galleon holding 1000 coins "
"lies near the edge of the site, ringed by 6 mines."
msgstr "マンスリー、沈んだガレオン船：潜水ごとに、金貨1000枚を積んだガレオン船が潜水地点の端近くに沈み、6つの機雷に囲まれています。"

msgid "2 dives from dive 4, and a single hull point."
msgstr "潜水4から2回、船体ポイントは一つだけ。"

msgid "Salvaging the galleon takes 6 seconds of stillness."
msgstr "ガレオン船の引き揚げには、6秒じっとしている必要があります。"

msgid ""
"Moon pearl dive, on every full moon night. The title has a row for it. It "
"is an expedition from dive 1 on a sea made from that full moon's date, so "
"every player dives the same sea that night. Each dive also hides one moon "
"pearl, worth 150 coins on the first dive and more the deeper you go. Swim "
"into a moon pearl to collect it, like a chest. The moon pearl dive keeps "
"its own best haul. Once the full moon has set, Play again says so and takes "
"you back to the title."
msgstr ""
"月の真珠の潜水、満月の夜ごと。タイトルに項目が出ます。その満月の日付から作られた海で潜水1から探検するので、その夜は全員が同じ海に潜ります。潜水ごとに月"
"の真珠が一つ隠れていて、最初の潜水で金貨150枚、深いほど価値が上がります。宝箱と同じように、突っ込むと手に入ります。月の真珠の潜水のベストの稼ぎは別に"
"残ります。満月が沈んだ後は、もう一度プレイでそう伝え、タイトルに戻ります。"

msgid "Moon pearl dive, on every full moon night."
msgstr "月の真珠の潜水、満月の夜ごと。"

msgid ""
"It is an expedition from dive 1 on a sea made from that full moon's date, "
"so every player dives the same sea that night."
msgstr "その満月の日付から作られた海で潜水1から探検するので、その夜は全員が同じ海に潜ります。"

msgid ""
"Each dive also hides one moon pearl, worth 150 coins on the first dive and "
"more the deeper you go."
msgstr "潜水ごとに月の真珠が一つ隠れていて、最初の潜水で金貨150枚、深いほど価値が上がります。"

msgid "Swim into a moon pearl to collect it, like a chest."
msgstr "宝箱と同じように、突っ込むと手に入ります。"

msgid "The moon pearl dive keeps its own best haul."
msgstr "月の真珠の潜水のベストの稼ぎは別に残ります。"

msgid ""
"Once the full moon has set, Play again says so and takes you back to the "
"title."
msgstr "満月が沈んだ後は、もう一度プレイでそう伝え、タイトルに戻ります。"

msgid "Sound check includes the pearl cues."
msgstr "サウンドテストには真珠の音もあります。"

msgid ""
"Left and Right arrows: turn while held. Letting go names your heading."
msgstr "LeftとRight：押している間、回転する。離すと向きを伝える。"

msgid "Left and Right arrows: turn while held."
msgstr "LeftとRight：押している間、回転する。"

msgid "Letting go names your heading."
msgstr "離すと向きを伝えます。"

msgid ""
"Up and Down arrows: move the engine telegraph one step: slow astern, all "
"stop, slow ahead, half ahead, full ahead."
msgstr "UpとDown：速力通信機を一段階動かす。微速後進、停止、微速前進、半速前進、全速前進。"

msgid "Space: send a sonar ping."
msgstr "Space：ソナーを打つ。"

msgid "Tab: drop a marker buoy where you are."
msgstr "Tab：今いる場所に目印のブイを落とす。"

msgid ""
"S: air, hull, any current, and where the bell is. Press it again straight "
"away for heading, throttle, coins aboard and banked, and the dive and its "
"depth."
msgstr "S：空気、船体、潮流があればそれ、鐘の位置。すぐにもう一度押すと、向き、速力、積んでいる金貨と預けた金貨、潜水とその深さ。"

msgid "S: air, hull, any current, and where the bell is."
msgstr "S：空気、船体、潮流があればそれ、鐘の位置。"

msgid ""
"Press it again straight away for heading, throttle, coins aboard and "
"banked, and the dive and its depth."
msgstr "すぐにもう一度押すと、向き、速力、積んでいる金貨と預けた金貨、潜水とその深さを伝えます。"

msgid "R: repeat the last message."
msgstr "R：最後のメッセージをくり返す。"

msgid ""
"H: a hint, naming the nearest treasure and how to take it, any mine close "
"by, and a warning when it is time to head home."
msgstr "H：ヒント。一番近い宝と取り方、近くの機雷、帰る時間になったら警告。"

msgid "F1: help for the current screen. F2 stops speech."
msgstr "F1：今の画面のヘルプ。F2で読み上げを止めます。"

msgid "Sonar ping"
msgstr "ソナー"

msgid "your own ping going out. Echoes follow from wherever things are."
msgstr "自分のソナーが出ていく音。続いて、物のある場所から反響が返ります。"

msgid "Sonar recharging"
msgstr "ソナー充電中"

msgid "a ping was asked for too soon. Wait a moment."
msgstr "ソナーを打つのが早すぎました。少し待ちましょう。"

msgid "Wreck echo"
msgstr "沈没船の反響"

msgid ""
"a hollow metal clang: a shipwreck with treasure in its hold. Stop beside it "
"to salvage."
msgstr "うつろな金属のカーン：船倉に宝のある沈没船。横で止まって引き揚げましょう。"

msgid "Empty wreck echo"
msgstr "空の沈没船の反響"

msgid "a dull thud: a wreck you have already emptied."
msgstr "鈍いドン：もう空にした沈没船。"

msgid "Treasure chest echo"
msgstr "宝箱の反響"

msgid "a bright double chime: a chest on the seabed. Steer into it."
msgstr "明るい二重のチャイム：海底の宝箱。突っ込みましょう。"

msgid "Mine echo"
msgstr "機雷の反響"

msgid "a harsh buzzing ring: a mine. Steer around it."
msgstr "耳ざわりなブーンという響き：機雷。避けて進みましょう。"

msgid "Rock echo"
msgstr "岩の反響"

msgid "a short stony knock: a rock outcrop that will stop you."
msgstr "短い石のコツン：行く手をふさぐ岩場。"

msgid "Rock wall echo"
msgstr "岩壁の反響"

msgid "a deep rumble: the cliff at the edge of the dive site."
msgstr "深いゴロゴロ：潜水地点の端の崖。"

msgid "Whale echo"
msgstr "クジラの反響"

msgid "a soft low hum: a friendly whale. Pass close and it shares air."
msgstr "やわらかく低いハミング：人なつこいクジラ。近くを通ると空気を分けてくれます。"

msgid "Current echo"
msgstr "潮流の反響"

msgid "a rushing hiss: a current that will push you."
msgstr "勢いのあるシューッ：押し流す潮流。"

msgid "Galleon echo"
msgstr "ガレオン船の反響"

msgid "a great gong: the treasure galleon of the monthly event."
msgstr "大きな銅鑼：マンスリーイベントの宝のガレオン船。"

msgid "Glow pearl echo"
msgstr "光る真珠の反響"

msgid ""
"a glassy rising chime: the glow pearl of the new moon's glow dive. Steer "
"into it."
msgstr "ガラスのような上がっていくチャイム：新月の光の潜水の光る真珠。突っ込みましょう。"

msgid "The boat's bell"
msgstr "船の鐘"

msgid ""
"rings every few seconds from the boat. Return to it to surface and bank "
"your treasure."
msgstr "船から数秒ごとに鳴ります。戻ると浮上して宝を預けます。"

msgid "Buoy dropped"
msgstr "ブイを落とした"

msgid "you let a marker buoy go where you are."
msgstr "今いる場所に目印のブイを放しました。"

msgid "Buoy beep"
msgstr "ブイのビープ"

msgid "a marker buoy you dropped, beeping from where you left it."
msgstr "落とした目印のブイが、置いた場所から鳴っています。"

msgid "Mine proximity tick"
msgstr "機雷の接近音"

msgid "a mine is near. The ticks come faster the closer it is."
msgstr "機雷が近くにあります。近いほど音が速くなります。"

msgid "Mine explosion"
msgstr "機雷の爆発"

msgid "you touched a mine and lost a hull point."
msgstr "機雷に触れて、船体ポイントが一つ減りました。"

msgid "Chest collected"
msgstr "宝箱を回収"

msgid "coins from a chest are aboard."
msgstr "宝箱の金貨を積み込みました。"

msgid "Glow pearl collected"
msgstr "光る真珠を回収"

msgid "the glow pearl's coins are aboard."
msgstr "光る真珠の金貨を積み込みました。"

msgid "Salvage clank"
msgstr "引き揚げのガチャガチャ"

msgid "the grab arm working in a wreck. Stay stopped until it finishes."
msgstr "アームが沈没船で作業中。終わるまで止まっていましょう。"

msgid "Salvage done"
msgstr "引き揚げ完了"

msgid "the wreck's treasure is aboard."
msgstr "沈没船の宝を積み込みました。"

msgid "Scrape"
msgstr "こすれる音"

msgid "you hit rock. The engine stops and you lose a little air."
msgstr "岩にぶつかりました。エンジンが止まり、空気が少し減ります。"

msgid "In a current"
msgstr "潮流の中"

msgid "loops while a current pushes you."
msgstr "潮流に押されている間、くり返し鳴ります。"

msgid "Whale song"
msgstr "クジラの歌"

msgid "a whale calling from where it swims."
msgstr "泳いでいる場所から、クジラが呼んでいます。"

msgid "The whale road"
msgstr "クジラの道"

msgid ""
"on the equinoxes only: whale song marks north, beyond the dive site. There "
"is nothing to collect there."
msgstr "春分と秋分だけ：潜水地点の向こう、北をクジラの歌が示します。そこで集めるものはありません。"

msgid "Whale's air"
msgstr "クジラの空気"

msgid "a whale shared air with you: your tank gains time."
msgstr "クジラが空気を分けてくれました。タンクの時間が増えます。"

msgid "Air warning"
msgstr "空気の警告"

msgid "half, a quarter, or the last fifteen seconds of air."
msgstr "空気が半分、四分の一、または最後の十五秒。"

msgid "Throttle up"
msgstr "速力アップ"

msgid "the engine telegraph moving one step faster."
msgstr "速力通信機が一段階速くなります。"

msgid "Throttle down"
msgstr "速力ダウン"

msgid "the engine telegraph moving one step slower."
msgstr "速力通信機が一段階遅くなります。"

msgid "Turn tick"
msgstr "回転のクリック"

msgid "a soft click for every 30 degrees you turn."
msgstr "30度回るごとに鳴る、やわらかなクリック。"

msgid "Engine"
msgstr "エンジン"

msgid "your sub's motor. It rises in pitch as you go faster."
msgstr "潜水艇のモーター。速くなるほど音が高くなります。"

msgid "Surfacing"
msgstr "浮上"

msgid "you reached the bell and rose to the boat."
msgstr "鐘にたどり着き、船まで浮上しました。"

msgid "Out of air"
msgstr "空気切れ"

msgid "the tank ran dry and the dive is lost."
msgstr "タンクが空になり、潜水は失敗です。"

msgid "Glow dive"
msgstr "光の潜水"

msgid ""
"The new moon has passed, and the glow dive is over until the next new moon"
msgstr "新月が過ぎ、光の潜水は次の新月まで終わりです"

