msgid ""
"A gentle sandy bay with easy creatures, and shy ones that come out quickly."
msgstr "穏やかな砂の入り江。見つけやすい生き物が多く、恥ずかしがりもすぐ出てきます。"

msgid ""
"Rockier pools with gobies and hermit crabs, and a better chance of rare "
"finds."
msgstr "岩の多い潮だまりで、ハゼやヤドカリがいて、珍しい発見のチャンスも高めです。"

msgid ""
"A long reef with every common creature, the shyest ones, and the best "
"chance of rare finds."
msgstr "長い岩礁。よくいる生き物すべてと、いちばんの恥ずかしがりがいて、珍しい発見のチャンスも最高です。"

msgid "No twist"
msgstr "変化なし"

msgid "A busy shore"
msgstr "にぎやかな浜"

msgid "A quick tide"
msgstr "速い潮"

msgid "Hushed"
msgstr "静けさ"

#. placeholders: {name}
msgid "The {name} hunt"
msgstr "{name}探し"

msgid "Still water: shy creatures come back out twice as fast."
msgstr "静かな水面：恥ずかしがりの生き物が倍の速さで出てきます。"

msgid "A busy shore: every pool holds at least one creature."
msgstr "にぎやかな浜：どの潮だまりにも生き物が少なくとも一匹います。"

msgid ""
"A quick tide: the trip is half a minute shorter, and every find is worth "
"double."
msgstr "速い潮：お出かけが三十秒短くなり、発見はすべて倍の点数です。"

msgid "Hushed: the pools either side are silent, wherever you stand."
msgstr "静けさ：どこに立っても、左右の潮だまりは聞こえません。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Finding it is worth 300 points."
msgstr "見つけると300点です。"

#. placeholders: {name}, {sound_words}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Somewhere along the reef is one {name}: {sound_words}."
msgstr "岩礁のどこかに{name}が一匹います：{sound_words}。"

#. placeholders: {name}, {sound_words}
msgid ""
"Somewhere along the reef is one {name}: {sound_words}. Finding it is worth "
"300 points."
msgstr "岩礁のどこかに{name}が一匹います：{sound_words}。見つけると300点です。"

msgid ""
"The Great Low Tide: the sea draws back further than on any other day this "
"month. Every rare creature can turn up, whatever the weather, and each "
"different kind you gather is worth 40 points more. Gather 8 different kinds "
"to meet the goal."
msgstr ""
"大干潮：今月のどの日よりも潮が遠くまで引きます。天気に関係なくどの珍しい生き物も現れ、違う種類を集めるたびに40点追加。8種類集めると目標達成です。"

#. placeholders: {pools}, {time}
msgid "{pools} pools, about {time} before the tide returns."
msgstr "潮だまりは{pools}個、潮が戻るまで約{time}。"

#. placeholders: {species}
msgid " Tonight's three species: {species}."
msgstr " 今夜の三種：{species}。"

msgid "a minute and a half"
msgstr "一分半"

#. placeholders: {n}
msgid "{n} and a half minutes"
msgstr "{n}分半"

msgid "standing back on the rocks"
msgstr "岩の上に下がって"

msgid "at the water's edge"
msgstr "水際で"

msgid "leaning in close"
msgstr "ぐっと身を乗り出して"

#. placeholders: {w}
msgid "First found {w}."
msgstr "初めて見つけたのは{w}。"

msgid " It is shy: it hides when you lean in, until you keep still."
msgstr "恥ずかしがりです。身を乗り出すと隠れ、じっとしていると出てきます。"

#. placeholders: {w}
msgid " A rare find: it only turns up {w}."
msgstr "珍しい発見です。{w}にしか現れません。"

#. placeholders: {name}, {sound_words}, {shy}, {rare}, {points}
msgid "The {name}: {sound_words}.{shy}{rare} Worth {points} points."
msgstr "{name}：{sound_words}。{shy}{rare}{points}点。"

msgid ""
"A quick falling swish and a plop: something shy darted out of sight as you "
"leaned in. Keep still until it creeps back out."
msgstr "すばやく下がるシュッという音とポチャン：身を乗り出したので、恥ずかしがりの何かが隠れました。出てくるまでじっとしていましょう。"

msgid "Hiding"
msgstr "隠れる"

msgid "Creeping out"
msgstr "出てくる"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "Two soft rising notes"
msgstr "やわらかく上がる二音"

msgid ""
"Two soft rising notes: something shy has come back out. Listen for its "
"sound, then reach in."
msgstr "やわらかく上がる二音：恥ずかしがりの何かが出てきました。鳴くのを聞いてから手を入れましょう。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid ""
"something shy has come back out. Listen for its sound, then reach in."
msgstr "恥ずかしがりの何かが出てきました。鳴くのを聞いてから手を入れましょう。"

msgid ""
"A scoop of water and a rising chime: you gathered a creature for your "
"aquarium."
msgstr "水をすくう音と上がるチャイム：水槽用の生き物を採りました。"

msgid "Gathered"
msgstr "採った"

msgid "Empty hands"
msgstr "空振り"

msgid ""
"Water dripping from your fingers: nothing came up. Reach in just after you "
"hear something."
msgstr "指から水がしたたる音：何も採れませんでした。何か聞こえた直後に手を入れましょう。"

msgid ""
"A hand patting wet rock: you are too far back to reach the water. Lean in "
"first."
msgstr "ぬれた岩をたたく手の音：下がりすぎて水に届きません。まず身を乗り出しましょう。"

msgid "Out of reach"
msgstr "届かない"

msgid "Walking over wet rock to the next pool."
msgstr "ぬれた岩を歩いて次の潮だまりへ。"

msgid "Kneeling closer to the water."
msgstr "水に近づいてひざをつきます。"

msgid "Leaning in"
msgstr "身を乗り出す"

msgid "Rising and stepping back from the water."
msgstr "立ち上がって水から下がります。"

msgid "Stepping back"
msgstr "下がる"

msgid "A soft thud into sand: there are no more pools that way."
msgstr "砂にやわらかくドスン：そちらにはもう潮だまりがありません。"

msgid "End of the rocks"
msgstr "岩の端"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "One distant bell buoy"
msgstr "遠くのベルブイが一回"

msgid ""
"One distant bell buoy: half the trip is gone and the sea starts back."
msgstr "遠くのベルブイが一回：お出かけの半分が過ぎ、潮が戻り始めます。"

msgid "The tide turns"
msgstr "潮が変わる"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "half the trip is gone and the sea starts back."
msgstr "お出かけの半分が過ぎ、潮が戻り始めます。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "The bell buoy twice"
msgstr "ベルブイが二回"

msgid "The bell buoy twice: the tide will soon cover the pools."
msgstr "ベルブイが二回：もうすぐ潮が潮だまりを覆います。"

msgid "The tide is near"
msgstr "潮が近い"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "the tide will soon cover the pools."
msgstr "もうすぐ潮が潮だまりを覆います。"

msgid "A big wave washing over the rocks: the trip is over."
msgstr "大きな波が岩を洗う音：お出かけはおしまいです。"

msgid "The tide comes in"
msgstr "潮が満ちる"

msgid "A rare find"
msgstr "珍しい発見"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "A shimmer"
msgstr "きらめく音"

msgid "A shimmer: what you gathered is rare."
msgstr "きらめく音：採ったものは珍しい生き物です。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "what you gathered is rare."
msgstr "採ったものは珍しい生き物です。"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "A little rising arpeggio"
msgstr "小さく上がるアルペジオ"

msgid "A little rising arpeggio: a kind you have never gathered before."
msgstr "小さく上がるアルペジオ：初めて採った種類です。"

msgid "New for the aquarium"
msgstr "水槽に新顔"

#. the name or the meaning of a longer line
msgid "a kind you have never gathered before."
msgstr "初めて採った種類です。"

msgid ""
"The sea, ahead of you beyond the pools. It grows louder and nearer as the "
"tide comes in."
msgstr "潮だまりの向こう、前方の海。潮が満ちるにつれて大きく近くなります。"

msgid "Waves"
msgstr "波"

msgid "The pool in front of you"
msgstr "目の前の潮だまり"

msgid "The water of the pool you stand at, nearer as you lean in."
msgstr "立っている潮だまりの水。身を乗り出すと近くなります。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Lean in close."
msgstr "ぐっと身を乗り出しましょう。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"Stand back to take in this pool and its neighbours; lean in for only this "
"one."
msgstr "下がるとこの潮だまりととなりが聞こえ、身を乗り出すとこれだけが聞こえます。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}, {d}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{sentence_start} leans toward the water; {d} steps back."
msgstr "{sentence_start}で水に身を乗り出し、{d}で下がります。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}, {d}
msgid ""
"{sentence_start} leans toward the water; {d} steps back. Stand back to take "
"in this pool and its neighbours; lean in for only this one. Lean in close."
msgstr ""
"{sentence_start}で水に身を乗り出し、{d}で下がります。下がるとこの潮だまりととなりが聞こえ、身を乗り出すとこれだけが聞こえます。ぐっと"
"身を乗り出しましょう。"

#. placeholders: {p}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Press {p} just after it calls."
msgstr "鳴いた直後に{p}を押します。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "This pool holds an anemone."
msgstr "この潮だまりにはイソギンチャクがいます。"

#. placeholders: {p}
msgid "This pool holds an anemone. Press {p} just after it calls."
msgstr "この潮だまりにはイソギンチャクがいます。鳴いた直後に{p}を押します。"

msgid ""
"The anemone is yours. Reach in when nothing has called, and your hands come "
"up with only water."
msgstr "イソギンチャクを採りました。何も鳴いていないときに手を入れても、水しかすくえません。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"It darts away when you lean in, so keep still until it creeps back out, "
"then gather it."
msgstr "身を乗り出すとさっと逃げるので、出てくるまでじっとしてから採りましょう。"

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "The pool on your right holds a shy shore crab."
msgstr "右の潮だまりには恥ずかしがりのイソガニがいます。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}, {r}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "{sentence_start} and {r} walk from pool to pool."
msgstr "{sentence_start}と{r}で潮だまりから潮だまりへ歩きます。"

#. placeholders: {sentence_start}, {r}
msgid ""
"{sentence_start} and {r} walk from pool to pool. The pool on your right "
"holds a shy shore crab. It darts away when you lean in, so keep still until "
"it creeps back out, then gather it."
msgstr ""
"{sentence_start}と{r}で潮だまりから潮だまりへ歩きます。右の潮だまりには恥ずかしがりのイソガニがいます。身を乗り出すとさっと逃げるので"
"、出てくるまでじっとしてから採りましょう。"

msgid "The crab is yours."
msgstr "カニを採りました。"

msgid ""
"The tide is out, and rock pools line the shore with the sea ahead of you. "
"There is no way to fail: gather what you find. Learn in the practice pools"
msgstr "潮が引いて、浜には潮だまりが並び、前には海があります。失敗はありません。見つけたものを採りましょう。練習の潮だまりで覚えましょう"

msgid ""
"A trip lasts until the tide comes back. On a trip, what you gather goes "
"home to your aquarium. These practice creatures go back in the water. F1 "
"lists the rest."
msgstr "お出かけは潮が戻るまで続きます。お出かけで採ったものは水槽へ連れて帰れます。この練習の生き物は海に返します。残りはF1で確認できます。"

msgid ""
"Cross ten rooftop wires. Shift your weight to stay balanced, counter gusts "
"and shoo pigeons out of your path. Each crossing is longer, higher and "
"windier."
msgstr ""
"屋上の綱を十本渡りましょう。体重を移してバランスを取り、突風に耐え、行く手のハトを追い払います。渡るたびに長く、高く、風が強くなります。"

msgid "Cross ten rooftop wires."
msgstr "屋上の綱を十本渡りましょう。"

msgid ""
"Shift your weight to stay balanced, counter gusts and shoo pigeons out of "
"your path."
msgstr "体重を移してバランスを取り、突風に耐え、行く手のハトを追い払います。"

msgid "Each crossing is longer, higher and windier."
msgstr "渡るたびに長く、高く、風が強くなります。"

msgid "Your balance"
msgstr "バランス"

msgid ""
"Use the balance cue or press S to check which way you are leaning. Sound "
"check, on the title, lets you hear the balance cue and other gameplay cues."
msgstr "バランスの合図を聞くか、Sを押して、どちらに傾いているか確かめます。タイトルのサウンドテストで、バランスの合図などの合図を聞けます。"

msgid "Use the balance cue or press S to check which way you are leaning."
msgstr "バランスの合図を聞くか、Sを押して、どちらに傾いているか確かめます。"

msgid ""
"Sound check, on the title, lets you hear the balance cue and other gameplay "
"cues."
msgstr "タイトルのサウンドテストで、バランスの合図などの合図を聞けます。"

msgid ""
"A lean grows by itself, the way a real wire tips you. Left and Right shift "
"your weight. Press the opposite way to your lean: leaning left, press "
"Right. Each press shifts your weight once. Holding the key adds no further "
"shift. Release it and wait for your balance to settle before pressing "
"again, or you may swing past the middle."
msgstr ""
"本物の綱と同じように、傾きはひとりでに大きくなります。LeftとRightで体重を移します。傾きと逆の方向を押しましょう。左に傾いたらRightです。一"
"回押すごとに一回体重が移ります。押し続けても、それ以上は移りません。キーを離し、バランスが落ち着くのを待ってから次を押しましょう。でないと真ん中を通り越"
"すかもしれません。"

msgid "A lean grows by itself, the way a real wire tips you."
msgstr "本物の綱と同じように、傾きはひとりでに大きくなります。"

msgid "Left and Right shift your weight."
msgstr "LeftとRightで体重を移します。"

msgid "Press the opposite way to your lean: leaning left, press Right."
msgstr "傾きと逆の方向を押しましょう。左に傾いたらRightです。"

msgid "Each press shifts your weight once."
msgstr "一回押すごとに一回体重が移ります。"

msgid "Holding the key adds no further shift."
msgstr "押し続けても、それ以上は移りません。"

msgid ""
"Release it and wait for your balance to settle before pressing again, or "
"you may swing past the middle."
msgstr "キーを離し、バランスが落ち着くのを待ってから次を押しましょう。でないと真ん中を通り越すかもしれません。"

msgid ""
"Step once you have returned to balance. The game warns you when you lean "
"hard left or right. Lean all the way and you fall to the safety net."
msgstr "バランスが戻ったら一歩進みます。左右に大きく傾くと警告が出ます。傾ききると安全ネットに落ちます。"

msgid "Step once you have returned to balance."
msgstr "バランスが戻ったら一歩進みます。"

msgid "The game warns you when you lean hard left or right."
msgstr "左右に大きく傾くと警告が出ます。"

msgid "Lean all the way and you fall to the safety net."
msgstr "傾ききると安全ネットに落ちます。"

msgid "S, the status key, always says your lean."
msgstr "状況キーのSで、いつでも傾きがわかります。"

msgid ""
"Space takes one step. Steps need a moment between them. No foot lands quite "
"square. Every step jolts the wire a little, so settle after each one."
msgstr ""
"Spaceで一歩進みます。一歩ごとに少し間が必要です。足はいつも少しずれて着きます。一歩ごとに綱が少し揺れるので、そのたびに落ち着きましょう。"

msgid "Space takes one step."
msgstr "Spaceで一歩進みます。"

msgid "Steps need a moment between them."
msgstr "一歩ごとに少し間が必要です。"

msgid "No foot lands quite square."
msgstr "足はいつも少しずれて着きます。"

msgid "Every step jolts the wire a little, so settle after each one."
msgstr "一歩ごとに綱が少し揺れるので、そのたびに落ち着きましょう。"

msgid ""
"Step only when balanced. A step while you lean past the safe line is a "
"wobble: the wire throws you further the way you were leaning. A step is "
"refused when it comes too soon after the last one, or while you crouch."
msgstr ""
"バランスが取れているときだけ進みましょう。安全な線より傾いたまま進むとぐらつき、綱が傾いていた方へさらに振ります。前の一歩から早すぎるときや、かがんでい"
"るときは進めません。"

msgid "Step only when balanced."
msgstr "バランスが取れているときだけ進みましょう。"

msgid ""
"A step while you lean past the safe line is a wobble: the wire throws you "
"further the way you were leaning."
msgstr "安全な線より傾いたまま進むとぐらつき、綱が傾いていた方へさらに振ります。"

msgid ""
"A step is refused when it comes too soon after the last one, or while you "
"crouch."
msgstr "前の一歩から早すぎるときや、かがんでいるときは進めません。"

msgid "The game says when you are halfway, 3 steps out and 1 step out."
msgstr "半分まで来たとき、残り3歩、残り1歩で知らせます。"

msgid ""
"Each gust is announced with its direction at least 2 seconds before it "
"hits. It pushes you away from that side for about a second."
msgstr "突風は当たる少なくとも2秒前に、方向とともに知らせます。約一秒間、その方向から押されます。"

msgid ""
"Each gust is announced with its direction at least 2 seconds before it hits."
msgstr "突風は当たる少なくとも2秒前に、方向とともに知らせます。"

msgid "It pushes you away from that side for about a second."
msgstr "約一秒間、その方向から押されます。"

msgid "You have two choices:"
msgstr "方法は二つあります："

msgid ""
"Lean a little into the wind before it arrives: for a gust from the left, a "
"press of Left."
msgstr "風が来る前に少し風上へ傾きます。左からの突風ならLeftを一回。"

msgid ""
"Down crouches. Crouching makes the wire much steadier and the wind pushes "
"less than half as hard, but you cannot step. Up stands once it passes."
msgstr "Downでかがみます。かがむと綱がずっと安定し、風の押す力も半分以下になりますが、進めません。過ぎたらUpで立ちます。"

msgid "Down crouches."
msgstr "Downでかがみます。"

msgid ""
"Crouching makes the wire much steadier and the wind pushes less than half "
"as hard, but you cannot step."
msgstr "かがむと綱がずっと安定し、風の押す力も半分以下になりますが、進めません。"

msgid "Up stands once it passes."
msgstr "過ぎたらUpで立ちます。"

msgid ""
"The status key says which side a gust comes from and how many seconds are "
"left. The hint key, H, says what to do about it."
msgstr "状況キーで、突風がどちらから来るか、あと何秒かがわかります。ヒントキーのHで、どうすればいいかがわかります。"

msgid ""
"The status key says which side a gust comes from and how many seconds are "
"left."
msgstr "状況キーで、突風がどちらから来るか、あと何秒かがわかります。"

msgid "The hint key, H, says what to do about it."
msgstr "ヒントキーのHで、どうすればいいかがわかります。"

msgid "Pigeons"
msgstr "ハト"

msgid ""
"From the second crossing on, pigeons land on the wire ahead and tip it "
"toward their side. The game says how many steps ahead each pigeon sits and "
"on which side."
msgstr "二本目からは、ハトが前方の綱にとまり、その側へ綱を傾けます。それぞれのハトが何歩先のどちら側にいるかを知らせます。"

msgid ""
"From the second crossing on, pigeons land on the wire ahead and tip it "
"toward their side."
msgstr "二本目からは、ハトが前方の綱にとまり、その側へ綱を傾けます。"

msgid ""
"The game says how many steps ahead each pigeon sits and on which side."
msgstr "それぞれのハトが何歩先のどちら側にいるかを知らせます。"

msgid ""
"Walk into a pigeon and it bursts up in your face and knocks you hard to the "
"other side. Shoo it with Tab once it is within 2 steps, which dips the wire "
"a little, or wait: a pigeon flies off by itself after several seconds. On "
"the Practice wire it waits until you shoo it."
msgstr ""
"ハトにぶつかると、顔の前で飛び立ち、反対側へ強くはじかれます。2歩以内に来たらTabで追い払うと綱が少し沈みます。待っても、ハトは数秒で自分から飛んでい"
"きます。練習の綱では、追い払うまで待っています。"

msgid ""
"Walk into a pigeon and it bursts up in your face and knocks you hard to the "
"other side."
msgstr "ハトにぶつかると、顔の前で飛び立ち、反対側へ強くはじかれます。"

msgid ""
"Shoo it with Tab once it is within 2 steps, which dips the wire a little, "
"or wait: a pigeon flies off by itself after several seconds."
msgstr "2歩以内に来たらTabで追い払うと綱が少し沈みます。待っても、ハトは数秒で自分から飛んでいきます。"

msgid "On the Practice wire it waits until you shoo it."
msgstr "練習の綱では、追い払うまで待っています。"

msgid "Sway and height"
msgstr "揺れと高さ"

msgid ""
"Long wires sway most at the middle, pushing you one way and then the other "
"in a steady rhythm."
msgstr "長い綱は真ん中がいちばん揺れ、一定のリズムで左右に押してきます。"

msgid "Higher wires have stronger wind."
msgstr "高い綱ほど風が強くなります。"

msgid "Falling"
msgstr "落下"

msgid ""
"Lean all the way over and you fall to the safety net. You lose a life and "
"climb back to the step where you fell, balanced, with a moment of calm "
"before the wire moves again. Lose your last life and the run is over."
msgstr ""
"傾ききると安全ネットに落ちます。ライフを一つ失い、落ちた歩数の場所にバランスを取った状態で戻ります。綱がまた動き出すまで少し落ち着く時間があります。最後"
"のライフを失うとプレイは終わりです。"

msgid "Lean all the way over and you fall to the safety net."
msgstr "傾ききると安全ネットに落ちます。"

msgid ""
"You lose a life and climb back to the step where you fell, balanced, with a "
"moment of calm before the wire moves again."
msgstr "ライフを一つ失い、落ちた歩数の場所にバランスを取った状態で戻ります。綱がまた動き出すまで少し落ち着く時間があります。"

msgid "Lose your last life and the run is over."
msgstr "最後のライフを失うとプレイは終わりです。"

msgid "On the practice wire falling costs nothing."
msgstr "練習の綱では、落ちても何も失いません。"

msgid ""
"The wire holds while a line is still being spoken. Your balance, the wind "
"and the pigeons stand still until it ends. Once a gust whoosh starts, the "
"wire runs on through speech until the gust hits. A line you ask for again "
"and again stops holding after a while. This holds at every pace and in "
"every mode. Time spent while a line is spoken still counts toward your "
"crossing time and your par bonus."
msgstr ""
"音声が流れている間、綱は止まります。バランス、風、ハトは音声が終わるまで止まったままです。突風のヒューという音が始まったら、当たるまで音声の間も綱は動き"
"続けます。何度も繰り返し聞くと、しばらくして止まらなくなります。どのペースでも、どのモードでも同じです。音声の間の時間も、渡る時間と規定タイムのボーナス"
"に数えられます。"

msgid "The wire holds while a line is still being spoken."
msgstr "音声が流れている間、綱は止まります。"

msgid "Your balance, the wind and the pigeons stand still until it ends."
msgstr "バランス、風、ハトは音声が終わるまで止まったままです。"

msgid ""
"Once a gust whoosh starts, the wire runs on through speech until the gust "
"hits."
msgstr "突風のヒューという音が始まったら、当たるまで音声の間も綱は動き続けます。"

msgid ""
"Time spent while a line is spoken still counts toward your crossing time "
"and your par bonus."
msgstr "音声の間の時間も、渡る時間と規定タイムのボーナスに数えられます。"

msgid ""
"Pace in Settings sets how fast the wire runs: relaxed, normal or quick. "
"Normal is the default and a little slower than quick. Quick is the fastest, "
"and relaxed runs at half speed. Your balance, the wind, the pigeons and "
"each crossing's time follow the pace."
msgstr ""
"設定のペースで、綱の速さを決めます：ゆったり、ふつう、速い。ふつうが標準で、速いより少しゆっくりです。速いがいちばん速く、ゆったりは半分の速さです。バラ"
"ンス、風、ハト、各コースの時間がペースに合わせて変わります。"

msgid ""
"Pace in Settings sets how fast the wire runs: relaxed, normal or quick."
msgstr "設定のペースで、綱の速さを決めます：ゆったり、ふつう、速い。"

msgid ""
"Your balance, the wind, the pigeons and each crossing's time follow the "
"pace."
msgstr "バランス、風、ハト、各コースの時間がペースに合わせて変わります。"

msgid ""
"Relaxed scores and best times are saved separately, including challenges "
"and events. Normal and quick share their scores. Your furthest crossing "
"counts at every pace."
msgstr ""
"ゆったりのスコアとベストタイムは、チャレンジやイベントも含めて別に記録されます。ふつうと速いはスコアを共有します。いちばん遠くまで進んだコースは、どのペ"
"ースでも数えられます。"

msgid "Your furthest crossing counts at every pace."
msgstr "いちばん遠くまで進んだコースは、どのペースでも数えられます。"

msgid "Each step scores 10 points times the crossing's number."
msgstr "一歩ごとに、10点かけるコースの番号が入ります。"

msgid "Reaching the far rooftop scores 100 times the crossing's number."
msgstr "向こうの屋上に着くと、100かけるコースの番号が入ります。"

msgid ""
"Finish under the par time for 5 points for every second to spare. Par is "
"about 1.3 seconds a step, plus 6 seconds."
msgstr "規定タイムより早く渡ると、余った一秒ごとに5点。規定タイムはおよそ一歩1.3秒に6秒を足したものです。"

msgid "Finish under the par time for 5 points for every second to spare."
msgstr "規定タイムより早く渡ると、余った一秒ごとに5点。"

msgid "Par is about 1.3 seconds a step, plus 6 seconds."
msgstr "規定タイムはおよそ一歩1.3秒に6秒を足したものです。"

msgid "A crossing with no falls scores a bonus of 50 times its number."
msgstr "一度も落ちずに渡ると、50かけるその番号のボーナス。"

msgid ""
"Your best score on each mode, your best time on each crossing and your "
"furthest crossing are saved. Records, on the title, reads them all, with "
"your challenge results."
msgstr ""
"各モードのベストスコア、各コースのベストタイム、いちばん遠くまで進んだコースが記録されます。タイトルの記録で、チャレンジの結果と一緒にすべて聞けます。"

msgid ""
"Your best score on each mode, your best time on each crossing and your "
"furthest crossing are saved."
msgstr "各モードのベストスコア、各コースのベストタイム、いちばん遠くまで進んだコースが記録されます。"

msgid "Records, on the title, reads them all, with your challenge results."
msgstr "タイトルの記録で、チャレンジの結果と一緒にすべて聞けます。"

msgid ""
"Play, skyline run: all 10 crossings with 3 lives, from the bakery to the "
"Skyline Spire."
msgstr "プレイ、スカイライン走破：ライフ3で全10コース。パン屋からSkyline Spireまで。"

msgid ""
"Night skyline: locked until you finish all 10 crossings. The same wires, "
"twitchier, with harder wind and busier pigeons. Gusts are still always "
"warned."
msgstr ""
"夜のスカイライン：全10コースを渡りきるまでロック。同じ綱ですが、よりぴりぴりして風が強く、ハトも多めです。突風は今まで通り必ず知らせます。"

msgid "Night skyline: locked until you finish all 10 crossings."
msgstr "夜のスカイライン：全10コースを渡りきるまでロック。"

msgid "The same wires, twitchier, with harder wind and busier pigeons."
msgstr "同じ綱ですが、よりぴりぴりして風が強く、ハトも多めです。"

msgid "Gusts are still always warned."
msgstr "突風は今まで通り必ず知らせます。"

msgid ""
"Crossing select: walk one crossing alone, for its best time. A crossing "
"opens once you reach it."
msgstr "コース選択：一つのコースだけを渡り、ベストタイムを狙います。コースはたどり着くと開きます。"

msgid "Crossing select: walk one crossing alone, for its best time."
msgstr "コース選択：一つのコースだけを渡り、ベストタイムを狙います。"

msgid "A crossing opens once you reach it."
msgstr "コースはたどり着くと開きます。"

msgid ""
"Practice wire: a short, low wire where the gust and the pigeon are each "
"explained as they arrive. On your first visit the title starts on it."
msgstr "練習の綱：短く低い綱で、突風とハトが来るたびに説明があります。初めて来たときは、タイトルがここから始まります。"

msgid ""
"Practice wire: a short, low wire where the gust and the pigeon are each "
"explained as they arrive."
msgstr "練習の綱：短く低い綱で、突風とハトが来るたびに説明があります。"

msgid "On your first visit the title starts on it."
msgstr "初めて来たときは、タイトルがここから始まります。"

msgid ""
"Before each run a page describes the run. Enter begins. Escape goes back to "
"the title."
msgstr "プレイの前に、その内容の説明があります。Enterで始め、Escapeでタイトルに戻ります。"

msgid "Before each run a page describes the run."
msgstr "プレイの前に、その内容の説明があります。"

msgid "Enter begins."
msgstr "Enterで始めます。"

msgid "After a run"
msgstr "プレイのあと"

msgid ""
"When a run ends the game reads how it went and what records it set. Then "
"the results menu offers Play again, or Try again after a fall ends the run, "
"Hear the results again, and Back to the title. After a single crossing you "
"win, Next crossing comes first. After a challenge, the last row is Back to "
"the challenges. Escape does the same as the last row."
msgstr ""
"プレイが終わると、どうだったかと、出した記録を伝えます。そのあと結果メニューに、もう一度プレイ、落ちて終わったときはもう一度挑戦、結果をもう一度聞く、タ"
"イトルに戻る、が出ます。一つのコースを渡りきったときは、次のコースがいちばん上に来ます。チャレンジのあとは、最後の行がチャレンジに戻るになります。Esc"
"apeは最後の行と同じです。"

msgid "When a run ends the game reads how it went and what records it set."
msgstr "プレイが終わると、どうだったかと、出した記録を伝えます。"

msgid ""
"Then the results menu offers Play again, or Try again after a fall ends the "
"run, Hear the results again, and Back to the title."
msgstr "そのあと結果メニューに、もう一度プレイ、落ちて終わったときはもう一度挑戦、結果をもう一度聞く、タイトルに戻る、が出ます。"

msgid "After a single crossing you win, Next crossing comes first."
msgstr "一つのコースを渡りきったときは、次のコースがいちばん上に来ます。"

msgid "Challenges are the same wires for every player, built from the date."
msgstr "チャレンジは全員に同じ綱で、日付から作られます。"

msgid ""
"Daily: one crossing with a twist, and 3 lives. Twists include Gale day, "
"with gusts twice as often, Pigeon parade, with 3 times the pigeons, Loose "
"wire, with twice the sway, and Slick wire, where every step slips a little "
"to one side."
msgstr ""
"デイリー：変化のある一コース、ライフ3。変化には、突風が倍になる強風の日、ハトが3倍のハトの大行進、揺れが倍のゆるい綱、一歩ごとに足が少し横にすべるすべ"
"る綱などがあります。"

msgid "Daily: one crossing with a twist, and 3 lives."
msgstr "デイリー：変化のある一コース、ライフ3。"

msgid ""
"Twists include Gale day, with gusts twice as often, Pigeon parade, with 3 "
"times the pigeons, Loose wire, with twice the sway, and Slick wire, where "
"every step slips a little to one side."
msgstr "変化には、突風が倍になる強風の日、ハトが3倍のハトの大行進、揺れが倍のゆるい綱、一歩ごとに足が少し横にすべるすべる綱などがあります。"

msgid "Weekly: 3 high crossings in a row, with a twist, on only 2 lives."
msgstr "ウィークリー：変化のある高い3コースを続けて、ライフは2だけ。"

msgid ""
"Monthly: the Grand Span, one immense wire 60 floors up and 60 steps long, "
"with a single life, and the wind changes side with every gust."
msgstr "マンスリー：大綱渡り。60階の高さにある60歩の巨大な綱を、ライフ一つで。突風のたびに風向きが変わります。"

msgid ""
"The rule and the time until the next challenge are read before you start, "
"and Escape on that briefing goes back without starting. Any finished run "
"counts toward your streak, even one that ends in the net. Leave the "
"challenge, on the pause menu, does not. Afterwards the game reads your "
"score, your best and your streak."
msgstr ""
"始める前に、ルールと次のチャレンジまでの時間を伝えます。そのブリーフィングでEscapeを押すと、始めずに戻ります。終わったプレイはネットに落ちて終わっ"
"ても連続記録に数えられます。一時停止メニューのチャレンジをやめるは数えられません。終わると、スコア、ベスト、連続記録を伝えます。"

msgid ""
"The rule and the time until the next challenge are read before you start, "
"and Escape on that briefing goes back without starting."
msgstr "始める前に、ルールと次のチャレンジまでの時間を伝えます。そのブリーフィングでEscapeを押すと、始めずに戻ります。"

msgid ""
"Any finished run counts toward your streak, even one that ends in the net."
msgstr "終わったプレイはネットに落ちて終わっても連続記録に数えられます。"

msgid "Afterwards the game reads your score, your best and your streak."
msgstr "終わると、スコア、ベスト、連続記録を伝えます。"

msgid ""
"Sound check, on the title, lists and plays the sounds you need on the wire. "
"Its first row plays the balance tone at the centre, then further left and "
"right."
msgstr "タイトルのサウンドテストで、綱で必要な音を一覧で聞けます。最初の行では、バランス音を真ん中、それから左右に少しずつ離して鳴らします。"

msgid ""
"Sound check, on the title, lists and plays the sounds you need on the wire."
msgstr "タイトルのサウンドテストで、綱で必要な音を一覧で聞けます。"

msgid ""
"Its first row plays the balance tone at the centre, then further left and "
"right."
msgstr "最初の行では、バランス音を真ん中、それから左右に少しずつ離して鳴らします。"

msgid ""
"Left and Right: shift your weight once per press. Release between presses. "
"Do not hold."
msgstr "LeftとRight：一回押すごとに一回体重を移す。押すたびに離しましょう。押し続けないこと。"

msgid "Left and Right: shift your weight once per press."
msgstr "LeftとRight：一回押すごとに一回体重を移す。"

msgid "Release between presses."
msgstr "押すたびに離しましょう。"

msgid "Do not hold."
msgstr "押し続けないこと。"

msgid "Space: take a step."
msgstr "Space：一歩進む。"

msgid "Down: crouch. Up: stand."
msgstr "Down：かがむ。Up：立つ。"

msgid "Down: crouch."
msgstr "Down：かがむ。"

msgid "Up: stand."
msgstr "Up：立つ。"

msgid "Tab: shoo a pigeon within 2 steps."
msgstr "Tab：2歩以内のハトを追い払う。"

msgid ""
"S: your step, lean, and any gust or pigeon. Press it again straight away "
"for lives, score, time on the wire and which wire you are on."
msgstr "S：今の歩数、傾き、突風やハト。すぐにもう一度押すと、ライフ、スコア、綱の上の時間、今どの綱か。"

msgid "S: your step, lean, and any gust or pigeon."
msgstr "S：今の歩数、傾き、突風やハト。"

msgid ""
"Press it again straight away for lives, score, time on the wire and which "
"wire you are on."
msgstr "すぐにもう一度押すと、ライフ、スコア、綱の上の時間、今どの綱か。"

msgid "tightrope"
msgstr ""

msgid "Steady chime"
msgstr "安定のチャイム"

msgid "You are balanced again after leaning: safe to step."
msgstr "傾いたあと、バランスが戻りました。進んで大丈夫です。"

msgid "Danger alarm"
msgstr "危険アラーム"

msgid ""
"You are leaning hard and close to falling. It sounds from the side you lean "
"to, and is spoken."
msgstr "大きく傾いて、落ちそうです。傾いている側から鳴り、音声でも知らせます。"

msgid "Weight shift"
msgstr "体重移動"

msgid "You shifted your weight left or right."
msgstr "体重を左か右に移しました。"

msgid "A safe step forward along the wire."
msgstr "綱の上を安全に一歩進みました。"

msgid "Wobble"
msgstr "ぐらつき"

msgid ""
"You stepped while leaning, or walked into a pigeon: the wire throws you "
"further over."
msgstr "傾いたまま進んだか、ハトにぶつかりました。綱がさらに傾けてきます。"

msgid "Slip"
msgstr "すべり"

msgid "Slick wire challenges only: a step slid your foot to one side."
msgstr "すべる綱のチャレンジだけ：一歩で足が横にすべりました。"

msgid "Step refused"
msgstr "進めない"

msgid ""
"You cannot step yet: too soon after the last step, or you are crouching."
msgstr "まだ進めません。前の一歩から早すぎるか、かがんでいます。"

msgid "Wire creak"
msgstr "綱のきしみ"

msgid ""
"The wire under you. It creaks faster the harder you sway, from the side you "
"lean to."
msgstr "足もとの綱。揺れが大きいほど速くきしみ、傾いている側から聞こえます。"

msgid "Second wire creak"
msgstr "二つ目の綱のきしみ"

msgid "Another creak of the wire. It means the same as the first."
msgstr "もう一つの綱のきしみ。意味は一つ目と同じです。"

msgid "Crouch"
msgstr "かがむ"

msgid ""
"You crouched low: steadier, and gusts push less, but you cannot step."
msgstr "低くかがみました。安定して突風の押す力も弱まりますが、進めません。"

msgid "Stand"
msgstr "立つ"

msgid "You stood up and can walk again."
msgstr "立ち上がり、また歩けます。"

msgid "Gust alert"
msgstr "突風の警告"

msgid ""
"A gust is coming, from the side this whistle sounds. It is always spoken "
"too."
msgstr "この笛が鳴る側から突風が来ます。音声でも必ず知らせます。"

msgid "Gust whoosh"
msgstr "突風のヒュー"

msgid ""
"The rising whoosh of a gust on its way. It peaks the moment the wind hits."
msgstr "近づく突風の高まるヒューという音。風が当たる瞬間がいちばん大きくなります。"

msgid "Gust blast"
msgstr "突風の一撃"

msgid "The gust is pushing you now, away from the side it blows from."
msgstr "今、突風に押されています。吹いてくる側の反対へ。"

msgid "Pigeon landing"
msgstr "ハトの着地"

msgid "A pigeon landed on the wire ahead and bounced it a little."
msgstr "前方の綱にハトがとまり、綱を少し揺らしました。"

msgid "Pigeon cooing"
msgstr "ハトの鳴き声"

msgid "A pigeon sits on the wire ahead. It gets closer as you walk."
msgstr "前方の綱にハトがいます。歩くと近づきます。"

msgid "Shoo"
msgstr "追い払う"

msgid "You waved and hissed at a pigeon."
msgstr "ハトに手を振ってシッと言いました。"

msgid "Wings flapping"
msgstr "羽ばたき"

msgid "A pigeon flew off."
msgstr "ハトが飛んでいきました。"

msgid "Fall"
msgstr "落下"

msgid "You fell off the wire."
msgstr "綱から落ちました。"

msgid "Safety net"
msgstr "安全ネット"

msgid "The net caught you. You lose a life."
msgstr "ネットが受け止めてくれました。ライフを一つ失います。"

msgid "Climb back"
msgstr "戻る"

msgid "You are back on the wire where you fell."
msgstr "落ちた場所で綱に戻りました。"

msgid "Wire start"
msgstr "綱のはじまり"

msgid "A new wire begins."
msgstr "新しい綱が始まります。"

msgid "Rooftop beacon"
msgstr "屋上の目印"

msgid ""
"A chime from the far rooftop, straight ahead. It grows louder as you get "
"close."
msgstr "正面、向こうの屋上からのチャイム。近づくほど大きくなります。"

msgid "Arrival"
msgstr "到着"

msgid "You stepped onto the far rooftop."
msgstr "向こうの屋上に着きました。"

msgid "Crossing select"
msgstr "コース選択"

msgid ""
"Up and Down choose a crossing, Enter walks it, Escape goes back. Crossings "
"open as you reach them."
msgstr "UpとDownでコースを選び、Enterで渡り、Escapeで戻ります。コースはたどり着くと開きます。"

